#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm.rst:8
msgid "CRM"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Odoo CRM** helps you organize your sales activities: track leads, close "
"opportunities and get accurate forecasts. Keep opportunities organized with "
"the pipeline and manage your day-to-day activities with meetings and next "
"activities."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo CRM** 可助您整理銷售活動：追蹤潛在客戶、促成商機並取得準確預測。您可透"
"過銷售漏斗有條理地管理商機，並利用會議及下一步活動管理日常工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm.rst:15
msgid "`Odoo Tutorials: CRM <https://www.odoo.com/slides/crm-16>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 教學課程：CRM <https://www.odoo.com/slides/crm-16>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads.rst:5
msgid "Acquire leads"
msgstr "獲取潛在客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:3
msgid "Convert leads into opportunities"
msgstr "將潛在客戶轉換為銷售機會"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:5
msgid ""
"When moving opportunities through the *CRM* pipeline, *Leads* act as a "
"qualifying step before a formal opportunity is created. Enabling *Leads* "
"provides additional time to review an opportunity's potential and gauge its "
"viability before it's assigned to a salesperson."
msgstr ""
"在 *CRM* 銷售管道中推進商機時，*線索* 是建立正式商機前的資格審核步驟。啟用 "
"*線索* 可提供額外時間，在將商機指派給銷售人員前，檢視其潛力並評估可行性。"

