#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:14
msgid ""
"To activate the *Leads* setting, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` and check the box labeled, :guilabel:`Leads`. "
"Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"要啟用 *潛在客戶* 設定，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定`，並勾選標示為 :guilabel:`潛在客戶` 的核取方塊，然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲"
"存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:17
msgid "Leads setting on CRM configuration page."
msgstr "CRM 配置頁面上的潛在客戶設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:20
msgid ""
"Activating this feature adds the :guilabel:`Leads` menu option to the header"
" bar located along the top of the screen."
msgstr "啟用此功能後，螢幕頂部的標題欄會新增 :guilabel:`潛在客戶` 選單選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:32
msgid "Leads menu on CRM application."
msgstr "CRM 應用程式中的「線索」選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:26
msgid ""
"Once the *Leads* setting has been activated, it applies to all sales teams "
"by default. To turn off leads for a specific team, navigate to "
":menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Sales Teams`. Then, select a "
"team from the list to open that team's configuration page. Clear the "
":guilabel:`Leads` checkbox, located beneath the :guilabel:`Sales Team` "
"field, then click :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"啟用 *潛在客戶* 設定後，系統預設會將其套用至所有銷售團隊。如要為特定團隊停用"
"潛在客戶功能，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 配置 --> 銷售團隊`。然"
"後從列表中選擇團隊，以開啟該團隊的配置頁面。取消勾選 :guilabel:`潛在客戶` 複"
"選框（位於 :guilabel:`銷售團隊` 欄位下方），然後點擊 :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` "
":guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:36
msgid "Convert a lead into an opportunity"
msgstr "將潛在客戶轉換為商機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:38
msgid ""
"To convert a lead into an *opportunity*, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app"
" --> Leads`, and click on a lead from the list to open it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:42
msgid ""
"Attempting to convert a lead with a 100% probability into an opportunity "
"will result in an error message."
msgstr "嘗試將成功機率為 100% 的潛在客戶轉換為商機時，系統會顯示錯誤訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:45
msgid ""
"The error message that appears when attempting to convert a 100% probability lead into\n"
"an opportunity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:49
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Convert to Opportunity` button, located at the top-left"
" of the page."
msgstr "按一下頁面左上角的:guilabel:`轉換為商機`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:51
msgid "Create opportunity button on a lead record."
msgstr "潛在客戶記錄上的「建立商機」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:54
msgid ""
"This opens a *Convert to opportunity* pop-up. Here, select the "
":guilabel:`Convert to opportunity` option in the :guilabel:`Conversion "
"Action` field."
msgstr ""
"這會開啟 *轉換為商機* 彈出視窗。在此選取 :guilabel:`轉換為商機` 選項（位於 "
":guilabel:`轉換動作` 欄位內）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:57
msgid ""
"Then, select a :guilabel:`Salesperson` and a :guilabel:`Sales Team` to which"
" the opportunity should be assigned. Neither field is required, but if a "
"selection is made in the :guilabel:`Salesperson` field, the :guilabel:`Sales"
" Team` is automatically populated based on the assignee's assigned team."
msgstr ""
"然後，選擇要指派此商機的 :guilabel:`銷售員` 及 :guilabel:`銷售團隊`。兩個欄位"
"均非必填；但如果在 :guilabel:`銷售員` 欄位中作出選擇，:guilabel:`銷售團隊` 便"
"會根據該指派人員所屬的團隊自動填入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:61
msgid ""
"If the lead has already been assigned to a salesperson or a team, these "
"fields automatically populate with that information."
msgstr "如果該潛在客戶已指派給銷售員或團隊，這些欄位會自動填入相關資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:64
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Customer` heading, choose from the following options:"
msgstr "在:guilabel:`客戶`標題下，從以下選項中選擇："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create a new customer`: Choose this option to use the information"
" in the lead to create a new customer record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建立新客戶`：選擇此選項，即可使用潛在客戶中的資訊建立新的客戶記錄"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Link to an existing customer`: Choose this option, then select a "
"customer from the drop-down menu to link this opportunity to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`連結至現有客戶`：選擇此選項，然後從下拉式選單選擇客戶，以連結此商"
"機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:71
msgid ""
"Lastly, when all configurations are complete, click :guilabel:`Create "
"Opportunity`."
msgstr "最後，完成所有設定後，點擊 :guilabel:`建立商機`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:73
msgid "Create opportunity pop-up."
msgstr "建立商機彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:76
msgid ""
"To view the newly created opportunity, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app "
"--> My Pipeline`."
msgstr "如要檢視新建立的商機，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 我的銷售管道`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:79
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:35
msgid "Merging similar leads and opportunities"
msgstr "合併相似的潛在客戶與商機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:81
msgid ""
"If a :guilabel:`Similar Leads` smart button appears at the top of the page "
"for the lead, a similar lead or opportunity already exists in the database. "
"Before converting the current lead, click the smart button to check if the "
"leads should be merged."
msgstr ""
"如果該潛在客戶的頁面頂部出現 :guilabel:`相似潛在客戶` 智能按鈕，即表示資料庫"
"中已存在相似的潛在客戶或商機。在轉換目前的潛在客戶前，請先點擊該智能按鈕，檢"
"查是否應合併這些潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:85
msgid "Close up of a lead with emphasis on the Similar Leads smart button."
msgstr "潛在客戶畫面的特寫，重點顯示「相似潛在客戶」智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:88
msgid ""
"To merge this lead with an existing similar lead or opportunity, click the "
":guilabel:`Convert to Opportunity` button and select :guilabel:`Merge with "
"existing opportunities` in the :guilabel:`Conversion Action` field. This "
"generates a list of the similar leads/opportunities to be merged."
msgstr ""
"要將此潛在客戶與現有的相似潛在客戶或商機合併，請按一下:guilabel:`轉換為商"
"機`按鈕，然後選擇:guilabel:`合併至現有商機`（位於:guilabel:`轉換動作`欄位）。"
"系統隨即會列出可供合併的相似潛在客戶／商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert.rst:93
msgid ""
"When merging, Odoo gives priority to whichever lead/opportunity was created "
"in the system first, merging the information into the first created "
"lead/opportunity. The resulting record is an opportunity."
msgstr ""
"合併時，Odoo 會優先保留系統中最先建立的潛在客戶／商機，並將資訊合併至該最先建"
"立的潛在客戶／商機中。合併後的記錄將成為商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:3
msgid "Create leads (from email or manually)"
msgstr "建立潛在客戶（透過電郵或手動建立）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:8
msgid ""
"Leads can be added to the *CRM* app from custom email aliases, and by "
"manually creating new records. This is in addition to the leads and "
"opportunities created in the app through the :doc:`website contact form "
"<opportunities_form>`."
msgstr ""
"線索可透過自訂電郵別名及手動建立新記錄新增至 *CRM* 應用程式。除透過 :doc:`網"
"站聯絡表格 <opportunities_form>` 在應用程式中建立的線索及商機外，亦可透過此方"
"式新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:12
msgid ""
"First, ensure the *Leads* feature is enabled in the database by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Tick the "
":guilabel:`Leads` checkbox, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"首先，請前往:menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 設定 --> 設定`，確保資料庫已啟"
"用*潛在客戶*功能。勾選:guilabel:`潛在客戶`核取方塊，然後點擊:guilabel:`儲"
"存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:19
msgid "Configure email aliases"
msgstr "設定電郵別名"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each sales team has the option to create and utilize their own unique email "
"alias. When messages are sent to this address, a lead (or opportunity), is "
"created with the information from the message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:25
msgid ""
"To create or update a sales teams' email alias, navigate to "
":menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Sales Teams`. Click on a team "
"from the list to open the team's details page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:28
msgid "The sales team details page, focused on the email alias section."
msgstr "銷售團隊詳情頁面，重點顯示電郵別名部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:32
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Email Alias` field, enter a name for the email alias, or "
"edit the existing name. In the :guilabel:`Accept Emails From` field, use the"
" drop-down menu to choose who is allowed to send messages to this email "
"alias:"
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`電郵別名` 欄位中，輸入電郵別名的名稱，或編輯現有名稱。在 "
":guilabel:`接收電郵來自` 欄位中，使用下拉式選單選擇允許誰傳送訊息至此電郵別名"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Everyone`: messages are accepted from any email address."
msgstr ":guilabel:`所有人`：接受來自任何電郵地址的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Authenticated Partners`: only accepts messages from email "
"addresses associated with a a partner (contact or customer) record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已驗證合作夥伴`：僅接受來自與合作夥伴（聯絡人或客戶）記錄關聯的電"
"郵地址的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Followers only`: only accepts messages from those who are "
"following a record related to the team, such as a lead or opportunity. "
"Messages are also accepted from team members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Authenticated Employees`: only accepts messages from email "
"addresses that are connected to a record in the *Employees* app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已驗證員工`：僅接受來自已連結至 *員工* 應用程式中記錄的電郵地址的"
"訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:45
msgid "Leads created from email"
msgstr "從電郵建立的潛在客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:47
msgid ""
"Leads created from email alias messages can be viewed by navigating to "
":menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads`. Click a lead from the list to open it, "
"and view the details."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 潛在客戶`，即可查看從電郵別名訊息建立的"
"潛在客戶。點擊清單中的潛在客戶以開啟並查看詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:50
msgid ""
"The email received by the alias is added to the *chatter* thread for the "
"lead. The subject line of the message is added to the title field, and the "
":guilabel:`Email` field is updated with the contact's email address."
msgstr ""
"別名收到的電郵會新增至該線索的 *通訊記錄* 討論串中。訊息的主旨行會新增至標題"
"欄位，而 :guilabel:`電郵` 欄位會更新為聯絡人的電郵地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:54
msgid "The chatter thread of a newly created lead in the CRM app."
msgstr "CRM 應用程式中新建立潛在客戶的對話串。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:59
msgid ""
"If the *leads* feature is **not** enabled on the database, messages to the "
"email alias are added to the database as opportunities."
msgstr ""
"如果資料庫 **未** 啟用 *潛在客戶* 功能，傳送至電郵別名的訊息將會以商機形式加"
"入資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:63
msgid ":doc:`../../../general/email_communication`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../general/email_communication`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:66
msgid "Manually create leads"
msgstr "手動建立潛在客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:68
msgid ""
"Leads can be added directly to the *CRM* app by manually creating a new "
"record. Navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads` to view a list of "
"existing leads."
msgstr ""
"透過手動建立新記錄，可直接將潛在客戶加入 *CRM* 應用程式。前往 "
":menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 潛在客戶` 以查看現有潛在客戶清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:72
msgid ""
"Leads can also be added via the :doc:`Generate Leads <lead_mining>` button."
msgstr "亦可透過 :doc:`產生潛在客戶 <lead_mining>` 按鈕新增潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:74
msgid ""
"At the top-left of the list, click :guilabel:`New` to open a blank "
":guilabel:`Leads` form."
msgstr ""
"在清單左上角，按一下 :guilabel:`新增` 以開啟空白的 :guilabel:`潛在客戶` 表單"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:76
msgid ""
"In the first field of the new form, enter a title for the new lead. Next, "
"enter a :guilabel:`Contact Name`, and a :guilabel:`Company Name`."
msgstr ""
"在新表單的第一個欄位中，輸入新潛在客戶的標題。接著，輸入 :guilabel:`聯絡人姓"
"名` 及 :guilabel:`公司名稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:80
msgid ""
"If a lead is :doc:`converted to an opportunity <convert>`, the "
":guilabel:`Company Name` field is used to either link this opportunity to an"
" existing customer, or to create a new customer."
msgstr ""
"如果將線索 :doc:`轉換為商機 <convert>`，:guilabel:`公司名稱` 欄位會用來將此商"
"機連結至現有客戶，或建立新客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:84
msgid "Manually create opportunities"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:86
msgid ""
"To manually create an opportunity, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Sales --> My Pipeline`. At the top-left of the page, click :guilabel:`New` "
"to create a new opportunity Kanban card. In the "
":guilabel:`Organization/Contact` field, enter the name of the company the "
"opportunity is for."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:90
msgid ""
"Choose a name, and enter it in the :guilabel:`Opportunity` field. *This is a"
" required field.* When manually creating an opportunity, it is helpful to "
"add a name that relates to the details of the opportunity."
msgstr ""
"選擇一個名稱，並將其輸入至:guilabel:`商機`欄位。*此為必填欄位。* 手動建立商機"
"時，建議加入與該商機詳情相關的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:95
msgid ""
"In the example below, the opportunity is named `5 VP Chairs`. This "
"identifies the product the customer is interested in, as well as the "
"potential number of products."
msgstr ""
"在以下範例中，該商機命名為 `5 張 VP 椅子`。這可識別客戶感興趣的產品，以及潛在"
"的產品數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:98
msgid "An example of an opportunity in the CRM pipeline."
msgstr "CRM 銷售管道中商機的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:102
msgid ""
"Enter the contact information for the opportunity in the :guilabel:`Email` "
"and :guilabel:`Phone` fields."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`電郵` 及 :guilabel:`電話` 欄位輸入該商機的聯絡資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:105
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Expected Revenue` field, enter an estimated value for the "
"opportunity."
msgstr "在:guilabel:`預期收益`欄位中，輸入該商機的預估金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:108
msgid ""
"The information in the :guilabel:`Expected Revenue` and priority fields can "
"be used to track performance for individual salespeople, and on a team "
"basis. See :doc:`../performance/expected_revenue_report` and "
":doc:`../track_leads/lead_scoring` for more information."
msgstr ""
"可使用 :guilabel:`預期收益` 及優先級欄位的資料，追蹤個別銷售人員及團隊的表現"
"。詳情請參閱 :doc:`../performance/expected_revenue_report` 及 :doc:`../"
"track_leads/lead_scoring`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:113
msgid "Then, use the |st-o| :guilabel:`(star)` icons to assign a priority."
msgstr "然後，使用 |st-o| :guilabel:`（星號）` 圖示指派優先次序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:115
msgid "|st-o| |st-o| |st-o|: low priority"
msgstr "|st-o| |st-o| |st-o|：低優先級"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:116
msgid "|st| |st-o| |st-o|: medium priority"
msgstr "|st| |st-o| |st-o|：中等優先級"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:117
msgid "|st| |st| |st-o|: high priority"
msgstr "|st| |st| |st-o|：高優先級"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:118
msgid "|st| |st| |st|: very high priority"
msgstr "|st| |st| |st|：非常高優先級"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:121
msgid ""
"Assigning a priority changes the order of leads in Kanban view, with higher "
"priority leads displayed first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:124
msgid ""
"Once all the necessary information has been entered, click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "輸入所有必要資料後，點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/email_manual.rst:126
msgid "The CRM pipeline with a newly created opportunity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:3
msgid "Lead mining"
msgstr "潛在客戶挖掘"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:8
msgid ""
"*Lead mining* is a feature that allows *CRM* users to generate new leads "
"directly within their Odoo database. To ensure lead qualification, lead "
"mining output is determined by a variety of filtering criteria, such as the "
"country, the company size, and the industry."
msgstr ""
"*潛在客戶挖掘* 是一項功能，讓 *CRM* 使用者可以直接在其 Odoo 資料庫內產生新的"
"潛在客戶。為確保潛在客戶符合資格，潛在客戶挖掘的輸出結果會根據多項篩選條件決"
"定，例如國家/地區、公司規模及行業。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:15
msgid ""
"To get started, go to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, and select the :guilabel:`Lead Mining` checkbox to activate the "
"feature. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"首先，前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並勾選 "
":guilabel:`潛在客戶挖掘` 核取方塊以啟用該功能。然後，按一下 :guilabel:`儲"
"存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:18
msgid "Activate lead mining in Odoo CRM settings."
msgstr "在 Odoo CRM 設定中啟用潛在客戶挖掘。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:22
msgid "Generate leads"
msgstr "產生潛在客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:25
msgid ""
"If the :doc:`Leads </applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/convert>` feature "
"is not enabled, then lead generation creates opportunities instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:28
msgid ""
"With the *Lead Mining* setting activated, the *Generate Leads* button is "
"added to the upper-left corner of the *CRM* *Pipeline* (:menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Sales --> My Pipeline`). Lead mining requests are also available "
"through :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Lead Mining Requests` "
"and through :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads`, where the "
":guilabel:`Generate Leads` button is also available."
msgstr ""
"啟用 *潛在客戶挖掘* 設定後，*CRM* *銷售管道*（:menuselection:`CRM 應用程"
"式 --> 銷售 --> 我的銷售管道`）的左上角會新增 *產生潛在客戶* 按鈕。你亦可透"
"過 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 配置 --> 潛在客戶挖掘請求` 及 "
":menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 潛在客戶` 存取潛在客戶挖掘請求，該處同樣設"
"有 :guilabel:`產生潛在客戶` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:34
msgid ""
"From any of these locations, click the :guilabel:`Generate Leads` button, "
"and a pop-up window appears."
msgstr "在以上任何位置點擊 :guilabel:`產生潛在客戶` 按鈕，系統即會顯示彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:37
msgid ""
"The pop-up window with the selection criteria in order to generate leads in "
"Odoo."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中用於產生潛在客戶的選擇條件彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:40
msgid ""
"Leads can be generated for :guilabel:`Companies` to get company information "
"only, or for |CC| to get both company information and contact information "
"for individual employees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:43
msgid "Filtering options for generating leads include the following:"
msgstr "產生潛在客戶的篩選選項包括以下項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Countries`: Filter leads based on the country (or countries) they"
" are located in."
msgstr ":guilabel:`國家`：根據線索所在的國家（或多個國家）進行篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`States`: Filter leads even further based on the state in which "
"they are located, if applicable."
msgstr ":guilabel:`州份`：如適用，根據潛在客戶所在的州份進一步篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Industries`: Filter leads based on the specific industry they "
"work in."
msgstr ":guilabel:`行業`：根據潛在客戶所屬的特定行業進行篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filter on Size`: Generates a field labeled :guilabel:`Size`. Fill"
" in the blanks to create a range for the desired company size based on its "
"number of employees."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按規模篩選`：產生一個標示為 :guilabel:`規模` 的欄位。填寫空格，以"
"根據員工人數為所需公司規模建立範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:53
msgid ""
"When using |CC|, generated contacts can also be filtered based on their "
":guilabel:`Role` or :guilabel:`Seniority`."
msgstr ""
"使用 |CC| 時，亦可以根據產生的聯絡人之 :guilabel:`角色` 或 :guilabel:`職級` "
"進行篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:56
msgid ""
"Additionally, there are options for sales team assignment and internal "
"tracking:"
msgstr "此外，還有銷售團隊指派及內部追蹤的選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: Set which Sales Team the leads will be assigned to."
msgstr ":guilabel:`銷售團隊`：設定將潛在客戶指派予哪個銷售團隊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: Set which member of the Sales Team the leads will "
"be assigned to."
msgstr ":guilabel:`銷售員`：設定要將潛在客戶指派給銷售團隊的哪位成員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Tags`: Set which tags are applied directly to the leads "
"once found."
msgstr ":guilabel:`預設標籤`：設定找到潛在客戶後直接套用的標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:63
msgid ""
"If applicable, make sure to be aware of the latest EU regulations when "
"receiving contact information. Learn more about the General Data Protection "
"Regulation on `Odoo GDPR <http://odoo.com/gdpr>`_."
msgstr ""
"如適用，接收聯絡人資料時請務必留意最新的歐盟法規。歡迎前往 `Odoo GDPR "
"<http://odoo.com/gdpr>`_ 了解更多有關《一般資料保護條例》的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:68
msgid "View leads"
msgstr "檢視潛在客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:70
msgid ""
"After leads are generated, they are assigned to the designated salesperson "
"and team. To view additional information regarding the lead, select one from"
" the list and click to open it."
msgstr ""
"產生潛在客戶後，系統會將其指派給指定的銷售人員及團隊。如要檢視有關該潛在客戶"
"的更多資料，請在清單中選擇一項並點擊開啟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:73
msgid ""
"Additional information for the lead is provided in its chatter. This can "
"include the number of employees that work for the lead, the technology it "
"uses, its timezone, and any direct contact information."
msgstr ""
"潛在客戶的通訊欄會提供額外資訊，包括該潛在客戶的員工人數、所使用的技術、時區"
"，以及任何直接聯絡資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:77
msgid "The chatter thread of a newly generated lead."
msgstr "新產生潛在客戶的動態消息串。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:81
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:47
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "定價"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:83
msgid ""
"Lead mining is an *In-App Purchase* service, and each generated lead costs "
"one :ref:`credit <in_app_purchase/credits>`. When using the |CC| option to "
"generate leads, one additional credit is used for each contact generated. "
"See here for complete pricing information: `Lead Generation by Odoo IAP "
"<https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-services/167?>`_. Enterprise Odoo users "
"with a valid subscription get free credits to test |IAP| features before "
"purchasing more credits for the database. This includes demo/training "
"databases, educational databases, and one-app-free databases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:90
msgid ""
"To buy credits, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Lead Generation` section, under the "
":guilabel:`Lead Mining` feature, click :guilabel:`Manage Service & Buy "
"Credits` to go to the Lead Generation Settings page. Click :guilabel:`Buy "
"Credit` to go to the *Odoo IAP* page where you'll be able to buy packs of "
"Lead Generation credits."
msgstr ""
"若要購買點數，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`。在 "
":guilabel:`潛在客戶開發` 區塊中，於 :guilabel:`潛在客戶挖掘` 功能下點擊 "
":guilabel:`管理服務及購買點數` 前往「潛在客戶開發設定」頁面。點擊 "
":guilabel:`購買點數` 前往 *Odoo IAP* 頁面，您可在該處購買潛在客戶開發點數組合"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:96
msgid ""
"Credits may also be purchased by navigating directly to the `Odoo IAP "
"<https://iap.odoo.com/>`_ page and clicking the :guilabel:`Lead Generation` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"您亦可直接前往 `Odoo IAP <https://iap.odoo.com/>`_ 頁面並點擊 :guilabel:`潛在"
"客戶開發` 按鈕來購買點數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:99
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:101
msgid "Buy credits in the Odoo IAP settings."
msgstr "在 Odoo IAP 設定中購買點數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:103
msgid ""
"Credits are **not** interchangeable between IAP services. *Lead Generation* "
"credits may not be spent on other IAP services, and no other IAP credits can"
" be spent on *Lead Generation*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/lead_mining.rst:107
msgid ":doc:`/applications/essentials/in_app_purchase`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/essentials/in_app_purchase`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:3
msgid "Create opportunities from web contact forms"
msgstr "從網頁聯絡表格建立商機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:5
msgid ""
"Adding a contact form to a website makes it easy to convert visitors into "
"leads and opportunities. After a visitor submits their information, an "
"opportunity can be created automatically, and assigned to a designated sales"
" team and salesperson."
msgstr ""
"在網站新增聯絡表格，可輕鬆將訪客轉化為潛在客戶及銷售機會。訪客提交資料後，系"
"統可自動建立銷售機會，並指派給指定的銷售團隊及銷售員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:12
msgid "Customize contact forms"
msgstr "自訂聯絡表格"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:14
msgid ""
"By default, the *Contact Us* page on an Odoo website displays a "
"preconfigured contact form. This form can be customized, as needed, to suit "
"the needs of a specific sales team."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，Odoo 網站上的 *聯絡我們* 頁面會顯示預先設定的聯絡表單。您可按需要"
"自訂此表單，以切合特定銷售團隊的需求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:17
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Website app --> Contact Us`, then click "
":guilabel:`Edit` in the top-right of the screen to open the web editor. "
"Click on the form building block in the body of the webpage to open the form"
" configuration settings on the right sidebar. The following options are "
"available to customize the contact form from the :guilabel:`From` section of"
" the right sidebar:"
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`網站應用程式 --> 聯絡我們`，然後點擊畫面右上角"
"的:guilabel:`編輯`以開啟網頁編輯器。點擊網頁主體中的表單區塊，即可在右側欄開"
"啟表單設定。你可在右側欄的:guilabel:`表單`部分使用以下選項自訂聯絡表單："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:22
msgid "The form configuration settings on an Odoo website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Action`: the default action for a contact form is :guilabel:`Send"
" an Email`. Select :guilabel:`Create an Opportunity` from the drop-down list"
" to capture the information in the *CRM* app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`動作`：聯絡表單的預設動作為 :guilabel:`發送電郵`。從下拉式清單中選"
"擇 :guilabel:`建立商機`，即可在 *CRM* 應用程式中收集相關資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: choose a sales team from the drop-down menu that the"
" opportunities from this form should be assigned to. This field **only** "
"appears if the :guilabel:`Action` field is set to :guilabel:`Create an "
"Opportunity`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: if the opportunities should be assigned to a "
"specific salesperson, select them from the drop-down menu. If no selection "
"is made in this field, the opportunities are assigned based on the team's "
"existing rules."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售人員`：如要將商機指派予特定銷售人員，請從下拉式選單中選擇。如"
"未於此欄位作出選擇，系統會根據團隊的現有規則指派商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Marked Fields`: use this field to alter how the form handles "
"marked fields. The default option is to treat marked fields as "
":guilabel:`Required`, which is the recommended setting."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已標記欄位`：使用此欄位變更表單處理已標記欄位的方式。預設選項為將"
"已標記欄位視為:guilabel:`必填`，這亦是建議設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mark Text`: choose how :guilabel:`Marked Fields` should be "
"identified. The default character is an asterisk (`*`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`標記文字`：選擇如何識別:guilabel:`已標記欄位`。預設字元為星號"
"（`*`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Labels Width`: use this field to alter the pixel width of the "
"labels, if desired."
msgstr ":guilabel:`標籤寬度`：如有需要，可使用此欄位更改標籤的像素寬度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Success`: select how the webpage reacts after a customer "
"successfully submits a form. :guilabel:`Nothing` keeps the customer on the "
"same screen, with the addition of a confirmation message that the form was "
"submitted successfully. :guilabel:`Redirect` sends the customer to a new "
"webpage, based on the address provided in the :guilabel:`URL` field below. "
":guilabel:`Show Message` replaces the form with a preconfigured message that"
" informs the customer someone should respond to them as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`成功時`：選擇客戶成功提交表單後網頁的反應。:guilabel:`無動作` 會讓"
"客戶停留在同一畫面，並顯示表單已成功提交的確認訊息。:guilabel:`重新導向` 會根"
"據下方 :guilabel:`網址` 欄位提供的地址，將客戶導向至新網頁。:guilabel:`顯示訊"
"息` 會以預設訊息取代該表單，通知客戶將盡快有人回覆他們。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL`: if :guilabel:`Redirect` is selected in the :guilabel:`On "
"Success` field, enter the URL for the webpage, where customers should be "
"directed after successfully submitting a form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL`：若選擇:guilabel:`重新導向`作為:guilabel:`成功時`欄位的選項，"
"請輸入客戶成功提交表單後應導向的網頁網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Visibility`: use the drop-down menu to add any visibility "
"conditions for this field, if desired."
msgstr ":guilabel:`可見性`：如有需要，可使用下拉式選單為此欄位加入任何可見性條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:52
msgid ""
"If *leads* are activated in *CRM* settings, selecting :guilabel:`Create an "
"Opportunity` generates a lead instead. To activate leads, navigate to "
":menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and tick the "
":guilabel:`Leads` checkbox. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"如果已在 *CRM* 設定中啟用 *線索*，選擇 :guilabel:`建立商機` 將會改為建立線索"
"。要啟用線索，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並勾選 "
":guilabel:`線索` 核取方塊。然後，按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:57
msgid "Customize contact form fields"
msgstr "自訂聯絡表格欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:59
msgid ""
"In addition to the settings for the form, the settings for each field can be"
" customized, as well. With the web editor menu still open, click into a "
"field to open the :guilabel:`Field` configuration settings section on the "
"sidebar. The following options are available to customize a field:"
msgstr ""
"除了表單設定外，每個欄位的設定亦可自訂。在網站編輯器選單仍開啟的情況下，點擊"
"任何欄位以在側邊欄開啟:guilabel:`欄位`設定區段。自訂欄位時可使用以下選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: choose a custom field option or an existing field type."
msgstr ":guilabel:`類型`：選擇自訂欄位選項或現有的欄位類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Input Type`: determine the type of information customers should "
"input. Available options are :guilabel:`Text`, :guilabel:`Email`, "
":guilabel:`Telephone`, or :guilabel:`Url`. The selection made in this field "
"limits the format that customers can use when entering information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Label`: enter the name for the field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`標籤`：輸入欄位的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Position`: choose the way the label is aligned with the rest of "
"the form. The label can be hidden, above the field, to the left of the "
"field, or right adjusted and closer to the field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: slide the toggle to add a description for the "
"field, which can provide additional instructions to customers. Click under "
"the field on the form to add the description."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Placeholder`: enter an example to help users know how to input "
"information where formatting is important, such as a phone number or email "
"address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Value`: enter a value to include in the form, by default,"
" if the customer does not provide information in the field. *It is not "
"recommended to include a default value for required fields*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預設值`：輸入當客戶未於該欄位提供資訊時，表格預設包含的數值。*不建"
"議為必填欄位設定預設值*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Required`: slide the toggle to mark this field as required if it "
"**must** be filled in for every submission."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`必填`：若每次提交都**必須**填寫此欄位，請滑動切換開關將其標記為必"
"填。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Visibility`: select when this field should be visible. Use the "
"button on the left to choose whether to show or hide this field on a desktop"
" users. Use the button on the right to choose whether to show or hide this "
"field to mobile users."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`可見性`：選擇此欄位應在何時顯示。使用左側按鈕，選擇向桌面用戶顯示"
"或隱藏此欄位。使用右側按鈕，選擇向流動裝置用戶顯示或隱藏此欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:82
msgid ":guilabel:`Animation`: select if this field should have any animation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`動畫`：選擇此欄位是否應套用任何動畫效果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/opportunities_form.rst:84
msgid "The field configuration settings on an Odoo website."
msgstr "Odoo 網站上的欄位設定。"

