#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:3
msgid "Partner autocomplete"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:7
msgid ""
"*Partner autocomplete* is an In-App Purchase (|IAP|) service that enriches "
"business contacts with information and data about that business. In any app "
"or module where a *Contacts* form is encountered, a business's name can be "
"entered into the :guilabel:`Customer` field (`partner_id` technical field) "
"and a suggested company can be chosen from the drop-down menu. With *partner"
" autocomplete*, valuable information and hard-to-find data about companies "
"of all sizes is just a click away."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:14
msgid ""
"The information provided by partner autocomplete can include general "
"information about the business (including full business name and logo), "
":guilabel:`Phone` number, :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Tax ID`, address, "
"and UNSPSC activities as :guilabel:`Tags`."
msgstr ""
"合作夥伴自動填寫提供的資料可包括企業的一般資料（包括完整企業名稱及標誌）"
"、:guilabel:`電話`號碼、:guilabel:`電郵`、:guilabel:`稅務編號`、地址，以及作"
"為:guilabel:`標籤`的 UNSPSC 業務活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:18
msgid ""
"When getting a company's contact information make sure to be aware of the "
"latest EU regulations. For more information about General Data Protection "
"Regulation refer to: `Odoo GDPR <http://odoo.com/gdpr>`_."
msgstr ""
"取得公司的聯絡資料時，請務必留意最新的歐盟法規。有關《一般資料保護規例》（"
"GDPR）的詳情，請參閱：`Odoo GDPR <http://odoo.com/gdpr>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:23
msgid ""
"Partner autocomplete only works for newly created company Contacts. "
"Businesses that already exist in the **Contacts** app cannot be enriched, "
"nor can contacts for people."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:29
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Contacts section`. If the "
":guilabel:`Partner Autocomplete` feature isn't active, tick the checkbox "
"beside it and click :guilabel:`Save` to activate it."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 聯絡人部分`。如果 :guilabel:`合作夥伴自"
"動填寫` 功能尚未啟用，請剔選其旁邊的核取方塊，然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲存` 以啟"
"用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:32
msgid "View of settings page and the activations of the feature in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:36
msgid "Enrich contacts with corporate data"
msgstr "以企業資料豐富聯絡人資訊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:38
msgid ""
"When *partner autocomplete* is enabled, Odoo displays a drop-down menu of "
"potential match suggestions based on the name entered in the new contact "
"form. If one of the suggestions is selected, the contact is populated with "
"relevant data."
msgstr ""
"啟用 *合作夥伴自動完成* 功能後，Odoo 會根據你在新聯絡人表單中輸入的名稱，顯示"
"潛在相符建議的下拉式選單。如選擇其中一項建議，系統便會自動填入聯絡人的相關資"
"料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:42
msgid ""
"Creating a new contact in Odoo with the Partner Autocomplete feature suggesting possible\n"
"businesses."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 建立新聯絡人，並使用「合作夥伴自動完成」功能建議可能符合的\n"
"公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:49
msgid ""
"As an :abbr:`IAP (In-App Purchase)` service, *Partner Autocomplete* requires"
" prepaid credits for each use. Each completed autocomplete request consumes "
"one credit. Enterprise Odoo users with a valid subscription receive "
"complimentary credits to try out |IAP| features for free before purchase. "
"This includes demo and training databases, educational databases, and one-"
"app-free databases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:54
msgid ""
"To buy credits, confirm that :guilabel:`Partner Autocomplete` is enabled as "
"above, then navigate to the **Settings** app and go to the "
":guilabel:`Contacts` section. Then, click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`Manage Service & Buy Credits` under :guilabel:`Partner "
"Autocomplete`. On the :guilabel:`Partner Autocomplete` page, click "
":icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Buy Credit` and the |IAP| page loads. "
"Choose a package and click :guilabel:`Buy` to begin the payment process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:61
msgid ""
"If the database runs out of credits, the only information populated when "
"clicking on the suggested company will be the website link and the logo."
msgstr "如果資料庫的點數用盡，點擊建議的公司時，只會自動填寫網站連結及公司標誌。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/partner_autocomplete.rst:64
msgid "Learn about our `Privacy Policy <https://iap.odoo.com/privacy>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:3
msgid "CRM activities and activity plans"
msgstr "CRM 活動及活動計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:5
msgid ""
"Within the *CRM* app, *activities* are follow-up tasks tied to *leads* and "
"*opportunities* that are visible in the chatter. A set of preconfigured "
"activity types is available in the *CRM* app, but custom activity types may "
"also be created to suit business needs. To view the list of available "
"activity types in the *CRM* app, open the app and navigate to "
":menuselection:`Configuration --> Activity Types`. This page shows both "
"Odoo-created activities and any custom activities."
msgstr ""
"在 *CRM* 應用程式中，*活動* 是與 *潛在客戶* 及 *商機* 關聯的跟進任務，並會顯"
"示在對話紀錄中。*CRM* 應用程式提供一組預設的活動類型，您亦可建立自訂活動類型"
"以配合業務需要。如要在 *CRM* 應用程式查看可用活動類型的清單，請開啟該應用程式"
"並前往 :menuselection:`設定 --> 活動類型`。此頁面會顯示 Odoo 建立的活動及任何"
"自訂活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:12
msgid ""
"Different applications support different activity types. To see the complete"
" list of activity types, go to the :menuselection:`Settings app`, then "
"scroll to the :guilabel:`Discuss` section, and click the :guilabel:`Activity"
" Types` link."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:17
msgid "Default and custom activity types"
msgstr "預設及自訂活動類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:19
msgid "The preconfigured activity types for the *CRM* app are:"
msgstr "*CRM* 應用程式預先配置的活動類型包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email`: Adds a reminder to the chatter prompting the salesperson "
"to send an email."
msgstr ":guilabel:`電郵`：在聊天室新增提醒，提示銷售人員發送電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:22
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Call`: Opens a calendar link where the salesperson can schedule a"
" phone call."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Meeting`: Opens a calendar link where the salesperson can "
"schedule a meeting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:24
msgid ":guilabel:`To Do`: Adds a general reminder task to the chatter."
msgstr ":guilabel:`待辦事項`：在訊息紀錄中新增一般提醒任務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Upload Document`: Adds a link on the activity where an external "
"document can be uploaded. Note that the *Documents* app is **not** required "
"to utilize this activity type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`上載文件`：在活動上新增連結，以便上載外部文件。請注意，使用此活動"
"類型 **並不** 需要 *文件* 應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:29
msgid ""
"If other Odoo applications are installed, such as *Sales* or *Accounting*, "
"additional activity types may appear in the *CRM* app's *Activity Types* "
"page."
msgstr ""
"如果已安裝其他 Odoo 應用程式，例如 *銷售* 或 *會計*，*CRM* 應用程式的 *活動類"
"型* 頁面中可能會出現額外的活動類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:35
msgid "Create a custom activity type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:37
msgid ""
"To create a custom activity type, navigate to the *Activity Types* page and "
"click :guilabel:`New` at the top-left of the page to open a blank form. "
"Start by entering a :guilabel:`Name` for the new activity type."
msgstr ""
"要建立自訂活動類型，請前往*活動類型*頁面，點擊頁面左上角的:guilabel:`新增`以"
"開啟空白表單。首先為新活動類型輸入:guilabel:`名稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:41
msgid "The Activity Type form in its totality."
msgstr "完整的「活動類型」表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:45
msgid "Activity settings"
msgstr "活動設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:58
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:149
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:256
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:307
msgid "Action"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:50
msgid ""
"The *Action* field specifies what action the activity prompts from the "
"salesperson assigned to the opportunity. Some actions trigger specific "
"behaviors after an activity is scheduled instead of when the activity is "
"added to an opportunity."
msgstr ""
"*動作* 欄位會指定該活動會提示獲指派處理商機的銷售員執行甚麼動作。部分動作會在"
"排程活動後觸發特定行為，而非在將活動加入商機時觸發。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:54
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Upload Document` is selected, a link to upload a document is "
"added directly to the planned activity in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"如果選取 :guilabel:`上載文件`，通訊欄中的已安排活動便會直接加入上載文件的連結"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:56
msgid ""
"If either :guilabel:`Phonecall` or :guilabel:`Meeting` are selected, users "
"have the option to open their calendar to schedule a time for this activity."
msgstr ""
"如果選擇了 :guilabel:`致電` 或 :guilabel:`會議`，用戶可以選擇開啟其日曆，為此"
"活動安排時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:58
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Request Signature` is selected, a link is added to the planned"
" activity in the chatter that opens a signature request pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"如選取 :guilabel:`要求簽名`，系統會在通訊欄的已規劃活動中加入連結，開啟要求簽"
"名的彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:62
msgid ""
"The actions available for an activity type may vary depending on the "
"applications currently installed in the database."
msgstr "活動類型可用的操作可能會因應資料庫目前已安裝的應用程式而有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:66
msgid "Default user"
msgstr "預設用戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:68
msgid ""
"To automatically assign this activity to a specific user when this activity "
"type is scheduled, choose a name from the :guilabel:`Default User` drop-down"
" menu. If this field is left blank, the activity is assigned to the user who"
" creates the activity."
msgstr ""
"要在排程此活動類型時自動將活動指派給特定用戶，請從 :guilabel:`預設用戶` 下拉"
"式選單中選擇名稱。如果此欄位留空，活動將會指派給建立活動的用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:73
msgid "Default summary"
msgstr "預設摘要"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:75
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Default Summary` serves as the title for activities when "
"choosing them on opportunities and leads. These will be visible to users "
"such as salespeople and managers, whereas the :guilabel:`Name` at the top of"
" an :guilabel:`Activity Type` form is how the activity appears within the "
"*CRM* app's configuration."
msgstr ""
"在商機及潛在客戶中選擇活動時，:guilabel:`預設摘要`會用作活動的標題，並會顯示"
"予銷售人員及經理等用戶；而 :guilabel:`名稱`（位於 :guilabel:`活動類型` 表單頂"
"部）則是該活動在 *CRM* 應用程式設定中的顯示方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:81
msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "排程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:83
msgid ""
"Set a default deadline for the custom activity in the :guilabel:`Schedule` "
"field. To do so, configure the desired number of :guilabel:`days`, "
":guilabel:`weeks`, or :guilabel:`months`. Then, decide if the deadline "
"should occur :guilabel:`after previous activity completion date` or "
":guilabel:`after previous activity deadline`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`排程` 欄位為自訂活動設定預設截止日期。為此，請設定所需的 "
":guilabel:`天`、:guilabel:`週` 或 :guilabel:`月` 數。然後，決定截止日期應設"
"於 :guilabel:`上一個活動完成日期之後` 或 :guilabel:`上一個活動截止日期之後`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:89
msgid ""
"The default setting of :guilabel:`after previous activity deadline` means "
"the date the deadline is set for, regardless of whether or not the deadline "
"was actually met. To ensure that an activity is scheduled only when the "
"preceding activity is complete, use the :guilabel:`after previous activity "
"completion date` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:95
msgid "Default Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:97
msgid ""
"To include notes whenever this activity type is created, enter them into the"
" :guilabel:`Default Note` field. This can be used to include instructions "
"for another user, as in the sample text in this field."
msgstr ""
"如要在每次建立此活動類型時加入備註，請在 :guilabel:`預設備註` 欄位中輸入內容"
"。這可用於為其他用戶提供指示，正如該欄位中的範例文字所示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:102
msgid ""
"The information in all of the preceding fields is automatically included "
"when an activity is created within an opportunity. However, the info can "
"still be altered before the activity is scheduled or saved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:107
msgid "Next activity"
msgstr "下一個活動"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:109
msgid ""
"To automatically suggest or trigger a new activity after an activity has "
"been marked complete, the :guilabel:`Chaining Type` must be set."
msgstr "要在活動標記為完成後自動建議或觸發新活動，必須設定:guilabel:`串連類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:113
msgid "Suggest the next activity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:115
msgid ""
"If an activity has the :guilabel:`Chaining Type` set to :guilabel:`Suggest "
"Next Activity`, and has activities listed in the :guilabel:`Suggest` field, "
"users are presented with recommendations for activities as next steps."
msgstr ""
"如果活動的 :guilabel:`連結類型` 設為 :guilabel:`建議下一個活動`，而且 "
":guilabel:`建議` 欄位中已列出活動，系統便會向用戶顯示建議活動作為後續步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:119
msgid ""
"The next activity section with the Chaining Type set to Suggest Next "
"Activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:122
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Chaining Type` field, select :guilabel:`Suggest Next "
"Activity`. Upon doing so, the field underneath changes to: "
":guilabel:`Suggest`. Click the :guilabel:`Suggest` field drop-down menu to "
"select any activities to recommend as follow-up tasks to this activity type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:127
msgid "Trigger the next activity"
msgstr "觸發下一個活動"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:129
msgid ""
"When an activity has the :guilabel:`Chaining Type` set to :guilabel:`Trigger"
" Next Activity`, marking the activity as *Done* immediately launches the "
"next activity listed in the :guilabel:`Trigger` field."
msgstr ""
"當活動的:guilabel:`連結類型`設為:guilabel:`觸發下一個活動`時，將該活動標記為 "
"*已完成* 後，系統會立即啟動:guilabel:`觸發`欄位所列的下一個活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:133
msgid ""
"Setting the :guilabel:`Chaining Type` to :guilabel:`Trigger Next Activity` "
"immediately launches the next activity once the previous one is completed."
msgstr ""
"將:guilabel:`連結類型`設為:guilabel:`觸發下一個活動`後，一旦完成上一個活動，"
"便會立即啟動下一個活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:136
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Trigger Next Activity` is selected in the :guilabel:`Chaining "
"Type` field, the field beneath changes to: :guilabel:`Trigger`. From the "
":guilabel:`Trigger` field drop-down menu, select the activity that should be"
" launched once this activity is completed."
msgstr ""
"如果選擇 :guilabel:`觸發下一個活動` 作為 :guilabel:`連鎖類型` 欄位的值，下方"
"的欄位會變更為：:guilabel:`觸發`。在 :guilabel:`觸發` 欄位的下拉式選單中，選"
"取此活動完成後應啟動的活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:140
msgid ""
"The next activity section with the Chaining Type set to Trigger Next "
"Activity."
msgstr "「下一個活動」部分，其連結類型設為「觸發下一個活動」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:144
msgid "Email templates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:146
msgid ""
"Select or create an email template to be suggested when the activity is "
"added to an opportunity. The template will appear alongside the activity in "
"the chatter and can be sent as-is or edited by a user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:151
msgid "Activity tracking"
msgstr "活動追蹤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:153
msgid ""
"To keep the pipeline up to date with the most accurate view of the status of"
" activities, as soon as a lead is interacted with, the associated activity "
"should be marked as *Done*. This ensures the next activity can be scheduled "
"as needed. It also prevents the pipeline from becoming cluttered with past-"
"due activities."
msgstr ""
"為確保銷售管道能時刻反映最準確的活動狀態，與潛在客戶互動後，應立即將相關活動"
"標記為 *已完成*。這樣可確保能按需要安排下一項活動，並防止銷售管道因積壓逾期活"
"動而變得混亂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:158
msgid ""
"The pipeline is most effective when it is kept up-to-date and accurate to "
"the interactions it is tracking."
msgstr "唯有保持銷售管道資訊最新，並準確反映所追蹤的互動紀錄，才能發揮最大效用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:164
msgid "Activity plans"
msgstr "活動計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:166
msgid ""
"*Activity plans* are preconfigured sequences of activities. When an activity"
" plan is launched, every activity in the sequence and any activities set to "
"trigger off of activities within the sequence are scheduled automatically."
msgstr ""
"*活動計劃* 是預先設定的活動序列。啟動活動計劃時，系統會自動排程該序列中的每個"
"活動，以及設定為由序列內活動觸發的任何活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:170
msgid ""
"To create a new plan, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration "
"--> Activity Plans`. Click :guilabel:`New` at the top-left of the page to "
"open a blank :guilabel:`Lead Activity Plans` form."
msgstr ""
"要建立新計劃，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 配置 --> 活動計劃`。點"
"擊頁面左上角的 :guilabel:`新增`，以開啟空白的 :guilabel:`潛在客戶活動計劃` 表"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:174
msgid ""
"Enter a name for the new plan in the :guilabel:`Plan Name` field. On the "
":guilabel:`Activities To Create` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line` to add a "
"new activity."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`計劃名稱` 欄位輸入新計劃的名稱。在 :guilabel:`要建立的活動` 分"
"頁，按一下 :guilabel:`新增一行` 以新增活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:177
msgid ""
"Select an :guilabel:`Activity Type` from the drop-down menu. Click "
":guilabel:`Search More` to see a complete list of available activity types, "
"or to create a :ref:`new one <crm/create-new-activity-type>`."
msgstr ""
"從下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`活動類型`。按一下 :guilabel:`搜尋更多` 即可查看"
"所有可用活動類型的完整清單，或建立 :ref:`新活動類型 <crm/create-new-activity-"
"type>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:181
msgid ""
"Next, in the :guilabel:`Summary` field, either leave this blank to use "
"activity's *Default Summary* or enter a new summary of what the activity "
"entails. Entering a new summary does not overwrite an existing Default "
"Summary. The contents of this field are included with the scheduled "
"activity, and can be edited later."
msgstr ""
"接著，在 :guilabel:`摘要` 欄位中，您可以留空以使用活動的 *預設摘要*，或輸入活"
"動內容的新摘要。輸入新摘要不會覆寫現有的預設摘要。此欄位的內容會隨已排程的活"
"動一併顯示，並可於稍後編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:186
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Assignment` field, select one of the following options:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`指派` 欄位中，選擇以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:188
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ask at launch`: Activities are assigned to a user when the plan "
"is scheduled. By default, they will be assigned to the user creating the "
"activity, even if they're not the user responsible for the opportunity the "
"activity is being created on."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`啟動時詢問`：系統會在排程計劃時將活動指派給使用者。預設情況下，活"
"動會指派給建立活動的使用者，即使該使用者並非負責相關商機的人員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default user`: Activities are always assigned to a specific user."
msgstr ":guilabel:`預設用戶`：活動一律指派給特定用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:193
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Default user` is selected in the :guilabel:`Assignment` field,"
" choose a user in the :guilabel:`Assigned to` field."
msgstr ""
"若選擇 :guilabel:`預設用戶` 作為 :guilabel:`指派` 欄位的選項，請在 "
":guilabel:`指派給` 欄位中選擇一位用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:197
msgid ""
"Activity plans can feature activities that are assigned to default users and"
" users assigned at the plan launch."
msgstr "活動計劃可包含指派給預設用戶及在啟動計劃時所指定用戶的活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:200
msgid "A blank Lead Activity Plan form."
msgstr "空白的潛在客戶活動計劃表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:203
msgid ""
"Next, configure the timeline for the activity. Activities can be scheduled "
"to occur either before the plan date or after. Scheduling activities before "
"the plan date can be useful for activities scheduled in the future that "
"require some preparation beforehand. Use the :guilabel:`Interval` and "
":guilabel:`Units` fields to set the deadline for this activity. Lastly, in "
"the :guilabel:`Trigger` field, select whether the activity should occur "
"before or after the plan date."
msgstr ""
"接著，配置活動的時間軸。活動可排程於計劃日期之前或之後發生。對於排程在未來且"
"需要事先準備的活動，將其設於計劃日期之前會相當實用。使用 :guilabel:`間隔` 及 "
":guilabel:`單位` 欄位來設定此活動的截止日期。最後，在 :guilabel:`觸發條件` 欄"
"位中，選擇活動應於計劃日期之前還是之後發生。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:210
msgid ""
"An activity plan is created to handle high priority leads. Specifically, "
"these leads should be contacted quickly, with a meeting scheduled within two"
" days of the initial contact. The plan is configured with the following "
"activities:"
msgstr ""
"系統已建立活動計劃以處理高優先級的潛在客戶。具體而言，應盡快聯絡這些潛在客戶"
"，並在首次聯絡後的兩天內安排會議。該計劃配置了以下活動："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:214
msgid "Email two days **before** plan date"
msgstr "在計劃日期**前**兩天發送電郵"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:215
msgid "Meeting zero days **before** plan date"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:216
msgid "Make quote three days **after** plan date"
msgstr "在計劃日期 **之後** 三日建立報價單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:217
msgid "Upload document three days **after** plan date"
msgstr "在計劃日期 **後** 三天上載文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:218
msgid "Follow-up five days **after** plan date"
msgstr "在計劃日期**後**五天跟進"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:220
msgid ""
"This sets the *plan date* as the meeting deadline, which is the objective of"
" the plan. Before that date, there is lead time to contact the customer and "
"prepare for the meeting. After that date, the salesperson has time to create"
" a quote, upload the document, and follow-up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:224
msgid "Repeat these steps for each activity included in the plan."
msgstr "為計劃中包含的每項活動重複這些步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:227
msgid "Use an activity plan"
msgstr "使用活動計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:229
msgid ""
"To use an activity plan with a *CRM* opportunity, navigate to "
":menuselection:`CRM app` and click on the Kanban card of an opportunity to "
"open it."
msgstr ""
"如要在 *CRM* 商機中使用活動計劃，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式`，並點選"
"商機的看板卡片以開啟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:232
msgid ""
"Above the opportunity's chatter, click :guilabel:`Activity` to open the "
":guilabel:`Schedule Activity` pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:235
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Plan` field, select the desired activity plan to launch "
"from the section above the individual activities. This generates a "
":guilabel:`Plan Summary`, listing out the activities included in the plan. "
"Select a :guilabel:`Due Date` using the calendar popover. This automatically"
" updates the :guilabel:`Plan summary` with deadlines based on the intervals "
"configured in the :ref:`activity plan <crm/activity-plans>`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`計劃` 欄位中，從個別活動上方的部分選擇要啟動的活動計劃。這會產"
"生 :guilabel:`計劃摘要`，列出計劃中所包含的活動。使用彈出式日曆選擇 "
":guilabel:`到期日`。這會自動更新 :guilabel:`計劃摘要`，根據:ref:`活動計劃 "
"<crm/activity-plans>`中設定的時間間隔填入截止日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:241
msgid ""
"Select a user in the :guilabel:`Responsible` field. This user is assigned to"
" any of the activities on the plan that were configured with :guilabel:`Ask "
"at launch` in the :guilabel:`Assignment` field."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`負責人` 欄位選擇一位用戶。計劃中凡設為 :guilabel:`啟動時詢"
"問`（:guilabel:`指派` 欄位）的活動，都會指派給此用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:244
msgid "The schedule activity pop-up window with an Activity plan selected."
msgstr "已選取活動計劃的「安排活動」彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:247
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Schedule`. The details of the plan are added to the "
":guilabel:`Planned Activities` section of the chatter, in addition to each "
"of the activities that make up the plan."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`安排`。除了構成該計劃的各項活動外，計劃的詳細資料亦會加入至"
"通訊欄的 :guilabel:`已計劃活動` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:250
msgid "The chatter thread of a CRM opportunity with a launched activity plan."
msgstr "已啟動活動計劃的 CRM 商機對話串。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:254
msgid ":doc:`Activities </applications/essentials/activities>`"
msgstr ":doc:`活動 </applications/essentials/activities>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/utilize_activities.rst:255
msgid ""
":doc:`Email templates </applications/general/companies/email_template>`"
msgstr ":doc:`電郵範本 </applications/general/companies/email_template>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance.rst:5
msgid "Analyze performance"
msgstr "分析表現"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:3
msgid "Expected revenue report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Expected revenue* is the total cash value of leads that are expected to "
"close by a certain date, usually the end of the current month."
msgstr "*預期收益* 是預計在特定日期（通常是本月底）前成交的潛在客戶總現金價值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:8
msgid ""
"An *expected revenue report* compiles all active leads in a sales pipeline "
"that have a set expected closing date, and compares how sales teams are "
"performing in a given time frame."
msgstr ""
"*預期收益報告*匯總了銷售管道中所有已設定預計結案日期的活躍線索，並比較各銷售"
"團隊在指定時間範圍內的表現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:11
msgid "Close up of the expected closing date on a lead in the CRM app."
msgstr "CRM 應用程式中潛在客戶預期成交日期的特寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:15
msgid ""
"By pulling a monthly expected revenue report, sales managers can see which "
"team members are reaching their goals, and who may need additional "
"assistance to close valuable deals."
msgstr ""
"透過擷取每月預期收益報表，銷售經理可以查看哪些團隊成員正達成目標，以及誰可能"
"需要額外協助以完成重要交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:19
msgid "Create an expected revenue report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:21
msgid ""
"To create an expected revenue report, first navigate to :menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Reporting --> Pipeline`. This opens the :guilabel:`Pipeline "
"Analysis` dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:25
msgid ""
"The *Pipeline Analysis* dashboard includes several filters in the search bar"
" by default. Remove these before adding any additional custom filters."
msgstr ""
"*銷售管道分析* 儀表板的搜尋欄預設包含多個篩選器。在新增任何其他自訂篩選器之前"
"，請先移除這些篩選器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:28
msgid ""
"On the top-left of the report, click :guilabel:`Measures`, then select "
":guilabel:`Expected Revenue` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"在報表左上方按一下:guilabel:`計量`，然後從下拉式選單中選取:guilabel:`預期收"
"入`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:31
msgid ""
"At the top of the page, click the :guilabel:`🔻(triangle pointed down)` icon "
"to the right of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to open the drop-down menu "
"that contains :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, and "
":guilabel:`Favorites` columns. Under the :guilabel:`Filters` column, click "
":guilabel:`Add Custom Filter`, which opens an :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` "
"pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:39
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:53
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:68
msgid "Add custom filters"
msgstr "新增自訂篩選條件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:41
msgid ""
"In order to generate an expected revenue report, filters need to be created "
"for the following conditions:"
msgstr "為產生預期收入報表，需要針對以下條件建立篩選器："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:44
msgid ""
":ref:`Expected closing date <expected_revenue_report/closing-date>`: limits "
"results to only include leads expected to close within a specific time "
"frame."
msgstr ""
":ref:`預計結束日期 <expected_revenue_report/closing-date>`：限制結果只包括預"
"計於特定時間範圍內完成的潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:46
msgid ""
":ref:`Exclude unassigned leads <expected_revenue_report/unassigned-leads>`: "
"excludes leads without an assigned salesperson."
msgstr ""
":ref:`排除未指派的潛在客戶 <expected_revenue_report/unassigned-leads>`：排除"
"尚未指派銷售人員的潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:48
msgid ""
":ref:`Specific sales teams <expected_revenue_report/sales-team>`: limits "
"results to only include leads assigned to one or more sales teams. This "
"filter is optional and should not be included if the report is intended for "
"the entire company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:55
msgid "Add filter for expected closing date"
msgstr "加入預計結案日期的篩選器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:57
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window, click into the first "
"field of the new rule. Type `Expected Closing` into the "
":guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll to select it from the list. Click in "
"the second field and select :guilabel:`is set`. This limits the results to "
"only include leads where an estimated closing date is listed."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`新增自訂篩選`彈出視窗中，點擊新規則的第一個欄位。在:guilabel:`搜"
"尋...`欄輸入 `預計結束`，或捲動並在清單中選取。點擊第二個欄位並選"
"擇:guilabel:`已設定`。這樣可將結果限制為僅包含已列出預計結束日期的潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:62
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`➕ (plus)` icon to the right of the rule to "
"duplicate it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:65
msgid ""
"Using the :guilabel:`➕ (plus)` icon makes it easy to add multiple rules "
"based on the same filter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:68
msgid ""
"In the second field of the new rule, select :guilabel:`is between` from the "
"drop-down menu. This creates a set time frame during which the expected "
"closing date must occur for leads to be included in the results."
msgstr ""
"在新規則的第二個欄位中，從下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`介於`。這會設定一個時間"
"範圍，預期成交日期必須落於此範圍內，潛在客戶才會包含在結果中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:72
msgid ""
"Click in each date field, one at a time, and use the calendar popover window"
" to add both a start and end date to the rule. This is usually the beginning"
" and ending of the current month, or fiscal quarter."
msgstr ""
"逐一點擊每個日期欄位，並使用彈出式行事曆視窗為規則新增開始及結束日期。這通常"
"是當月或財政季度的開始及結束日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:79
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:117
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:107
msgid "Exclude unassigned leads"
