#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:81
msgid ""
"After filtering for the expected closing date, add a :guilabel:`New Rule`. "
"Then, click into the new rule's first field, and type `Salesperson` in the "
":guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll through the list to select it. Click in"
" the rule's second field and select :guilabel:`is set` from the drop-down "
"menu. This excludes any results without an assigned salesperson."
msgstr ""
"篩選預期成交日期後，新增 :guilabel:`新增規則`。接著點擊新規則的第一個欄位，"
"在 :guilabel:`搜尋...` 列中輸入 `銷售員`，或捲動清單並選取該項目。點擊規則的"
"第二個欄位，從下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`已設定`。這樣可排除任何未指派銷售員"
"的結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:89
msgid "Add a filter for sales teams"
msgstr "為銷售團隊新增篩選器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:92
msgid ""
"This filter is optional. To view results for the entire company, do **not** "
"add this filter, and continue to :ref:`View results "
"<expected_revenue_report/view-results>`."
msgstr ""
"此篩選器為可選。如要查看整間公司的結果，請 **勿** 新增此篩選器，並直接前往 "
":ref:`查看結果 <expected_revenue_report/view-results>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:95
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:103
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:125
msgid ""
"To limit the results of the report to one or more sales teams, click "
":guilabel:`New Rule`. Next, click the first field for the new rule, and type"
" `Sales Team` in the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll to search through "
"the list to locate it."
msgstr ""
"要將報表結果限制為一個或多個銷售團隊，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增規則`。接著，點擊"
"新規則的第一個欄位，在 :guilabel:`搜尋...` 欄中輸入 `銷售團隊`，或捲動清單以"
"搜尋並找出該項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:99
msgid ""
"In the rule's second field, select :guilabel:`is in` from the drop-down "
"menu. Selecting this operator limits results to the sales teams indicated in"
" the next field."
msgstr ""
"在規則的第二個欄位中，從下拉式選單選取:guilabel:`包含於`。選取此運算子會將結"
"果限制為下一個欄位中指定的銷售團隊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:102
msgid ""
"Lastly, click into the third field, and either: make a selection from the "
"complete list revealed in the popover menu, or type the first few characters"
" of the specific sales team's title to quickly find and select it as a "
"parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:107
msgid ""
"Multiple teams can be added to the `Sales Team` rule, where each parameter "
"is treated with an \"or\" (e.g. \"any\") operator in the search logic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:110
msgid ""
"Add Custom Filters pop-up window with custom filters configured for expected revenue\n"
"report."
msgstr ""
"為預期收益報告設定自訂篩選條件的「新增自訂篩選」\n"
"彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:118
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:87
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:145
msgid "View results"
msgstr "檢視結果"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:120
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:193
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:147
msgid ""
"At the top of the :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` form, there is an option to "
"match :guilabel:`any` or :guilabel:`all` of the rules. In order to properly "
"run the report, only records that match **all** of the following filters "
"should be included. Before adding the filters, make sure :guilabel:`all` is "
"selected in this field."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`新增自訂篩選` 表單頂部，有一個選項可設定符合 :guilabel:`任何` "
"或 :guilabel:`所有` 規則。為確保正確執行報表，應只包含符合以下 **所有** 篩選"
"條件的紀錄。加入篩選條件前，請確保此欄位已選擇 :guilabel:`所有`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:125
msgid ""
"Emphasis on the match all filters option on the Add Custom Filter pop-up "
"window."
msgstr "重點顯示「新增自訂篩選條件」彈出式視窗中的「符合所有篩選條件」選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:129
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` form, click "
":guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`新增自訂篩選` 表單底部，點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:132
msgid "View options"
msgstr "檢視選項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:134
msgid ""
"The expected revenue report benefits from utilizing multiple views. The "
"default graph view can be used to identify which salespeople are expected to"
" bring in the most revenue, while the list view and pivot view provide more "
"detail on specific deals."
msgstr ""
"預期收入報表適合配合多種檢視方式使用。預設的圖表檢視可用於識別哪些銷售員預計"
"能帶來最多收入，而清單檢視和樞紐分析檢視則可提供特定交易的更多詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:140
msgid "Graph view"
msgstr "圖表檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:142
msgid ""
"The *graph view* is used to visualize data, and is beneficial in identifying"
" patterns and trends."
msgstr "*圖表檢視* 用於將數據視覺化，有助識別模式及趨勢。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:145
msgid ""
"*Bar charts* are used to show the distribution of data across several "
"categories or among several salespeople."
msgstr "*棒形圖*用於顯示資料在多個類別或多名銷售人員之間的分佈情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:148
msgid ""
"*Line charts* are useful to show changing trends over a period of time."
msgstr "*折線圖* 有助於顯示一段時間內的變化趨勢。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:150
msgid ""
"*Pie charts* are useful to show the distribution, or comparison, of data "
"among a small number of categories or salespeople, specifically how they "
"form the meaningful part of a whole picture."
msgstr ""
"*圓餅圖*適合用於顯示少數類別或銷售人員之間的數據分佈或比較，特別是呈現各部分"
"如何構成整體的重要組成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:154
msgid ""
"The default view for the expected revenue report is the bar chart, stacked. "
"To change to a different graph view, click one of the icons at the top-left "
"of the report. While both the line chart and bar chart are available in "
"stacked view, the pie chart is not."
msgstr ""
"預期收益報表的預設檢視方式為堆疊柱狀圖。要切換至其他圖表檢視，請按一下報表左"
"上角的其中一個圖示。折線圖及柱狀圖均提供堆疊檢視，但圓形圖則不提供。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:158
msgid ""
"Close up view of the graph icons on the Pipeline analysis report in the CRM "
"app."
msgstr "CRM 應用程式中管道分析報表上圖表圖示的特寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:162
msgid "Graph view icons in order: bar chart, line chart, pie chart, stacked."
msgstr "圖表檢視圖示順序為：柱狀圖、折線圖、圓餅圖、堆疊圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:164
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:241
msgid "List view"
msgstr "清單檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:166
msgid ""
"The *list view* provides a list of all leads that are expected to close by "
"the designated date. Clicking on a lead in list view opens the record for "
"detailed analysis, but many insights can be gleaned from the basic view."
msgstr ""
"*列表檢視* 會列出所有預計於指定日期前成交的潛在客戶。在列表檢視中點擊潛在客戶"
"可開啟記錄進行詳細分析，但從基本檢視中亦已可獲取多項深入資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:170
msgid ""
"To switch to the list view, click the :guilabel:`≣ (list)` icon at the top-"
"right of the report."
msgstr "要切換至列表檢視，請點擊報表右上角的 :guilabel:`≣ (列表)` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:173
msgid "Close up of the list view icon in the CRM app."
msgstr "CRM 應用程式中列表檢視圖示的特寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:177
msgid ""
"To add additional metrics to the report, click the *additional options menu*"
" indicated by the :guilabel:`toggle` icon at the top-right of the list."
msgstr ""
"如要在報表加入其他指標，請按一下清單右上角以 :guilabel:`切換` 圖示標示的 *其"
"他選項選單*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:180
msgid "Close up of the toggle icon in the CRM app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:184
msgid ""
"Clicking the toggle icon in *list view* opens the *additional options menu*."
msgstr "在 *列表檢視* 中點擊切換圖示，即可開啟 *其他選項選單*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:186
msgid ""
"Select any additional metrics from the drop-down menu to add them to the "
"list view. Some options that may be useful are :guilabel:`Expected Closing` "
"and :guilabel:`Probability`."
msgstr ""
"從下拉式選單中選擇任何額外指標，將其新增至列表檢視。部分實用選項包括 "
":guilabel:`預計成交` 及 :guilabel:`可能性`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:189
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:215
msgid "Pivot view"
msgstr "樞紐分析檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:191
msgid ""
"The *pivot view* arranges all leads that are expected to close by the "
"designated date into a dynamic table."
msgstr "*樞紐分析檢視*會將預計於指定日期前成交的所有線索，整理成動態表格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:194
msgid ""
"To switch to the pivot view, click the :guilabel:`Pivot` icon at the top-"
"right of the report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:196
msgid "Close up of the pivot view icon in the CRM app."
msgstr "CRM 應用程式中樞紐分析表檢視圖示的特寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:200
msgid ""
"When the pivot view is selected for this report, the X-axis lists the stages"
" in the pipeline, while the Y-axis defaults to group the results by their "
"creation date. To switch these groupings, click the flip access icon "
"(:guilabel:`⇄`) at the top of the report."
msgstr ""
"當為此報表選擇樞紐分析檢視時，X 軸會列出銷售管道中的階段，而 Y 軸預設會按建立"
"日期將結果分組。若要切換這些分組方式，請點擊報表頂部的翻轉軸線圖示"
"（:guilabel:`⇄`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:204
msgid ""
"To add additional measures to the report, click the :guilabel:`Measures` "
"button at the top-left of the report. Select any additional metrics from the"
" drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"若要在報表中新增其他計量，請按一下報表左上角的:guilabel:`計量`按鈕。從下拉式"
"選單中選擇任何其他指標。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:207
msgid ""
"To add a group to a row or column to the pivot view, click the :guilabel:`➕ "
"(plus sign)` next to :guilabel:`Total`, and then select one of the groups. "
"To remove one, click the :guilabel:`➖ (minus sign)` and de-select the "
"appropriate option."
msgstr ""
"要在樞紐分析視圖的列或欄新增群組，請點擊 :guilabel:`➕（加號）`（位於 "
":guilabel:`總計` 旁），然後選擇其中一個群組。若要移除群組，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`➖（減號）` 並取消選取相應選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/expected_revenue_report.rst:211
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Insert in Spreadsheet` to add the pivot view into an "
"editable spreadsheet format within the *Dashboards* app. If the Odoo "
"*Documents* app is installed, the report can be inserted into a blank or "
"existing spreadsheet, and exported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:3
msgid "Forecast report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:9
msgid ""
"The *Forecast* report in the *CRM* app allows users to view upcoming "
"opportunities and build a forecast of potential sales. Opportunities are "
"grouped by the month of their expected closing date, and can be dragged-and-"
"dropped to adjust the deadline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:13
msgid ""
"To access the *Forecast* report, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Reporting --> Forecast`."
msgstr "要存取 *預測* 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 報告 --> 預測`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:16
msgid "Navigate the forecast report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:18
msgid ""
"The default :guilabel:`Forecast` report includes opportunities assigned to "
"the current user's pipeline, and are expected to close within four months. "
"It also shows opportunities without an assigned expected closing date. The "
"opportunities are grouped by month in a :icon:`oi-view-kanban` "
":guilabel:`(Kanban)` view."
msgstr ""
"預設的 :guilabel:`預測` 報表包含已指派給目前使用者銷售流程，且預計在四個月內"
"成交的商機。報表亦會顯示未指派預計成交日期的商機。這些商機在 :icon:`oi-view-"
"kanban` :guilabel:`（看板）` 檢視中按月分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:23
msgid "A sample version of the Forecast report in the CRM app."
msgstr "CRM 應用程式中預測報告的範例版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:28
msgid "Expected closing date"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:30
msgid ""
"Opportunities are grouped by the date assigned in the *Expected Closing* "
"field on an opportunity form. To change this date directly from the "
":guilabel:`Forecast` page, select the Kanban card for the desired "
"opportunity, then click and drag the card to the desired column."
msgstr ""
"商機是按商機表單上 *預計結案* 欄位所指定的日期分組。如要直接在 :guilabel:`預"
"測` 頁面更改此日期，請選擇所需商機的看板卡片，然後點擊並將卡片拖曳至所需的直"
"欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:35
msgid ""
"The default time frame for the forecast is *month*. This can be changed by "
"clicking the |caret| next to the :guilabel:`Search...` bar at the top of the"
" report. Under the :guilabel:`Group By` heading in the resulting drop-down "
"menu, click :guilabel:`Expected Closing` to expand the list of available "
"options, and select a desired amount of time from the list."
msgstr ""
"預測的預設時間範圍為 *月*。要更改此設定，可按一下報表頂部的 |caret|（位於 "
":guilabel:`搜尋...` 列旁）。在隨即顯示的下拉式選單中的 :guilabel:`分組依據` "
"標題下，按一下 :guilabel:`預期完成日期` 以展開可用選項清單，然後從清單中選擇"
"所需的時間範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:40
msgid ""
"After an opportunity is added to a new month, the *Expected Closing* field "
"on the opportunity form is updated to the *last* date of the new month."
msgstr ""
"將商機新增至新的月份後，商機表單上的 *預計結案* 欄位會更新為新月份的 *最後* "
"一天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:44
msgid ""
"The *Expected Closing* field can also be manually updated on the opportunity"
" card. To do that, click on the Kanban card for an opportunity on the "
":guilabel:`Forecast` page to open the opportunity's detail form. Click in "
"the :guilabel:`Expected Closing` field, and use the calendar popover to "
"select a new closing date."
msgstr ""
"*預計結束* 欄位亦可在商機卡片上手動更新。為此，請點擊 :guilabel:`預測` 頁面上"
"的商機看板卡片，以開啟商機的詳細資料表單。點擊 :guilabel:`預計結束` 欄位，然"
"後使用日曆彈出視窗選擇新的結束日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:50
msgid "Prorated revenue"
msgstr "按比例計算的收入"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:52
msgid ""
"The prorated revenue is the :guilabel:`Expected Revenue` amount that is "
"displayed at the top of the column for each month on the "
":guilabel:`Forecast` reporting page. This value is situated to the right of "
"the progress bar. The calculation for :guilabel:`Expected Revenue` is the "
"total of the prorated revenue specific to that particular time frame."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:57
msgid "The prorated revenue is calculated using the formula below:"
msgstr "按比例計算的收益採用以下公式計算："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:59
msgid ""
"\\text{Expected Revenue} \\times \\text{Probability} = \\text{Prorated "
"Revenue}"
msgstr "\\text{預期收入} \\times \\text{機率} = \\text{按比例計算的收入}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:63
msgid ""
"As opportunities are moved from one column to another, the column's revenue "
"is automatically updated to reflect the change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:67
msgid "A forecast report for June includes two opportunities:"
msgstr "六月的預測報表包含兩個商機："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:69
msgid ""
"The first opportunity, `Global Solutions`, has an expected revenue of "
"`$3,800`, and a probability of `90%`. This results in a prorated revenue of "
"`$3,420`."
msgstr ""
"第一個商機 `Global Solutions` 的預期收益為 `$3,800`，成交機率為 `90%`，因此按"
"比例計算的收益為 `$3,420`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:72
msgid ""
"The second opportunity, `Quote for 600 Chairs`, has an expected revenue of "
"`$22,500`, and a probability of `20%`. This results in a prorated revenue of"
" `$4,500`."
msgstr ""
"第二個商機 `600 張椅子報價` 的預期收益為 `$22,500`，成交機率為 `20%`。這會得"
"出按比例計算的收益為 `$4,500`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:75
msgid ""
"The combined prorated revenue of the opportunities is `$7,920`, which is "
"listed at the top of the column for the month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:78
msgid ""
"An example of the prorated revenue for one month of the forecast report."
msgstr "預測報表中一個月按比例計算收入的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:83
msgid ""
"For more information on how probability is assigned to opportunities, see "
":doc:`../track_leads/lead_scoring`"
msgstr ""
"有關系統如何為商機指派成交機率的詳細資料，請參閱 :doc:`../track_leads/"
"lead_scoring`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:89
