"圖）`、:icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`（折線圖）` 或 :icon:`fa-pie-chart` "
":guilabel:`（圓餅圖）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:94
