"。你可以選擇多個指標，並按月份及商機階段檢視數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:105
msgid "A sample of the forecast report in the pivot view."
msgstr "樞紐分析檢視中預測報告的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/forecast_report.rst:110
msgid "To save this report as a *favorite*, see :ref:`search/favorites`."
