#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:3
msgid "Pipeline Analysis"
msgstr "銷售管道分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **CRM** app manages the sales pipeline as leads and opportunities move "
"from stage to stage, ultimately being either won or lost. After organizing "
"the pipeline, the search options and reports available on the *Pipeline "
"Analysis* page can be used to gain insight into the effectiveness of "
"campaigns, salespeople, and more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:11
msgid ""
"The **CRM** app supports using leads as an intermediate qualifying step "
"before creating a formal opportunity. For the purposes of this article, the "
"term *opportunity* is used, but the information applies to leads as well. "
"This article assumes :ref:`leads have been enabled <crm/configure-leads>` in"
" the **CRM** app's configuration settings."
msgstr ""
"**CRM** 應用程式支援使用潛在客戶作為建立正式商機前的中介資格審查步驟。為方便"
"閱讀，本文將統一使用 *商機* 一詞，但相關資訊同樣適用於潛在客戶。本文假設你已"
"在 **CRM** 應用程式的配置設定中 :ref:`啟用潛在客戶 <crm/configure-leads>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:19
msgid "Pipeline analysis reports"
msgstr "銷售管道分析報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:21
msgid ""
"To view the *Pipeline Analysis* page, go to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Reporting --> Pipeline`. A stacked bar chart showcasing all opportunities "
"created during the current year automatically loads. The bars represent the "
"number of opportunities currently in each stage of the sales pipeline, "
"color-coded to show the month the opportunity reached that stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:26
msgid ""
"The default state of the Pipeline Analysis report is a graph, with many options to change\n"
"it."
msgstr ""
"銷售管道分析報表的預設狀態為圖表，並提供多種選項以作\n"
"更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:30
msgid ""
"The interactive elements of the :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` page "
"manipulate the graph to report different metrics in different views. View "
"options are in the upper-right corner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:33
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`Graph` view: Displays the total number of "
"opportunities in a bar graph, allowing for quick visual comparisons of "
"opportunities across CRM stages. This is the default view."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`圖表` 檢視模式：以棒形圖顯示商機總數，方便快"
"速視覺化比較不同 CRM 階段的商機數量。此為預設檢視模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:36
msgid ""
":icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`Pivot` view: Displays the detailed "
":guilabel:`Expected Revenue` by both stage and month in a customizable "
"table. This can be modified to display information into more detailed "
"categories, such as salesperson, campaign, and more."
msgstr ""
":icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`樞紐分析`檢視：在可自訂的表格中，按階段及月"
"份顯示詳細的:guilabel:`預期收益`。此檢視可修改為按更詳細的類別顯示資料，例如"
"銷售人員、宣傳活動等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:39
msgid ""
":icon:`oi-view-cohort` :guilabel:`Cohort` view: Displays and organizes the "
"data based on their :guilabel:`Created on` and :guilabel:`Closed Date` day, "
"week, month, quarter, or year. This allows for easy identification of "
"patterns over certain time periods. Week is the default setting."
msgstr ""
":icon:`oi-view-cohort` :guilabel:`群組分析`檢視：根據項目的:guilabel:`建立日"
"期`及:guilabel:`關閉日期`的日、週、月、季或年顯示及整理數據，方便識別特定時間"
"段內的模式。預設設定為「週」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:42
msgid ""
":icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`List` view: Displays the opportunities in a "
"detailed list, allowing for easy viewing of detailed individual records."
msgstr ""
":icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`清單` 檢視：以詳細清單顯示商機，方便查閱個別"
"記錄的詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:21
msgid "Filters and groupings"
msgstr "篩選條件與分組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:50
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` page can be customized with various "
"filters and grouping options."
msgstr "可使用各種篩選器和分組選項自訂 :guilabel:`銷售管道分析` 頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:53
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:87
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:29
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "篩選條件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:55
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:31
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` section allows users to add pre-"
"made and custom filters to the search criteria. Multiple filters can be "
"added to a single search."
msgstr ""
"透過 :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 部分，用戶可將預設及自訂篩選條件"
"加入搜尋條件。單次搜尋可加入多個篩選條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`My Pipeline`: Show opportunities assigned to the current user."
msgstr ":guilabel:`我的銷售管道`：顯示指派給目前使用者的商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Active`: Show active opportunities. Active opportunities are "
"those that appear in the CRM pipeline as *Ongoing* or *Rotting*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`有效`：顯示有效商機。有效商機是指在 CRM 銷售管道中顯示為 *進行中* "
"或 *停滯* 的商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inactive`: Show inactive opportunities. Inactive opportunities "
"are those that appear in the CRM pipeline as *Lost*, *Won,* and *Archived*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`非活躍`：顯示非活躍商機。非活躍商機是指在 CRM 銷售流程中顯示為 *已"
"失去*、*已贏得* 及 *已封存* 的商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:63
msgid ":guilabel:`Won`: Show opportunities that have been marked *Won*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:64
msgid ":guilabel:`Lost`: Show opportunities that have been marked *Lost*."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已失去`：顯示已標記為 *已失去* 的商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Created on`: Show opportunities that were created during a "
"specific period of time. The default time period is the current year, but it"
" can be adjusted as needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建立日期`：顯示在特定時間段內建立的商機。預設時間段為本年度，但可"
"按需要調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Closing`: Show opportunities that are projected to close"
" during a specific period of time. Closed opportunities are marked as having"
" been *Won*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預期結束`：顯示預計於特定時間段內結束的商機。已結束的商機標記為 "
"*已贏得*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date Closed`: Show opportunities that have been marked *Won* "
"during a specific period of time."
msgstr ":guilabel:`結束日期`：顯示在特定時間段內標記為 *贏得* 的商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Archived`: Show opportunities that have been archived. *Lost* "
"opportunities are automatically archived, but not all archived opportunities"
" are marked as *Lost*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已封存`：顯示已封存的商機。*已流失* 的商機會自動封存，但並非所有已"
"封存的商機都會標記為 *已流失*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:73
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom Filter`: Allows the user to create a custom filter with "
"numerous options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:75
msgid ""
"Additionally, the following options appear if the *Opportunities* option has"
" been enabled in the **CRM** app's Configuration settings."
msgstr ""
"此外，如果在 **CRM** 應用程式的「配置」設定中啟用了 *商機* 選項，便會顯示以下"
"選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Opportunities`: Show leads that have been qualified as "
"opportunities."
msgstr ":guilabel:`商機`：顯示已確認為商機的潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Leads`: Show leads that have yet to be qualified as "
"opportunities."
msgstr ":guilabel:`潛在客戶`：顯示尚未符合資格轉為商機的潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:82
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:48
msgid "Groupings"
msgstr "分組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:50
msgid ""
"The :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Group By` section allows users to add pre-"
"made and custom groupings to the search results. Multiple groupings can be "
"added to split results into more manageable chunks. The order of the "
"selected groupings determines how results are displayed, as each grouping is"
" applied in sequence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:90
msgid ""
"The **CRM** app uses the features of the **Marketing Automation** app for "
"tracking campaign-related statistics. For more information about campaigns, "
"mediums, and sources, :doc:`see the Marketing Automation documentation "
"<../../../marketing/marketing_automation>`."
msgstr ""
"**CRM** 應用程式會使用**營銷自動化**應用程式的功能，以追蹤與推廣活動相關的統"
"計數據。有關推廣活動、媒介及來源的詳情，請:doc:`參閱營銷自動化說明文件 <../"
"../../marketing/marketing_automation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: Groups the results by the Salesperson to whom an "
"opportunity is assigned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: Groups the results by the Sales Team to whom an "
"opportunity is assigned."
msgstr ":guilabel:`銷售團隊`：按獲指派商機的銷售團隊將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`City`: Groups the results by the city from which an opportunity "
"originated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country`: Groups the results by the country from which an "
"opportunity originated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`國家/地區`：按商機來源國家/地區將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Groups the results by the company to which an "
"opportunity belongs, if multiple companies are activated in the database."
msgstr ":guilabel:`公司`：如果資料庫中啟用了多間公司，則按商機所屬的公司將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stage`: Groups the results by the stages of the sales pipeline."
msgstr ":guilabel:`階段`：按銷售流程的階段將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: Groups the results by the marketing campaign from "
"which an opportunity originated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`推廣活動`：按商機來源的市場推廣活動將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: Groups the results by the medium (Email, Google Adwords,"
" Website, etc.) from which an opportunity originated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`媒介`：按商機來源的媒介（電郵、Google Adwords、網站等）將結果分組"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: Groups the results by the source (Search engine, Lead "
"Recall, Newsletter, etc.) from which an opportunity originated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`來源`：根據商機的來源（搜尋引擎、潛在客戶回訪、電子報等）將結果分"
"組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Creation Date`: Groups the results by the date an opportunity was"
" added to the database."
msgstr ":guilabel:`建立日期`：按商機加入至資料庫的日期將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Conversion Date`: Groups the results by the date an opportunity "
"was converted to an opportunity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`轉換日期`：按商機轉換為商機的日期將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Closing`: Groups the results by the date an opportunity "
"is expected to close. Closed opportunities are marked as having been *Won*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預計結束日期`：依商機預計結束的日期將結果分組。已結束的商機標記為 "
"*已贏得*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Closed Date`: Groups the results by the date an opportunity was "
"marked *Won*."
msgstr ":guilabel:`關閉日期`：按商機標記為*已贏得*的日期將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lost Reason`: Groups the results by the reason selected when an "
"opportunity  was marked *Lost*."
msgstr ":guilabel:`流失原因`：按商機標記為 *流失* 時所選的原因將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom Group`: Allows the user to create a custom group with "
"numerous options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:119
msgid ""
"Visit the :doc:`Search, filter, and group records "
"<../../../essentials/search>` documentation for more information about "
"custom filters and groups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:125
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:91
msgid "Measures"
msgstr "度量"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:127
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` page measures the total "
"*Count*, or number of opportunities, for the current year. To change the "
"displayed opportunities, click the :guilabel:`Measures` button in the top-"
"left of the page and select one of the following options from the drop-down "
"menu:"
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，:guilabel:`銷售管道分析` 頁面會計算本年度的總 *數量*（即商機數目"
"）。要更改顯示的商機，請點擊頁面左上方的 :guilabel:`測量` 按鈕，然後從下拉式"
"選單選擇以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to Assign`: Measures the number of days it took an "
"opportunity to be assigned after creation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`指派所需天數`：量度商機建立後獲指派所需的天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to Close`: Measures the number of days it took an "
"opportunity to be closed. Closed opportunities are marked as having been "
"*Won*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days To Convert`: Measures the number of days it took an "
"opportunity to be converted to an opportunity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`轉換天數`：計算商機轉換為商機所需的天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:138
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Exceeded Closing Days`: Measures the number of days by which an "
"opportunity exceeded its expected closing date."
msgstr ":guilabel:`超出預計成交日數`：計算銷售機會超出其預計成交日期的天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Revenue`: Measures the expected revenue of an "
"opportunity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`預期收益`：衡量商機的預期收益。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:141
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prorated Revenue`: Measures the prorated revenue of an "
"opportunity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:142
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Count`: Measures the total amount of opportunities that match the"
" search criteria."
msgstr ":guilabel:`計數`：計算符合搜尋條件的商機總數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:144
msgid ""
"If the **Subscriptions** app has been installed to the Odoo database, the "
"following options also appear under :guilabel:`Measures`."
msgstr ""
"如果 Odoo 資料庫已安裝 **訂閱** 應用程式，以下選項亦會顯示於 :guilabel:`指"
"標` 下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected MRR`: Measures the expected monthly recurring revenue of"
" an opportunity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`預期 MRR`：衡量銷售機會的預期每月經常性收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:148
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prorated MRR`: Measures the prorated monthly recurring revenue of"
" an opportunity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`按比例計算的 MRR`：衡量商機按比例計算的每月經常性收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prorated Recurring Revenues`: Measures the prorated recurring "
"revenues of an opportunity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`按比例計算的經常性收益`：衡量商機按比例計算的經常性收益。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recurring Revenues`: Measures the recurring revenue of an "
"opportunity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`經常性收益`：計算商機的經常性收益。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:156
msgid "Win/loss report"
msgstr "贏單/輸單報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:158
msgid ""
"After understanding how to :ref:`navigate the pipeline analysis page "
"<win_loss/pipeline>`, the :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` page can be used to "
"create and share different reports, such as win/loss reports."
msgstr ""
"了解如何:ref:`瀏覽銷售管道分析頁面 <win_loss/pipeline>`後，即可使"
"用:guilabel:`銷售管道分析`頁面建立和分享各種報表，例如贏單／輸單報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:162
msgid ""
"Win/Loss reports are a calculation of active or previously active "
"opportunities in a pipeline that were either marked as *Won* or *Lost* over "
"a specific period of time. By calculating opportunities won vs. "
"opportunities lost, win/loss reports can present different information for "
"different needs. For example, a sales manager might find it useful to group "
"wins and losses by salesperson or sales team to see who has the best "
"conversion rate. A marketing team might group by sources or medium to "
"determine where their advertising has been most successful."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:169
msgid ""
"\\begin{equation}\n"
"Win/Loss Ratio = \\frac{Opportunities Won}{Opportunities Lost}\n"
"\\end{equation}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{equation}\n"
"勝敗比率 = \\frac{贏得商機}{流失商機}\n"
"\\end{equation}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:174
msgid ""
"A win/loss report for the current year, with results grouped by "
":guilabel:`Stage`, :guilabel:`Won/Lost` status, and :guilabel:`Salesperson`,"
" allows managers to determine when leads and opportunities are lost or won, "
"and which salespeople were handling them at the time."
msgstr ""
"本年度的贏單／輸單報告會按 :guilabel:`階段`、:guilabel:`贏單／輸單` 狀態及 "
":guilabel:`銷售員` 分組顯示結果，讓經理了解潛在客戶及商機何時流失或贏得，以及"
"當時由哪位銷售員負責跟進。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:178
msgid ""
"To create the report, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Reporting --> "
"Pipeline`. On the :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` page, click the :icon:`fa-"
"sort-down` :guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` icon at the end of the search "
"bar to open a drop-down menu of filters and groupings. Under the :icon:`fa-"
"filter` :guilabel:`Filters` heading, ensure both :guilabel:`Opportunities` "
"and :guilabel:`Leads` have been enabled to capture results for both."
msgstr ""
"要建立此報告，請前往 :menuselection:`CRM 應用程式 --> 報告 --> 銷售管道`。在 "
":guilabel:`銷售管道分析` 頁面上，點擊搜尋欄末端的 :icon:`fa-sort-down` "
":guilabel:`（切換搜尋面板）` 圖示，以開啟篩選條件和分組的下拉式選單。在 "
":icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 標題下，確保已同時啟用 :guilabel:`商"
"機` 及 :guilabel:`潛在客戶`，以擷取兩者的結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:184
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Custom Filter...` to bring up the *Custom Filter* "
"pop-up window. Set the first field to :guilabel:`Won/Lost`, and set the last"
" field to :guilabel:`Won` . Add another rule by clicking :guilabel:`New "
"Rule`, and set the last field to :guilabel:`Lost`. Finally, enable the "
"toggle :guilabel:`Include archived` in the top-right of the form, and click "
":guilabel:`Search`."
msgstr ""
"接下來，按一下 :guilabel:`自訂篩選...` 以開啟 *自訂篩選* 彈出視窗。將第一個欄"
"位設為 :guilabel:`贏得/失去`，並將最後一個欄位設為 :guilabel:`贏得`。按一下 "
":guilabel:`新增規則` 以加入另一條規則，並將最後一個欄位設為 :guilabel:`失"
"去`。最後，啟用表單右上角的 :guilabel:`包括已封存` 開關，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`搜尋`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:190
msgid ""
"Activating the :guilabel:`Include archived` toggle when creating win/loss "
"reports guarantees that any archived *Lost* opportunities appear in the "
"report. Without using the toggle or creating a rule that filters for both "
"active and inactive opportunities, it's possible for a report to not include"
" lost opportunities even with the :guilabel:`Lost` filter active."
msgstr ""
"建立成敗報告時啟用 :guilabel:`包括已封存` 開關，可確保所有已封存的 *失敗* 商"
"機均會顯示在報告中。如果未使用該開關，亦未建立同時篩選有效及無效商機的規則，"
"即使已啟用 :guilabel:`失敗` 篩選器，報告仍可能不會包含已失敗的商機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:195
msgid ""
"In the search bar, choose :guilabel:`Stage` under the :icon:`oi-group` "
":guilabel:`Group By` heading. Then click :guilabel:`Custom Group` and choose"
" :guilabel:`Won/Lost` from the drop-down menu. Finally, activate the "
":guilabel:`Salesperson` option. By default, the data will appear with "
"different results stacked on top of each other according to their stage. To "
"view the bars in this chart side-by-side, deactivate the :icon:`fa-database`"
" :guilabel:`(Stacked)` toggle."
msgstr ""
"在搜尋列中，選擇:guilabel:`階段`（位於 :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`分組依據` "
"標題下）。然後點擊:guilabel:`自訂分組`，並從下拉式選單選擇:guilabel:`贏得/失"
"去`。最後，啟用:guilabel:`銷售員`選項。預設情況下，資料會按階段將不同結果堆疊"
"顯示。如要並排檢視此圖表中的長條，請停用 :icon:`fa-database` :guilabel:`(堆"
"疊)` 切換按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:201
msgid ""
"Because options under the :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Group By` heading are "
"applied sequentially, this set-up ensures that the visual output for the "
"report emphasizes the stage when opportunities were lost and then who was "
"handling them when that occurred. Each column represents the number of "
"opportunities in a stage that are assigned to a specific salesperson and won"
" or lost. Clicking one of the columns opens a list view of the individual "
"opportunities with *won* opportunities shown in bold and *lost* "
"opportunities appearing greyed out."
msgstr ""
"由於 :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`分組依據` 標題下的選項會按順序套用，此設定可"
"確保報表的視覺化輸出先強調商機流失的階段，再顯示當時負責處理的銷售人員。每一"
"欄代表特定階段中指派給特定銷售人員的已贏得或已流失商機數量。點擊其中一欄會開"
"啟個別商機的列表視圖，其中 *已贏得* 的商機以粗體顯示， *已流失* 的商機則以灰"
"色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:208
msgid ""
"Switching into other views after setting up this example report can help "
"demonstrate the different use cases for those views."
msgstr "設定此範例報表後，切換至其他檢視畫面，有助展示這些檢視的不同使用情景。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:211
msgid ""
"A basic win/loss report showing all opportunities whether won or lost "
"grouped by stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:217
msgid ""
"By default, the pivot view groups win/loss reports by :guilabel:`Stage` and "
"measures :guilabel:`Expected Revenue`. The data on the pivot table can be "
"adjusted by clicking the :guilabel:`Measures` button and choosing from the "
"drop-down. Pivot tables make it especially easy to see the relationship "
"between the chosen search filters and groupings and revenue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:222
msgid "A win/loss report in Pivot view displays the data in table form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:226
msgid ""
"In pivot view, the :guilabel:`Insert In Spreadsheet` button may be greyed "
"out due to the report containing duplicate grouping options. To fix this, "
"remove the :guilabel:`Stage` grouping in the search bar."
msgstr ""
"在樞紐分析視圖中，由於報表包含重複的分組選項，:guilabel:`插入至試算表` 按鈕可"
"能會變灰。要解決此問題，請在搜尋欄中移除 :guilabel:`階段` 分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:231
msgid "Cohort view"
msgstr "同期群檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:233
msgid ""
"By default, the cohort view groups win/loss reports by the dates they were "
":guilabel:`Created on` and :guilabel:`Closed Date`. The Cohort view makes it"
" easy to identify productive and slow periods for businesses. The Cohort "
"view does not support custom groupings of data."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，同期群檢視會按報告的 :guilabel:`建立日期` 及 :guilabel:`結案日"
"期` 將贏單／輸單報告分組。同期群檢視可讓企業輕鬆識別業務的高產期與淡季。同期"
"群檢視不支援自訂資料分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:237
msgid "A win/loss report in Cohort view displays the data in table form."
msgstr "同期群檢視中的贏單／輸單報表會以表格形式顯示資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:243
msgid ""
"In list view, a win/loss report displays all opportunities on a single page."
" This view is useful for being able to see the details of opportunities "
"while still having them grouped according to the chosen search filters and "
"groupings."
msgstr ""
"在列表檢視中，贏單／輸單報告會在單一頁面上顯示所有商機。此檢視方式非常實用，"
"讓您在查看商機詳情的同時，仍可按照所選的搜尋篩選條件和分組方式將其分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:247
msgid "A win/loss report in List view displays the data in table form."
msgstr "列表檢視中的贏單／輸單報表會以表格形式顯示資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:250
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Opportunity`, :guilabel:`Contact Name`, "
":guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Salesperson`, :guilabel:`Expected Revenue`, "
"and :guilabel:`Stage` columns are visible in this view. To add more columns "
"to the list, click the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` icon in the top-right of "
"the page. Select options from the resulting drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

