msgstr "使用 :icon:`fa-search` 搜尋欄尋找客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/presets.rst:159
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Manage orders by time` option is enabled for the selected "
"preset, select a date and time. Time slots that reach :guilabel:`Preparation"
