#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Local Network Access <https://developer.chrome.com/release-"
"notes/142#local_network_access_restrictions>`_ is a security feature that "
"limits a website's ability to send requests to servers on a local network. "
"Access requires explicit user permission, which makes it possible to grant "
"network access to a specific web page. Using |LNA|, Odoo Point of Sale can "
"communicate with devices with local access directly from the browser and "
"without requiring an :doc:`SSL certificate <epos_ssc>`."
msgstr ""
"`區域網絡存取 <https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/"
"142#local_network_access_restrictions>`_ 是一項安全功能，可限制網站向區域網絡"
"上的伺服器發送請求的能力。存取需要用戶明確授權，從而可以向特定網頁授予網絡存"
"取權限。使用 |LNA| 時，Odoo 銷售點可直接透過瀏覽器與具備本地存取權限的裝置通"
"訊，而無需 :doc:`SSL 憑證 <epos_ssc>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:14
msgid ""
"Local Network Access is available in most browsers based on `Chromium "
"version 142 <https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/142>`_ or higher, "
"including Google Chrome, Brave, Microsoft Edge, Vivaldi, and Opera."
msgstr ""
"本地網絡存取適用於大多數基於 `Chromium 142 版本 <https://"
"developer.chrome.com/release-notes/142>`_ 或更高版本的瀏覽器，包括 Google "
"Chrome、Brave、Microsoft Edge、Vivaldi 及 Opera。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:19
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:30
