msgid "Activation"
msgstr "啟用"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:21
msgid ""
"|LNA| is enabled by default and automatically used for compatible devices, "
"such as :ref:`ePOS printers <pos/epos-printers/supported-printers>`, when "
"the :guilabel:`Use Local Network Access` checkbox is enabled on the "
":ref:`printer form <pos/epos-printers/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"|LNA| 預設為啟用，並自動用於 :ref:`ePOS 打印機 <pos/epos-printers/supported-"
"printers>` 等相容裝置，前提是已勾選 :guilabel:`使用本地網絡存取` 核取方塊（"
"於 :ref:`打印機表單 <pos/epos-printers/configuration>` 中設定）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:26
msgid ""
"The ePOS printer must have a **static IP address**; otherwise, it may become"
" unreachable. The static IP should be configured through the router."
msgstr ""
"ePOS 打印機必須使用 **靜態 IP 地址**，否則可能會無法連線。靜態 IP 應透過路由"
"器進行設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:32
msgid ""
"To activate |LNA| and ensure POS uses it over a secure connection, create a "
