#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:114
msgid "European regulations"
msgstr "歐洲法規"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:116
msgid ""
"When using scales in commercial transactions, the database to which the "
"scale is connected must be configured to comply with European requirements. "
"This includes supporting at least three decimal places for accuracy and "
"using proper rounding for units of measure, such as `kg` rather than generic"
" `units`."
msgstr ""
"在商業交易中使用磅秤時，磅秤連接的資料庫必須經過設定以符合歐洲規定。這包括支"
"援至少三個小數位以確保準確度，以及為計量單位使用適當的四捨五入設定，例如使用 "
"`kg` 而非通用的 `units`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:121
msgid ""
"If the database is not compliant, a red :icon:`fa-balance-scale` "
"(:guilabel:`scale`) icon displays as a warning. Click this icon to view the "
"reasons for non-compliance and then select :guilabel:`Apply changes` to "
"automatically apply the necessary changes to the settings. Once the database"
" meets all regulatory requirements, the :icon:`fa-balance-scale` "
"(:guilabel:`scale`) icon turns green."
msgstr ""
"若資料庫不符合法規要求，系統會顯示一個紅色的 :icon:`fa-balance-"
"scale`（:guilabel:`天秤`）圖示作為警告。按一下此圖示即可查看不合規的原因，然"
"後選擇 :guilabel:`套用變更`，系統便會自動將所需變更套用至設定。當資料庫符合所"
"有法規要求後，:icon:`fa-balance-scale`（:guilabel:`天秤`）圖示便會變為綠色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:130
