msgid ""
"On the Cashmatic machine, log in with the provided credentials, then go to "
":menuselection:`Settings --> IP address`."
msgstr ""
"在 Cashmatic 機器上，使用提供的登入憑證登入，然後前往 :menuselection:`設"
