#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashmatic.rst:52
msgid ""
"In the MyCashmatic app or on the website, sign in to your account, then go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Network`."
msgstr ""
"在 MyCashmatic 應用程式或網站上登入你的帳戶，然後前往:menuselection:`設"
"定 --> 網絡`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashmatic.rst:55
msgid ""
"Note the IP address displayed on the machine's or the device's screen, as it"
" is needed for the :ref:`Odoo configuration step "
"<pos/cashmatic/odoo_configuration>`."
msgstr ""
