msgstr "開啟網頁瀏覽器，並在網址列中輸入 IP 位址，以存取 Cashmatic 網頁介面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashmatic.rst:68
msgid ""
