msgstr "開啟 Windows 檔案總管，並找出已下載的認證檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:89
msgid ""
"Right-click on the certification files and select :guilabel:`Install "
