"creation>`及:ref:`管理產品資訊 <pos/products/information-display>`。產品可透"
"過多種方式:ref:`設定 <pos/products/configuration>`，包括建立:ref:`變體 <pos/"
"products/variants>`、:ref:`產品組合 <pos/products/combos>`及:ref:`POS 專用產"
"品類別 <pos/products/categories>`，以及新增:ref:`標籤 <pos/products/tags>"
