"`為產品分組，並:ref:`管理庫存 <pos/products/sn>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:18
msgid "Product creation"
msgstr "建立產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:20
msgid ""
"To create products from the backend, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale -->"
" Products --> Products`, and click :guilabel:`New` to create a product, or "
"select an existing one to edit it. Ensure the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` "
"checkbox is enabled at the top of the form, then :doc:`configure the "
"product's general information "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure>`, "
"such as defining the :doc:`product type "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type>`,"
" setting a :ref:`tracking strategy <pos/products/sn>`, or adding a product "
"image, as needed. Configure advanced, POS-specific :ref:`product details "
"<pos/products/configuration>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"如要從後端建立產品，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 產品 --> 產品`，然後點"
"擊 :guilabel:`新增` 以建立產品，或選取現有產品進行編輯。請確保表單頂部的 "
":guilabel:`銷售點` 核取方塊已啟用，然後根據需要 :doc:`配置產品的一般資訊 </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure>`，例如"
"定義 :doc:`產品類型 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"product_management/configure/type>`、設定 :ref:`追蹤策略 <pos/products/sn>`，"
"或新增產品圖片。此外，請按需要配置進階的 POS 專屬 :ref:`產品詳細資料 <pos/"
"products/configuration>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:30
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create a product from the POS interface. To do so, "
"open the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/open-register>`, click the :icon:`menu`"
" (:guilabel:`hamburger menu`) icon, then select :icon:`add` "
":guilabel:`Create Product`. Enter the product details in the popover and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`. The product is immediately available in the POS "
"register. Existing products can also be updated directly from the POS "
"register through the :ref:`product information popover "
"<pos/products/information-display>`."
msgstr ""
"您亦可以從 POS 介面建立產品。為此，請開啟 :ref:`POS 收銀機 <pos/use/open-"
"register>`，點擊 :icon:`menu`（:guilabel:`漢堡選單`）圖示，然後選擇 "
":icon:`add` :guilabel:`建立產品`。在彈出視窗中輸入產品詳細資料，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`儲存`。該產品會立即在 POS 收銀機中提供。您亦可以透過 :ref:`產品資"
"訊彈出視窗 <pos/products/information-display>` 直接從 POS 收銀機更新現有產品"
"。"

