"Unit` to `0.06 kg` (since 60 g = 0.06 kg). The reference price calculates "
"automatically as `$20.00/kg`."
msgstr ""
"**按重量計算：** 一個牛油牛角包重 60 克，每個售價為 $1.20。如要顯示其每公斤的"
