":guilabel:`Reference Unit` to `6 cans`. The reference price calculates "
"automatically as `$0.83/can`."
msgstr ""
"**按包裝數量：** 一組 6 罐裝汽水售價為 $5.00。將:guilabel:`參考單位`設為 `6 "
