msgid "Product combos"
msgstr "產品組合"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:372
msgid ""
"A product combo is a bundle of multiple products sold together as a single "
"unit. Each product combo consists of multiple categories, known as "
":ref:`combo choices <pos/products/combo-choices>`, and each combo choice "
"contains several items. When purchasing a product combo, customers can "
"select one or more items from each combo choice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:378
msgid ""
"A burger menu is offered as a product combo including three combo choices: "
"one burger, one drink, and one portion of fries. For each combo choice, "
"customers select one item from the available options (e.g., cheese burger or"
" bacon burger; water or soda; large or regular fries)."
msgstr ""
"漢堡套餐以組合產品形式提供，包含三個套餐選項：一個漢堡、一杯飲品及一份薯條。"
"針對每個套餐選項，顧客可從可選項目中選擇一項（例如：芝士漢堡或煙肉漢堡；清水"
"或汽水；大薯條或普通薯條）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:382
msgid "Combo selection in the POS register."
msgstr "POS 收銀機中的組合選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:387
msgid ""
"To change the selection after :ref:`adding a product combo to the cart "
"<pos/use/sell>`, click and hold the combo item in the cart to reopen the "
"selection popover."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`將產品組合加入購物車 <pos/use/sell>` 後如要更改選擇，請按住購物車內"
"的組合項目，以重新開啟選擇彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:389
msgid ""
"When all products that belong to a predefined combo are added to the cart "
"individually, Odoo automatically detects the combo and displays a suggestion"
" for it above the keypad. To apply the combo pricing, click "
":guilabel:`Apply`. If multiple combos are detected, click "
":guilabel:`Choose`, then :guilabel:`Apply` the appropriate combo."
msgstr ""
"當預先定義組合的所有產品都逐一加入購物車後，Odoo 會自動偵測該組合，並在數字鍵"
"盤上方顯示建議。若要套用組合價格，請按一下:guilabel:`套用`。如果偵測到多個組"
"合，請按一下:guilabel:`選擇`，再:guilabel:`套用`合適的組合。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:395
msgid "Combo automatically detected in the POS register."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:399
msgid ""
"To split a combo into its individual products, select the combo, click the "
":icon:`more_vert` (:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) button, and select "
":icon:`format_indent_decrease` :guilabel:`Break Combo`. The price of each "
"product is adjusted according to its standard :guilabel:`Sales Price`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:405
msgid ""
