#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:416
msgid "Enter a name for the :guilabel:`Combo Choice`."
msgstr "為:guilabel:`組合選擇`輸入名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:417
msgid ""
"Set the maximum selectable items for the combo choice using the "
