msgstr ""
"如果您處於 :doc:`多公司 </applications/general/companies/multi_company>` 環境"
"，請選擇相關的 :guilabel:`公司`。將此欄位留空，即可供 *所有* 公司使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:428
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` under the :guilabel:`Options` section to add "
"the products that constitute the :guilabel:`Combo Choices`."
msgstr ""
