":guilabel:`New`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 產品 --> 產品`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:451
msgid "Enter a product name."
msgstr "輸入產品名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:452
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Product Type` to :guilabel:`Combo` and select the "
"relevant :ref:`Combo Choices <pos/products/combo-choices>`."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`產品類型` 設為 :guilabel:`組合`，並選取相關的 :ref:`組合選項 "
"<pos/products/combo-choices>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:454
msgid "Add a :guilabel:`Sales Price`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:455
msgid ""
"Optionally, click the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` tab to select the preferred "
":guilabel:`Category`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:458
msgid ""
"The total price of the product combo, as displayed in the :ref:`POS register"
" <pos/use/open-register>`, is based on the :guilabel:`Sales Price` defined "
"on the :ref:`product combo's form <pos/products/combo-creation>`. Selecting "
"several products in the combo choices, a product with an :guilabel:`Extra "
"Price`, and/or products in a combo choice configured as an upsell all affect"
" the total price."
msgstr ""
"顯示於:ref:`POS 收銀機 <pos/use/open-register>`的產品組合總價，取決"
"於:guilabel:`銷售價格`，即於:ref:`產品組合表單 <pos/products/combo-creation>"
"`中所設定的價格。如在組合選項中選擇多項產品、設有:guilabel:`額外價格`的產品，"
"或選擇已配置為追加銷售的組合選項產品，均會影響總價。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:465
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Office Combo` has a :guilabel:`Sales Price` of **300** € and "
"offers a selection of chairs and desks. The combo choice for chairs includes"
" a conference chair, an office chair, and an armchair, with a maximum "
"selectable amount set to 2. For each additional chair a customer selects, a "
":guilabel:`Combo Price` of **35** € is added. The armchair has an "
":guilabel:`Extra Price` of **100** € because it is made of leather. "
"Selecting both the conference chair and the armchair increases the price of "
"the :guilabel:`Office Combo` to **435** €, i.e., :guilabel:`Sales Price` + "
"**35** € (:guilabel:`Combo Price`) for adding a second chair + **100** € "
"(:guilabel:`Extra Price`) for the leather armchair."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:478
msgid ""
"The individual :ref:`combo choice products <pos/products/combo-choices>` "
"determine the product combo :doc:`taxes <../../finance/accounting/taxes>`. "
"Therefore, it is not possible to define specific :guilabel:`Sales Taxes` on "
"product combos. The :guilabel:`Combo Price` sets the discounted price for "
"each combo choice product, and the :doc:`product's taxes "
"<../../finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation>` are then applied to that "
"price."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:487
msgid "Stock management"
msgstr "庫存管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:489
msgid ""
"To track stock for POS products, the :ref:`product type "
"<inventory/type/good-or-services>` must be set to :guilabel:`Goods` or "
":guilabel:`Combo`. Enable the :ref:`Track Inventory option "
"<inventory/product_management/tracking-inventory>` to track products by "
"quantity. Products can also be tracked :ref:`by lot or by serial number "
"<pos/products/sn>`."
msgstr ""
"要追蹤 POS 產品庫存，:ref:`產品類型 <inventory/type/good-or-services>` 必須設"
"為 :guilabel:`貨品` 或 :guilabel:`組合`。啟用 :ref:`追蹤庫存選項 <inventory/"
"product_management/tracking-inventory>`，即可按數量追蹤產品。產品亦可 "
":ref:`按批次或序號 <pos/products/sn>` 追蹤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:495
msgid ""
"When adding tracked items to the :ref:`cart <pos/use/sell>`, the number of "
":guilabel:`Free To Use` units is displayed in the POS configuration popover."
msgstr ""
"將追蹤項目加入 :ref:`購物車 <pos/use/sell>` 時，POS 配置彈出視窗會顯示 "
":guilabel:`可供使用` 單位的數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:498
msgid "Free-to-use stock displayed in POS register."
msgstr "POS 收銀機顯示的可用庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:505
msgid "Serial numbers and lots"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:507
msgid ""
"Using **lots** and **serial numbers** allows product movements to be tracked"
" throughout a product's lifecycle. When traceability is enabled, Odoo "
"identifies a product's location based on its last recorded movement."
msgstr ""
"使用 **批次** 及 **序號** 可讓您在產品整個生命週期內追蹤產品移動情況。啟用可"
"追溯性後，Odoo 會根據產品最後記錄的移動情況來識別其位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:511
msgid "To track products by lots or serial numbers:"
msgstr "如要按批次或序號追蹤產品："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:513
msgid ""
"Install the :doc:`Inventory app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory>`"
" if it has not already been installed."
msgstr ""
"如尚未安裝，請先安裝 :doc:`庫存應用程式 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:515
msgid ""
":ref:`Enable the Lots & Serial Numbers setting "
"<inventory/product_management/traceability-setting>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`啟用「批次及序號」設定 <inventory/product_management/traceability-"
"setting>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:517
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure products <pos/products/creation>`, and select an option from"
" the :guilabel:`Tracking` dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
":ref:`配置產品 <pos/products/creation>`，然後從:guilabel:`追蹤`下拉式選單中選"
"擇一個選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:519
msgid ""
":ref:`Assign tracking numbers <inventory/product_management/assign-sn>`."
msgstr ":ref:`指派追蹤編號 <inventory/product_management/assign-sn>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:522
msgid ""
":doc:`Expiration dates "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/expiration_dates>`"
" can also be configured for products tracked by lot or serial number. When "
"an expired product is added to the cart, a warning is displayed in the "
"upper-right corner of the POS register."
msgstr ""
":doc:`到期日 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/"
"product_tracking/expiration_dates>`功能亦可套用於按批次或序號追蹤的產品。將已"
"過期產品加入購物車時，POS 收銀機右上角會顯示警告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:527
msgid "Warning about expired product."
msgstr "關於已過期產品的警告。"

