#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:92
msgid "Barcodes"
msgstr "條碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:94
msgid ""
"Using a :doc:`barcode scanner "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/hardware>` improves efficiency and "
"provides quicker customer service. In Point of Sale, scanners are used to "
"add products to a cart, apply discounts, or log employees into the POS "
"register."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`條碼掃描器 <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/hardware>` 可提"
"升效率，並提供更快捷的客戶服務。在銷售點中，掃描器可用於將產品加入購物車、套"
"用折扣，或讓員工登入 POS 收銀機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:98
msgid ""
"Once enabled in the **Inventory** app, you can use the barcode feature with "
"any product that has a barcode assigned."
msgstr "在 **庫存** 應用程式中啟用後，您便可以對任何已指派條碼的產品使用條碼功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:102
msgid ""
":doc:`Set up a barcode scanner "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/hardware>`"
msgstr ":doc:`設定條碼掃描器 <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/hardware>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:103
msgid ""
":doc:`Activate barcode scanners "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/software>`"
msgstr ":doc:`啟用條碼掃描器 <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/software>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:106
msgid "Assign barcodes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:108
msgid ""
"To use this feature, :ref:`assign a barcode to your products "
"<inventory/barcode/set-barcodes>` following the :doc:`default barcode "
"nomenclature <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/software>`. You can also"
" assign barcodes automatically  using the :doc:`barcode lookup feature and "
"database </applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/barcodelookup>`."
msgstr ""
"如要使用此功能，請 :ref:`為產品指定條碼 <inventory/barcode/set-barcodes>`，並"
"依循 :doc:`預設條碼命名規則 <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/software>"
"`。您亦可使用 :doc:`條碼查詢功能及資料庫 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"barcode/setup/barcodelookup>` 自動指定條碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:114
msgid ""
"Employees can :ref:`log into the POS by scanning a badge <pos/employee-"
"login/user-login>`. To configure this feature, open the **Employees** app, "
"select an employee, then, in the :guilabel:`HR Settings` tab, fill in the "
":guilabel:`PIN Code` or :guilabel:`Badge ID`."
msgstr ""
"員工可:ref:`透過掃描識別證登入 POS <pos/employee-login/user-login>`。要設定此"
"功能，請開啟 **員工** 應用程式，選取一名員工，然後在:guilabel:`人力資源設"
"定`分頁中，填寫:guilabel:`PIN 碼`或:guilabel:`識別證編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:121
msgid "Discount tags"
msgstr "折扣標籤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:123
msgid ""
"Discount tags are specific barcodes used to apply a percentage discount to a"
" product. They follow a specific discount nomenclature that allows the POS "
"to recognize the barcode as a price reduction rather than a new product. "
"These are commonly used for items nearing their :doc:`expiration date "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/expiration_dates>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:129
msgid ""
"A carton of milk is expiring tomorrow. By scanning a barcode following the "
"discount nomenclature (e.g., a barcode starting with `2250`), Odoo "
"automatically applies the defined price reduction of 50% to the milk during "
"the current transaction."
msgstr ""
"有一盒牛奶將於明日到期。掃描符合折扣命名規則的條碼（例如以 `2250` 開頭的條碼"
"）後，Odoo 會在當前交易中自動為該盒牛奶套用已設定的 50% 減價。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:134
msgid "Barcode nomenclature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:136
msgid ""
"Barcode nomenclatures explain how barcodes are identified and classified. "
"When a barcode is scanned, it is linked to the first rule that matches its "
"pattern. This pattern syntax adheres to a standardized method of prefix "
"matching; a barcode is considered a match if its prefix aligns with the "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"條碼命名規則說明如何識別及分類條碼。掃描條碼時，系統會將其關聯至首條符合其模"
"式的規則。此模式語法採用標準化的前綴比對方法；若條碼的前綴與模式相符，即視為"
"配對成功。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:141
msgid ""
"Patterns also define how numerical values —such as weight, price, or "
"percentage— are encoded into the barcode. These are indicated by `{NNN}`, "
"where the `N`'s define the position of the digits."
msgstr ""
"格式亦會定義如何將數值（例如重量、價格或百分比）編碼至條碼中。這些數值以 `"
"{NNN}` 表示，其中 `N` 定義數字的位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:144
msgid ""
"To view or edit these rules, go to the :ref:`POS settings "
"<pos/use/settings>`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Inventory` section, and click "
"the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal Link`) icon next to "
":guilabel:`Barcode Nomenclature`."
msgstr ""
"如要檢視或編輯這些規則，請前往 :ref:`POS 設定 <pos/use/settings>`，向下捲動"
"至 :guilabel:`存貨` 部分，然後按一下 :icon:`oi-arrow-right`（:guilabel:`內部"
"連結`）圖示，位於 :guilabel:`條碼命名規則` 旁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:148
msgid ""
"For discount tags, use the :guilabel:`Discount Barcodes` rule. The default "
"pattern is :guilabel:`22{NN}`, meaning the barcode must start with `22`, "
"followed by two digits representing the discount percentage."
msgstr ""
"對於折扣標籤，請使用 :guilabel:`折扣條碼` 規則。預設格式為 :guilabel:`22{NN}"
"`，表示條碼必須以 `22` 開頭，後接代表折扣百分比的兩位數字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:152
msgid "discount tags nomenclature setting form"
msgstr "折扣標籤命名規則設定表單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:157
msgid ""
"To allow for three-digit discounts (such as `100%`), add an extra `N` to the"
" :guilabel:`Barcode Pattern` field (e.g., `22{NNN}`)."
msgstr ""
"如要支援三位數折扣（例如 `100%`），請在 :guilabel:`條碼格式` 欄位多加一個 "
"`N`（例如：`22{NNN}`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:161
msgid ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/barcode_nomenclature`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/"
"barcode_nomenclature`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:166
msgid ""
"To use discount tags, scan the product barcode or manually add it to the "
"cart. Then, scan the discount tag. The discount is automatically applied to "
"the last product added to the cart."
msgstr ""
"要使用折扣標籤，請掃描產品條碼或手動將產品加入購物車，然後掃描折扣標籤。系統"
"會自動將折扣套用至最後加入購物車的產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo Point of Sale allows for the :ref:`creation <pos/use/create-pos>` and "
":ref:`configuration <pos/use/settings>` of a point of sale as well as the "
"management of typical daily operations. These include :ref:`opening the POS "
"register <pos/use/open-register>` and :ref:`processing sales transactions "
"<pos/use/sell>`, :ref:`registering and assigning customers "
"<pos/use/customers>`, :ref:`handling returns and refunds <pos/use/refund>`, "
":ref:`managing the cash register <pos/use/cash-register>`, and :ref:`closing"
" the POS register <pos/use/register-close>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 銷售點（POS）支援 :ref:`建立 <pos/use/create-pos>` 及 :ref:`配置 <pos/"
"use/settings>` 銷售點，並可管理日常營運作業，包括 :ref:`開啟 POS 收銀機 <pos/"
"use/open-register>` 及 :ref:`處理銷售交易 <pos/use/sell>`、 :ref:`登記及指派"
"客戶 <pos/use/customers>`、 :ref:`處理退貨及退款 <pos/use/refund>`、 :ref:`管"
"理現金收銀機 <pos/use/cash-register>`，以及 :ref:`關閉 POS 收銀機 <pos/use/"
"register-close>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:16
msgid ":doc:`use/pos_invoices`"
msgstr ":doc:`use/pos_invoices`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:21
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Point of Sale app provides access rights levels that determine which "
"actions a user can perform. Grant specific access levels to waiters, "
"managers, and other POS employees to protect sensitive data and align "
"permissions with daily employee responsibilities. The access rights levels "
"work as follows:"
msgstr ""
"銷售點應用程式提供存取權限級別，用以決定用戶可執行的操作。您可以為侍應、經理"
"及其他 POS 員工授予特定存取級別，以保護敏感資料，並使權限符合員工的日常職責。"
"存取權限級別的運作方式如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Employee** (without a :doc:`database user <../../general/users>` or "
":ref:`with a light database user <access-rights/roles>`): Employees can "
"perform POS actions based on the access level :doc:`granted in the POS "
"settings <extra/employee_login>`. Employees can have :guilabel:`Supervised`,"
" :guilabel:`Restrictive`, :guilabel:`Cashier`, or :guilabel:`Manager` access"
" rights, with each level providing more access to the POS register. "
"Employees without a linked database user or with a linked light user can use"
" the POS register only after a database user opens the POS register."
msgstr ""
"**員工**（沒有 :doc:`資料庫用戶 <../../general/users>` 或 :ref:`擁有輕量資料"
"庫用戶 <access-rights/roles>`）：員工可根據 :doc:`POS 設定中授予 <extra/"
"employee_login>` 的存取權限級別執行 POS 操作。員工可擁有 :guilabel:`受監"
"督`、:guilabel:`受限制`、:guilabel:`收銀員` 或 :guilabel:`管理員` 存取權限，"
"每個級別會為 POS 收銀機提供更多存取權限。未連結資料庫用戶或已連結輕量用戶的員"
"工，必須由資料庫用戶先開啟 POS 收銀機後，方可使用該 POS 收銀機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Employee** (with a :doc:`database user <../../general/users>`): Employees "
"with a database user have the same access rights as employees without a "
"database user or employees with a light database user, unless they have been"
" added to the :guilabel:`User` :ref:`access group <access-rights/user-"
"permissions>` of the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` app. The :guilabel:`User` "
"access group grants access to most POS features, including parts of the POS "
"backend (such as the :guilabel:`Dashboard`, :guilabel:`Orders`, and "
":guilabel:`Products` menus), and allows users to open, close, and operate "
"the POS register. To restrict the POS register access of an employee who is "
"part of the :guilabel:`User` access group, add the employee to the "
"appropriate :doc:`employee group <extra/employee_login>`."
msgstr ""
"**員工**（設有 :doc:`資料庫用戶 <../../general/users>`）：設有資料庫用戶的員"
"工，其存取權限與沒有資料庫用戶或設有輕量資料庫用戶的員工相同，除非他們已獲加"
"入 :guilabel:`用戶` :ref:`存取權限群組 <access-rights/user-permissions>`（屬"
"於 :guilabel:`銷售點` 應用程式）。:guilabel:`用戶` 存取權限群組授予大部分 "
"POS 功能的存取權，包括 POS 後台的部分區域（例如 :guilabel:`儀表"
"板`、:guilabel:`訂單` 及 :guilabel:`產品` 選單），並允許用戶開啟、關閉及操作 "
"POS 收銀機。如要限制屬於 :guilabel:`用戶` 存取權限群組的員工使用 POS 收銀機，"
"請將該員工加入至合適的 :doc:`員工群組 <extra/employee_login>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Manager**: A manager is a :doc:`database user <../../general/users>` who "
"has been added to the :guilabel:`Administrator` :ref:`access group <access-"
"rights/user-permissions>` of the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` app. Managers can"
" access all POS features, including the :ref:`POS settings "
"<pos/use/settings>`."
msgstr ""

