#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:406
msgid ""
"Customer note button and notes (SO and POS register) on products in the cart"
msgstr "購物車內產品的客戶備註按鈕及備註（銷售訂單及 POS 收銀機）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:412
msgid "Manage the cash register"
msgstr "管理收銀機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:414
msgid ""
"Odoo POS allows accepted coins and bills to be defined. To set up the "
"allowed coins and bills:"
msgstr "Odoo POS 支援自訂可接受的硬幣及紙幣。如要設定允許使用的硬幣及紙幣："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:416
