msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 配置 --> 硬幣/紙幣`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:417
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New` to add a new value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:418
msgid ""
"Select the POS where this value is accepted in the :guilabel:`Point of "
"Sales` column, or leave the field empty to make it available for all POS."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`銷售點`欄位中選擇接受此數值的 POS；如要套用至所有 POS，請將此欄"
