msgstr "若要在 POS 收銀機中記錄與銷售無關的存入現金或提取現金交易："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:423
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-bars` (:guilabel:`hamburger menu`) icon on the POS "
"interface."
msgstr "點擊 POS 介面上的 :icon:`fa-bars`（:guilabel:`漢堡選單`）圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:424
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Cash In/Out`."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`現金存入/取出`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:425
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Cash In` or :guilabel:`Cash Out` in the popover."
msgstr "在彈出視窗中選擇 :guilabel:`現金存入` 或 :guilabel:`現金提取`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:426
msgid "Enter the amount in the field with the currency symbol."
msgstr "在帶有貨幣符號的欄位中輸入金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:427
msgid ""
"Specify the reason for the addition or removal of cash, and click "
":guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr "指定加入或取出現金的原因，然後點擊 :guilabel:`確認`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:430
msgid ""
"Only employees with :ref:`basic or advanced access rights "
"<pos/employee_login/configuration>` are allowed to perform cash-in/out "
"actions."
msgstr ""
"只有擁有:ref:`基本或進階存取權限 <pos/employee_login/configuration>`的員工才"
"可執行現金存入／取出操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:436
msgid "Close the POS register"
msgstr "關閉 POS 收銀機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:438
msgid ""
"To close the POS register, click the :icon:`fa-bars` (:guilabel:`hamburger "
"menu`) icon, then :guilabel:`Close Register`."
msgstr ""
"若要關閉 POS 收銀機，請按一下 :icon:`fa-bars`（:guilabel:`漢堡選單`）圖示，然"
"後按一下:guilabel:`關閉收銀機`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:441
msgid "The :guilabel:`Closing Register` popover displays:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:443
msgid "The number of orders and the total amount made during the session."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:444
msgid "The expected amounts grouped by payment method."
msgstr "按付款方式分組的預期金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:446
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-money` (:guilabel:`money`) icon to specify the number of"
" coins and bills, then click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-money`（:guilabel:`金錢`）圖示以指定硬幣及紙幣的數量，然後點"
"擊 :guilabel:`確認`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:449
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Close Register` to close the register and post accounting "
"entries."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`關閉收銀機` 以關閉收銀機並過賬會計分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:452
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-clone` (:guilabel:`clone`) icon to automatically fill in"
" the field with the expected cash amount."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-clone`（:guilabel:`複製`）圖示，即可自動將預期現金金額填入欄位"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:456
msgid ""
"After specifying the number of coins and bills, the computed amount is set "
"in the :guilabel:`Cash Count` field, and the :guilabel:`Closing details` are"
" specified in the :guilabel:`Closing note` section."
msgstr ""
"指定硬幣及紙幣數量後，系統會將計算出的金額填入 :guilabel:`現金點算` 欄位，而 "
":guilabel:`結算詳情` 會列明於 :guilabel:`結算備註` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:459
msgid ""
"Closing the register of a :doc:`restaurant <restaurant>` POS when orders are"
" still in draft and not scheduled for later is not allowed and opens a "
"popover with options to :guilabel:`Review Orders` or :guilabel:`Cancel "
"Orders`."
msgstr ""
"如果仍有草稿訂單且未排程於稍後處理，系統不允許關閉:doc:`餐廳 <restaurant>` "
"POS 的收銀機，並會彈出視窗提供:guilabel:`檢視訂單`或:guilabel:`取消訂單`的選"
"項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:462
msgid ""
"It is strongly advised to close the POS register at the end of each day."
msgstr "強烈建議每天結束營業時關閉 POS 收銀機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:465
msgid "Set maximum difference"
msgstr "設定最大差異"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:467
msgid ""
"When the counted money does **not** match the expected amount, a "
":guilabel:`Payments Difference` window appears, prompting you to acknowledge"
" the discrepancy. Click :guilabel:`Proceed Anyway` to accept the difference "
"and post it to the designated cash difference journal."
msgstr ""
"如果點算金額與預期金額 **不相符**，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`付款差異` 視窗，提示"
"您確認差異。點擊 :guilabel:`仍然繼續` 以接受差異，並將其過帳至指定的現金差異"
"日記帳。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:471
msgid ""
"To restrict this behavior, you can prevent users from closing the register "
"when a discrepancy occurs by enabling the :guilabel:`Set Maximum Difference`"
" setting in the :guilabel:`Payment` section of the :ref:`POS settings "
"<pos/use/settings>`. Then, specify the allowed limit in the "
":guilabel:`Authorized Difference` field."
msgstr ""
"如要限制此情況，您可以在出現差異時阻止使用者關閉收銀機：只需啟用 "
":guilabel:`設定最大差異` 設定（位於 :guilabel:`付款` 區塊，屬於 :ref:`POS 設"
"定 <pos/use/settings>`）。然後，在 :guilabel:`授權差異` 欄位中指定允許的上限"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:476
msgid ""
"Once configured, if a discrepancy exceeds this limit, the pop-up window "
"displays the authorized threshold and instructs the user to contact a "
"manager to approve the closing."
msgstr ""
"設定完成後，若差異超出此上限，彈出視窗會顯示獲授權的閾值，並指示用戶聯絡經理"
"批核結算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:482
msgid "Offline POS"
msgstr "離線 POS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:484
msgid ""
"During an internet outage, the POS switches to *offline mode*. This mode "
"keeps order creation and management functional even when backend-dependent "
"features are unavailable. When a :ref:`POS session starts <pos/use/open-"
"register>`, essential data, such as products and customers, is loaded into "
"the browser cache so that the data remains accessible offline. Orders "
"created offline are stored in the browser cache and synced to the backend "
"when the connection is restored."
msgstr ""
"在網絡中斷期間，POS 會切換至 *離線模式*。即使依賴後端的功能無法使用，此模式仍"
"可維持訂單建立及管理功能正常運作。當 :ref:`POS 工作階段開始 <pos/use/open-"
"register>` 時，產品及客戶等必要資料會載入至瀏覽器快取，以確保資料在離線狀態下"
"仍可存取。離線建立的訂單會儲存在瀏覽器快取中，並在連線恢復後同步至後端。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:491
msgid ""
"To avoid losing any data created while offline, do not close or reload the "
"browser, and do not clear the browser cache until the POS is back online and"
" synced with the backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:495
msgid ""
"The POS offline mode refers only to Point of Sale-specific functionality. A "
"separate :doc:`offline mode <../../general/offline_mode>` feature covers the"
" rest of Odoo."
msgstr ""
