#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:68
msgid "Price computing"
msgstr "價格計算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:70
msgid ""
"Odoo uses two rules to compute the price of a product when a rental order is"
" created:"
msgstr "建立租賃訂單時，Odoo 會使用兩項規則計算產品價格："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:72
msgid "Only one price line is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:73
msgid "The cheapest line is selected."
msgstr "系統會選取價格最低的項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:76
msgid ""
"A bike rental company offers the following rental prices for its electric "
"bikes:"
msgstr "一間單車租賃公司為其電動單車提供以下租賃價格："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:78
msgid "1 day: $100"
msgstr "1 天：$100"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:79
msgid "3 days: $250"
msgstr "3 天：$250"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:80
msgid "1 week: $500"
msgstr "1 週：$500"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:82
msgid ""
"A customer wants to rent this product for eight days. What price will they "
"pay?"
msgstr "顧客想租用此產品八天。他們需要支付多少費用？"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:84
msgid ""
"After the order is created, Odoo chooses the second line because it is the "
"lowest price. The customer pays three times the '3 days' rate to cover eight"
" days, totaling $750."
msgstr ""
"建立訂單後，Odoo 會選擇第二行，因為其價格最低。客戶須支付「3 天」費率的三倍以"
"涵蓋八天，合共 $750。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:87
msgid ""
"1~\\text{day} * 8 &= 8~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"3~\\text{days} + 3~\\text{days} + 3~\\text{days} &= 9~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"1~\\text{week} + 1~\\text{week} &= 14~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"\\\\\n"
"100 * 8 &= $800 \\\\\n"
"250 + 250 + 250 &= $750 \\\\\n"
"500 + 500 &= $1000\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"1~\\text{天} * 8 &= 8~\\text{天} \\\\\n"
"3~\\text{天} + 3~\\text{天} + 3~\\text{天} &= 9~\\text{天} \\\\\n"
"1~\\text{週} + 1~\\text{週} &= 14~\\text{天} \\\\\n"
"\\\\\n"
"100 * 8 &= $800 \\\\\n"
"250 + 250 + 250 &= $750 \\\\\n"
"500 + 500 &= $1000\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:96
msgid "Therefore, the customer pays $750 for the eight-day rental period."
msgstr "因此，客戶需為這八天租期支付 $750。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:101
msgid "Rental pricelist rules"
msgstr "租賃價目表規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:103
msgid ""
"Extra rental prices are configured in the product's :guilabel:`Prices` tab. "
"The prices are configured like advanced :doc:`pricelists "
"<sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>`, where the following fields work as "
"conditions for the price to be applied:"
msgstr ""
"額外租借價格於產品的 :guilabel:`價格` 分頁中設定。其設定方式與進階 :doc:`價格"
"表 <sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>` 類似，以下欄位會作為套用該價格的條"
"件："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pricelist`: The pricelist for which the pricelist rule is valid."
msgstr ":guilabel:`價格表`：此價格表規則適用的價格表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Min Quantity`: To trigger the Pricelist rule, the quantity must "
"meet or exceed the minimum quantity value. The unit of measure follows the "
"product's :guilabel:`Periodicity` setting."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`最少數量`：要觸發價格表規則，數量必須達到或超過最少數量值。計量單"
"位會跟隨產品的 :guilabel:`週期性` 設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Validity`: The starting date or date range when the pricelist "
"rule is active."
msgstr ":guilabel:`有效期`：價目表規則生效的開始日期或日期範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: The company for which the pricelist rule is valid."
msgstr ":guilabel:`公司`：此價格表規則適用的公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:114
msgid "How Minimum Quantity is computed"
msgstr "最低數量的計算方式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:116
msgid ""
"Configuring discounted prices based on rental duration requires price rules "
"with a :guilabel:`Min. Quantity`. The :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` field is "
"computed differently for the **Rental** app than for the **Sales** and "
"**Subscription** apps."
msgstr ""
"如要根據租賃時長配置折扣價格，需要使用設有 :guilabel:`最少數量` 的價格規則"
"。:guilabel:`最少數量` 欄位在 **租賃** 應用程式中的計算方式與 **銷售** 及 "
"**訂閱** 應用程式不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:120
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` is computed based on the rental duration and "
"the quantity on the sales order line (SOL). The unit of time for the "
":guilabel:`Min. Quantity` field is based on the product's "
":guilabel:`Periodicity` setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:124
msgid "The formula used is:"
msgstr "所使用的公式為："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:126
msgid ""
"\\text{Min. Quantity} = \\text{Quantity on SOL}*\\text{Rental duration}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{最少數量} = \\text{銷售訂單明細數量}*\\text{租借期}\n"
"\n"

