msgid ""
"To view all products available for rent in the database, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Rental app --> Products`. By default, the :guilabel:`Rental`"
" filter appears in the search bar, and the view is Kanban. Click the search "
"bar and from the preset filters, select :guilabel:`Goods`, "
":guilabel:`Services`, or both. All the selected options appear as Kanban "
"cards. For Goods, the card displays the name, rental rate, and amount on "
"hand. For Services, the card displays the name, the number of variants if "
"configured, and the rental price."
msgstr ""
"要檢視資料庫中所有可供租賃的產品，請前往:menuselection:`租賃應用程式 --> 產"
"品`。搜尋欄預設會顯示:guilabel:`租賃`篩選條件，檢視模式為看板。點擊搜尋欄，並"
"從預設篩選條件中選取:guilabel:`貨品`、:guilabel:`服務`或兩者。所有已選項目都"
"會顯示為看板卡片。對於「貨品」，卡片會顯示名稱、租賃費率及現有數量。對於「服"
"務」，卡片會顯示名稱、變體數量（如有設定）及租賃價格。"

