"displays the :guilabel:`Padding Time` field). The :guilabel:`Pickup` and "
":guilabel:`Return` times only apply to online rental orders. The "
":guilabel:`Padding Time` field makes the product unavailable to rent for the"
" selected duration (in hours)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:69
msgid ""
"Additional rental rates can be configured on the *Prices* tab, though these "
