"價格規則。如果事先未配置任何價格表，系統會選取 *預設* 價格表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:229
msgid ""
"Using the same scenario in the :ref:`Pricelists method example "
"<rental/service_products/pricelists-example>`, use the :guilabel:`Prices` "
"tab method by navigating to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> "
"Products` and click the desired product to configure. Click the "
":guilabel:`Prices` tab and select the :guilabel:`Photographer Rental` option"
" for the :guilabel:`Pricelist` column. Enter `8` in the :guilabel:`Min. "
