#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:152
msgid ""
"Configuring the use of "
":doc:`../../../services/project/project_management/project_templates` on the"
" product form creates new projects with predefined tasks, priority levels, "
"and assigned employees. When integrated with the **Planning** app, the "
"system automatically schedules and publishes an employee's shift if their "
"availability matches the rental period. Priority is given to employees with "
"the relevant :ref:`roles <planning/planning-roles>` if applicable."
msgstr ""
"在產品表單中設定使用 :doc:`../../../services/project/project_management/"
"project_templates` 時，系統會建立包含預先定義任務、優先級及已指派員工的新項目"
"。與 **規劃** 應用程式整合後，只要員工的空閒時間符合租賃期，系統便會自動排班"
"並發佈該員工的班次。如適用，系統會優先安排具備相關 :ref:`角色 <planning/"
"planning-roles>` 的員工。"

