#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:144
msgid ""
"To process a deposit return, the **Accounting** app must be installed. After"
" a customer :ref:`returns the rented item <rental/pickup_return/return>`, "
"begin the deposit return by preparing a :doc:`credit note "
"<../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` against the "
"original deposit invoice."
msgstr ""
"要處理按金退還，必須安裝**會計**應用程式。客戶:ref:`歸還租賃物品 <rental/"
"pickup_return/return>`後，請針對原按金發票建立:doc:`貸項通知單 <../../../"
"finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>`，以開始退還按金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:149
msgid ""
"First, go to the :menuselection:`Rental app --> Orders --> Orders`, and "
"select the correct rental order. Click the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` "
":guilabel:`Invoices` smart button, find the invoice for the deposit, and "
":ref:`issue a credit note <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>`."
msgstr ""
"首先，前往 :menuselection:`租賃應用程式 --> 訂單 --> 訂單`，並選擇正確的租賃"
"訂單。點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`發票` 智能按鈕，找出按金的發"
"票，然後 :ref:`開立貸記單 <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:153
msgid "A paid deposit invoice to show the Credit Note button."
msgstr "一張已付款的訂金發票，以顯示「貸項通知單」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:157
msgid ""
"When creating a credit note, enter `Security Deposit Refund` in the "
":guilabel:`Reason displayed on Credit Note` field in the *Credit Note* pop-"
"up window."
msgstr ""
"建立貸記單時，請在 *貸記單* 彈出視窗中的:guilabel:`貸記單上顯示的原因`欄位輸"
"入 `Security Deposit Refund`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:160
