#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:5
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to manage Lazada orders, inventory, deliveries, and "
"sales reporting within Odoo using the **Lazada Connector**. It covers "
"product catalog mapping, order synchronization, delivery processes, and "
"sales analysis to streamline your marketplace operations in Southeast Asia."
msgstr ""
"本指南說明如何在 Odoo 中使用 **Lazada 連接器**管理 Lazada 訂單、庫存、送貨及"
"銷售報告。內容涵蓋產品目錄對應、訂單同步、送貨流程及銷售分析，助你簡化東南亞"
"網上商城的營運流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:6
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:22
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:11
msgid "Product catalog mapping"
msgstr "產品目錄對應"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:13
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:9
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:18
msgid "New Odoo customers with no existing products"
msgstr "尚未有任何現有產品的新 Odoo 客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:15
msgid ""
"If you are starting a new Odoo database and your products exist only on "
"Lazada, you can import your Lazada product catalog into Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:18
msgid ""
"In `Lazada Seller Center <https://sellercenter.lazada.com.ph/>`_, use the "
":guilabel:`Bulk Manage` drop-down to export your product catalog, including "
"Lazada SKUs."
msgstr ""
"在 `Lazada Seller Center <https://sellercenter.lazada.com.ph/>`_ 中，使用 "
":guilabel:`批次管理` 下拉式選單匯出您的產品目錄（包括 Lazada SKU）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:23
msgid ""
"Import the exported catalog into Odoo via :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Products --> Import`. Map the Lazada SKU to the :guilabel:`Internal "
"Reference` field in Odoo to link your Lazada and Odoo products."
msgstr ""
"透過 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 產品 --> 匯入` 將匯出的目錄匯入 Odoo。將 "
"Lazada SKU 對應至 Odoo 中的 :guilabel:`內部參考` 欄位，即可連結你的 Lazada "
"與 Odoo 產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:26
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:32
msgid "Existing Odoo customers with products already in Odoo"
msgstr "已在 Odoo 中設有產品的現有 Odoo 客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you have an existing product catalog in Odoo, map your Lazada listings to"
" these products."
msgstr "如果你在 Odoo 已有產品目錄，請將你的 Lazada 上架商品對應至這些產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:32
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Sync Product Catalogue` button in Odoo to automatically "
"match active Lazada products."
msgstr ""
"使用 Odoo 中的 :guilabel:`同步產品目錄` 按鈕，即可自動配對使用中的 Lazada 產"
"品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:38
msgid ""
"Product catalog synchronization is an automated process initiated by the "
"synchronization."
msgstr "產品目錄同步是由同步程序啟動的自動化流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:43
msgid ""
"Orders are automatically fetched from Lazada and synchronized in Odoo at "
"regular intervals (every 60 minutes)."
msgstr "系統會定期（每 60 分鐘）自動從 Lazada 擷取訂單並同步至 Odoo。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:46
msgid ""
"Only orders with status :guilabel:`READY_TO_SHIP` or :guilabel:`PROCESSED` "
"are fetched, as these require shipping action."
msgstr ""
"系統只會擷取狀態為 :guilabel:`READY_TO_SHIP` 或 :guilabel:`PROCESSED` 的訂單"
"，因為這些訂單需要進行出貨處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:48
msgid ""
"When an order is canceled on Lazada, its status updates in Odoo. However, "
"cancelling an order in Odoo does not reflect on Lazada."
msgstr ""
"在 Lazada 取消訂單時，其狀態會在 Odoo 中更新。不過，在 Odoo 中取消訂單並不會"
"反映在 Lazada 上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:50
msgid ""
"For each synchronized order, Odoo creates a sales order and a customer "
"(contact) if the customer has not been previously imported or does not exist"
" in the database."
msgstr ""
"對於每張同步的訂單，Odoo 會建立一張銷售訂單；如果該客戶先前未曾匯入或並不存在"
"於資料庫中，亦會同時建立一個客戶（聯絡人）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:63
msgid ""
"Only orders requiring shipment are synchronized. Orders with statuses "
":guilabel:`SHIPPED`, :guilabel:`CANCEL`, :guilabel:`UNPAID`, or "
":guilabel:`COMPLETED` are excluded during synchronization."
msgstr ""
"僅會同步需要出貨的訂單。同步時會排除狀態為 :guilabel:`已出貨`、:guilabel:`已"
"取消`、:guilabel:`未付款` 或 :guilabel:`已完成` 的訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:61
msgid ""
"To synchronize an order whose status hasn't changed since the last "
"synchronization:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:63
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Lazada --> "
"Shops`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:64
msgid ""
"Select the Lazada Shop and modify the :guilabel:`Last Order Sync` date under"
" :guilabel:`Synchronization Information` to a date prior to the order's last"
" status change."
msgstr ""
"選擇 Lazada 商店，並將:guilabel:`上次訂單同步`（位於:guilabel:`同步資訊`下方"
"）的日期修改為訂單最後一次狀態變更之前的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:66
msgid "Save to trigger synchronization."
msgstr "儲存以觸發同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:69
msgid ""
"In Debug Mode, access the Lazada shop in Odoo and click :guilabel:`Sync "
"Orders` to immediately synchronize orders or :guilabel:`Sync Inventory` for "
"inventory updates."
msgstr ""
"在偵錯模式下，於 Odoo 中存取 Lazada 商店，然後點擊 :guilabel:`同步訂單` 以立"
"即同步訂單，或點擊 :guilabel:`同步庫存` 以更新庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:75
msgid ""
"For :abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled By Merchant)` orders, the **Lazada Connector** "
"creates a picking in the :menuselection:`Inventory` app, along with a sales "
"order and customer record, upon synchronization."
msgstr ""
"對於 :abbr:`FBM（商戶自配送，Fulfilled By Merchant）` 訂單，**Lazada 連接"
"器**在同步時會於 :menuselection:`庫存` 應用程式中建立揀貨單，同時建立銷售訂單"
"及客戶記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:78
msgid ""
"Arrange by comfirming the picking in Odoo, then navigate to *Lazada Seller "
"Center* and click :guilabel:`Pack Lazada Package` to generate the tracking "
"number. Odoo retrieves the shipping label and attahces it to the "
"corresponding delivery order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:81
msgid ""
"Validate the stock movement in Odoo to update inventory levels and confirm "
"the order has left the warehouse."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中驗證庫存調撥，以更新庫存水平並確認訂單已離開倉庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:85
msgid "Lazada package statuses"
msgstr "Lazada 包裹狀態"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:87
msgid ""
"Understanding Lazada package statuses is crucial for effective order "
"management:"
msgstr "了解 Lazada 包裹狀態對有效管理訂單至關重要："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Pending on Lazada`: The package is awaiting receipt, "
"tagging, or processing in the warehouse system."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Lazada 待處理包裹`：包裹正在倉庫系統中等候接收、標記或處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Confirmed on Lazada`: The package has been packed by the "
"seller or warehouse and is confirmed ready for courier pickup or dropoff. "
"Lazada is notified and updates the order status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已在 Lazada 確認包裹`：賣家或倉庫已將包裹包裝妥當，並確認準備好讓"
"速遞員上門收件或自行送往寄件點。系統會通知 Lazada 並更新訂單狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ready to Ship on Lazada`: The order is ready for shipment. Lazada"
" is notified and updates the order status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`準備在 Lazada 發貨`：訂單已準備好發貨。系統會通知 Lazada 並更新訂"
"單狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivered on Lazada`: The parcel has been dropped off or picked "
"up by the logistics provider."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已在 Lazada 交付`：包裹已寄放或已由物流供應商取件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`Canceled on Lazada`: The order has been canceled."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已在 Lazada 取消`：訂單已取消。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual handling required`: The package cannot be processed on "
"Odoo and requires manual handling on Lazada."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:103
msgid ""
"Lazada requires a tracking reference for each delivery. If the carrier "
"doesn't provide one automatically, set it manually in *Lazada Seller "
"Center*. Check supported logistics providers for your region (e.g., "
"Malaysia)."
msgstr ""
"Lazada 要求每次送貨都必須提供追蹤編號。如果物流承運商沒有自動提供，請在 "
"*Lazada Seller Center* 中手動設定。請查閱你所在地區（例如馬來西亞）支援的物流"
"供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:108
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:130
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:106
msgid "Order fulfillment process"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:110
msgid ""
"Lazada orders are automatically created in Odoo as sales orders. Select the "
"desired sales order in the **Sales app**."
msgstr ""
"Lazada 訂單會自動在 Odoo 中建立為銷售訂單。請在 **銷售應用程式** 中選擇所需的"
"銷售訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:112
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Pack Lazada Package` to arrange shipment in the delivery "
"transfer if you are using supported logistics providers. Odoo imports the "
"shipping label (delivery note) and tracking number, associating them with "
"the sales order."
msgstr ""
"點擊:guilabel:`打包 Lazada 包裹`，即可為受支援的物流供應商在送貨調撥中安排發"
"貨。Odoo 會匯入運送標籤（送貨單）及追蹤編號，並將其與銷售訂單關聯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:115
msgid "Confirm the stock movement in Odoo to reduce inventory levels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:120
msgid ""
"Due to Lazada's policy of not sharing customer email addresses, invoices "
"cannot be sent directly from Odoo. Instead:"
msgstr ""
"由於 Lazada 的政策不會分享客戶電郵地址，因此無法直接從 Odoo 發送發票。請改為"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:123
msgid ""
"Generate invoices in Odoo and manually upload them to *Lazada Seller "
"Center*."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中產生發票，並手動上載至 *Lazada Seller Center*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:124
msgid "Register Payments:"
msgstr "登記付款："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:126
msgid ""
"Create a dedicated :guilabel:`Bank Journal` (e.g., \"Lazada Payments\") with"
" a Bank and Cash intermediary account."
msgstr ""
"建立專用的 :guilabel:`銀行日記賬`（例如：\"Lazada Payments\"），並配合「銀行"
"及現金」中轉帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:128
msgid ""
"Since Lazada processes batch payments weekly or monthly, select all invoices"
" linked to a payment in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"由於 Lazada 每週或每月處理一次批量付款，請在 Odoo 中選擇所有與該付款關聯的發"
"票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:130
msgid ""
"Use :guilabel:`Batch Deposit` as the Payment Method, select the invoices, "
"and go to :menuselection:`Actions --> Create Batch Payment --> Validate`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`批量存款` 作為付款方式，選擇發票，然後前往 :menuselection:`操"
"作 --> 建立批量付款 --> 驗證`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:133
msgid ""
"Reconcile the payments after Lazada deposits the balance. Record it in the "
"bank statement and credit the Lazada intermediary account."
msgstr ""
"Lazada 存入結餘後，請進行付款對賬。將該筆款項記錄在銀行對賬單中，並貸記 "
"Lazada 中介賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:137
msgid "Apply the same process for vendor bills related to Lazada commissions."
msgstr "對與 Lazada 佣金相關的供應商賬單套用相同流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:140
msgid "Analyzing Lazada sales with Odoo Reporting"
msgstr "使用 Odoo 報告分析 Lazada 銷售情況"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:142
msgid ""
"Odoo's dashboard consolidates sales data from all channels. To analyze "
"Lazada sales specifically:"
msgstr "Odoo 儀表板會整合來自所有渠道的銷售數據。如要專門分析 Lazada 的銷售情況："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:144
msgid "Set Up Sales Teams:"
msgstr "設定銷售團隊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:146
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors --> Lazada --> Shops`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定 --> 連接器 --> "
"Lazada --> 商店`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:148
msgid ""
"Assign a dedicated sales team to each Lazada shop for isolated reporting."
msgstr "為每間 Lazada 商店指派專屬銷售團隊，以便產生獨立報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:150
msgid ""
"Use the dashboard filters to view sales data for the assigned Lazada sales "
"team."
msgstr "使用儀表板篩選條件，以查看已指派 Lazada 銷售團隊的銷售數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:153
msgid ""
"Configure separate sales teams for each Lazada marketplace to generate "
"detailed performance reports."
msgstr "為每個 Lazada 市場分別設定獨立的銷售團隊，以產生詳細的績效報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:3
msgid "Lazada Connector configuration"
msgstr "Lazada 連接器設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:5
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to set up the **Lazada Connector** in Odoo to "
"integrate your Lazada Seller account(s) and manage multiple marketplaces "
"efficiently in Southeast Asia. Follow these steps to configure your account,"
" synchronize your product catalog, and prepare your shop for go-live."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:12
msgid "Before configuring the **Lazada Connector**, ensure you have:"
msgstr "配置 **Lazada 連接器** 前，請確保您已具備："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:14
msgid ""
"A Lazada Seller account (:guilabel:`Personal Self-Developed` or "
":guilabel:`Enterprise Self-Developed`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:16
msgid "A valid email address and phone number for verification."
msgstr "用於驗證的有效電郵地址及電話號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:17
msgid ""
"A digital copy of your business license (for :guilabel:`Enterprise Self-"
"Developed` accounts)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:18
msgid ""
"A brief description of your integration purpose (e.g., \"Connecting Odoo ERP"
" to our Lazada store for order and inventory synchronization\")."
msgstr ""
"簡短描述您的整合用途（例如：「將 Odoo ERP 連接至我們的 Lazada 商店，以進行訂"
"單及庫存同步」）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:22
msgid ""
"The *Lazada Open Platform* account for API access is separate from your "
"*Lazada Seller account*."
msgstr ""
"用於 API 存取的 *Lazada Open Platform* 帳戶與您的 *Lazada 賣家帳戶* 各自獨立"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:25
msgid "Create a Lazada Open Platform account"
msgstr "建立 Lazada 開放平台帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:27
msgid ""
"Open `Lazada Open Platform <https://open.lazada.com/>`_ and click "
":guilabel:`Create Account` or :guilabel:`Sign Up`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:29
msgid ""
"Navigate to the profile and in the :guilabel:`Basic information`, begin "
"filling in the fields to start the registration process."
msgstr "前往個人檔案，並在:guilabel:`基本資料`中開始填寫欄位，以啟動註冊流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:32
msgid ""
"Under account information, select one of the following selections for "
":guilabel:`Partner type`:"
msgstr "在帳戶資料下方，為 :guilabel:`合作夥伴類型` 選擇以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Personal Self-Developed`: For individuals without a business "
"license."
msgstr ":guilabel:`個人自行開發`：適用於沒有營業執照的個人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Enterprise Self-Developed`: For businesses with a registered "
"license."
msgstr ":guilabel:`企業自行開發`：適用於持有註冊營業執照的企業。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:39
msgid ""
"Do **not** select other service provider types, as they are not applicable "
"for Odoo integration."
msgstr "請 **切勿** 選擇其他服務供應商類型，因為它們不適用於 Odoo 整合。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:41
msgid ""
"Continuing on the same page, fill out the following information to complete "
"registration under the **Personal information** section:"
msgstr "繼續在同一頁面的 **個人資料** 部分填寫以下資料以完成註冊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:44
msgid ""
"Enter your phone number, email, and address. Complete any verification steps"
" (e.g., :abbr:`OTP (One-Time Password)` via SMS)."
msgstr ""
"輸入您的電話號碼、電郵及地址，並完成所有驗證步驟（例如透過短訊接收 "
":abbr:`OTP (一次性密碼)`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:46
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Enterprise Self-Developed` accounts, upload your business "
"license."
msgstr "對於 :guilabel:`企業自行開發` 帳戶，請上載您的營業執照。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:47
msgid ""
"Provide a brief introduction (e.g., \"Integration for Odoo ERP to sync "
"orders, inventory, and fees with Lazada\")."
msgstr "提供簡短介紹（例如：「整合 Odoo ERP 與 Lazada，以同步訂單、庫存及費用」）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:50
msgid ""
"After completing the details, click :guilabel:`Submit` to submit your "
"profile details. Approval typically takes a few hours to a couple of "
"business days. Check your registered email for confirmation or requests for "
"additional information."
msgstr ""
"填妥詳細資料後，按一下 :guilabel:`提交` 以提交您的檔案資料。審批通常需時數小"
"時至數個工作天。請留意您註冊電郵中的確認訊息或補充資料要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:53
msgid ""
"If approval status is rejected, review the reason in the notification email "
"or on the *Lazada Open Platform Console*. Edit and resubmit as needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:57
msgid ""
"Ensure profile details are accurate to avoid delays. Common issues include "
"incorrect account type selection or missing business license documents."
msgstr ""
"請確保檔案資料準確無誤，以免延誤。常見問題包括選錯帳戶類型或欠缺營業執照文件"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:61
msgid "Create an app on Lazada Open Platform"
msgstr "在 Lazada 開放平台建立應用程式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:63
msgid ""
"To obtain the :guilabel:`App Key` and :guilabel:`App Secret` for Odoo "
"integration:"
msgstr "要取得用於 Odoo 整合的 :guilabel:`App Key` 及 :guilabel:`App Secret`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:65
msgid ""
"Log in to the `Lazada Open Platform Console <https://open.lazada.com/>`_, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`App Console`, :menuselection:`App Management`, "
"and click :guilabel:`Create App`."
msgstr ""
"登入 `Lazada 開放平台主控台 <https://open.lazada.com/>`_，前往 "
":menuselection:`應用程式主控台`、:menuselection:`應用程式管理`，並點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立應用程式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:71
msgid "For :guilabel:`App Category`, select :guilabel:`Seller In-house APP`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`應用程式類別` 中，選擇 :guilabel:`賣家內部應用程式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:72
msgid "Fill out the rest of the application form:"
msgstr "填寫申請表的其餘部分："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:74
msgid ""
"Provide your Odoo database URL and tester account credentials (name and "
"password)."
msgstr "提供你的 Odoo 資料庫網址及測試員帳戶憑證（名稱及密碼）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:75
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`APP IP Address Management`, select :guilabel:`IP address(es) "
"unavailable` and enter \"The application is cloud-hosted.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:78
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Submit` to process the application. The app creation takes "
"approximately 24 hours. Once approved, note the :guilabel:`App Key` and "
":guilabel:`App Secret`."
msgstr ""
"點擊:guilabel:`提交`以處理申請。建立應用程式需時約 24 小時。獲批後，記"
"下:guilabel:`應用程式金鑰`和:guilabel:`應用程式密鑰`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:82
msgid "Connect Lazada Seller account to Odoo"
msgstr "將 Lazada 賣家帳戶連結至 Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:84
msgid ""
"To connect a Lazada Seller account in Odoo, navigate to :guilabel:`App` from"
" your Database, search for Lazada, and click :guilabel:`Activate`."
msgstr ""
"要在 Odoo 中連接 Lazada 賣家帳戶，請從你的資料庫前往 :guilabel:`應用程式`，搜"
"尋 Lazada，然後點擊 :guilabel:`啟用`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:89
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Lazada Sync` by navigating to :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Configuration`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:93
msgid "Connect a Lazada Seller account:"
msgstr "連接 Lazada 賣家帳戶："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:95
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Sales --> Configuration --> Lazada --> Shops` and "
"click :guilabel:`Create New Shop`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`銷售 --> 配置 --> Lazada --> 商店`，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立新商店`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:97
msgid ""
"Enter a name (e.g., \"Lazada Malaysia\"), :guilabel:`App Key`, "
":guilabel:`App Secret`, and select the marketplace (e.g., Lazada.com.my)."
msgstr ""
"輸入名稱（例如「Lazada Malaysia」）、:guilabel:`應用程式金鑰`、:guilabel:`應"
"用程式密鑰`，並選擇網上市場（例如 Lazada.com.my）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:102
msgid "Link the account by doing the following:"
msgstr "請按照以下步驟連結帳戶："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:104
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Create Shop & Authorize`."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`建立商店並授權`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:105
msgid ""
"Click the button to redirect to the Lazada login or consent page. Log in "
"with your Lazada Seller account credentials and grant Odoo access."
msgstr ""
"點擊按鈕以重新導向至 Lazada 登入或同意授權頁面。使用你的 Lazada 賣家帳戶憑證"
"登入，並向 Odoo 授予存取權限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:110
msgid ""
"Upon successful authorization, Odoo lists available marketplaces under the "
":guilabel:`Lazada Shops` tab."
msgstr "成功授權後，Odoo 會在 :guilabel:`Lazada 商店` 分頁下列出可用的銷售平台。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:115
msgid "Manage Marketplaces:"
msgstr "管理網上市場："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:117
msgid ""
"Newly added marketplaces are automatically synchronized. To disable "
"synchronization for specific marketplaces, remove them from the list."
msgstr "新增的市場會自動同步。如要停用特定市場的同步功能，請將其從清單中移除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:119
msgid ""
"Avoid synchronizing the same shop multiple times to prevent duplicate "
"orders."
msgstr "避免多次同步同一間商店，以防止出現重複訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:123
msgid ""
"To maintain data integrity, ensure each shop is synchronized only once. If "
"synchronization fails, try manually fetching orders before reconfiguring."
msgstr ""
"為確保資料完整性，請確保每間商店只同步一次。如果同步失敗，請在重新設定前嘗試"
"手動擷取訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:127
msgid "Configure the shop before go-live"
msgstr "在正式上線前設定商店"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:129
msgid "Set up warehouses:"
msgstr "設定倉庫："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:131
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors --> Lazada --> Lazada Shops`."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定 --> 連接器 --> Lazada --> "
"Lazada 商店`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:133
msgid ""
"Select the Lazada shop and configure the :guilabel:`FBM Warehouse` field to "
"limit stock fetching to specific warehouses."
msgstr ""
"選擇 Lazada 商店並設定 :guilabel:`FBM 倉庫` 欄位，以限制只從特定倉庫擷取庫存"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:135
msgid ""
"By default, all accounts use the same Lazada stock location. To isolate "
"stock for a specific marketplace, create a separate account registration and"
" assign a unique stock location."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，所有賬戶都會使用相同的 Lazada 庫存位置。若要為特定市集平台隔離庫"
"存，請建立獨立的賬戶註冊，並指派專屬的庫存位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:139
msgid ""
"To manually trigger re-initialization of the catalog, clear the "
":guilabel:`Last Catalog Synchronization` before clicking :guilabel:`Sync "
"Catalog`."
msgstr ""
"如要手動觸發目錄重新初始化，請先清除 :guilabel:`上次目錄同步`，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`同步目錄`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:142
msgid "Synchronize the product catalog:"
msgstr "同步產品目錄："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:144
msgid ""
"The product catalog is automatically matched during the first "
"synchronization. However, it is recommended to synchronize the product "
"catalog in the following scenarios:"
msgstr "產品目錄會在首次同步時自動配對。不過，建議在以下情況同步產品目錄："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:147
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Sync Catalog` button in Odoo to automatically fetch "
"active Lazada products daily."
msgstr "使用 Odoo 中的 :guilabel:`同步目錄` 按鈕，每日自動擷取使用中的 Lazada 產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:149
msgid ""
"For new Odoo databases, export the Lazada catalog from *Lazada Seller "
"Center* (including SKUs). Import into Odoo via :menuselection:`Inventory app"
" --> Products --> Import`, mapping SKUs to the :guilabel:`Internal "
"Reference` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:152
msgid ""
"For existing Odoo products, export both Lazada and Odoo catalogs, map SKUs "
"to :guilabel:`Internal References` in a spreadsheet, and import the updated "
"mappings back into Odoo."
msgstr ""
"對於現有的 Odoo 產品，請匯出 Lazada 及 Odoo 目錄，在試算表中將 SKU 對應至 "
":guilabel:`內部參考`，然後將更新後的對應關係匯入回 Odoo。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:157
msgid ""
"Test catalog synchronization with a small product set to verify SKU mappings"
" before full import."
msgstr "在完整匯入前，先使用少量產品測試目錄同步，以驗證 SKU 對應。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices.rst:5
msgid "Products & Prices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:3
msgid "Use eWallets and gift cards"
msgstr "使用電子錢包及禮品卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:5
msgid ""
"With Odoo, customers can use **eWallets** and **gift cards** for online and "
"in-store shopping."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:7
msgid ""
"To enable eWallets and gift cards for eCommerce and Point of Sale (PoS), "
"first enable :guilabel:`Discounts, Loyalty & Gift Card` under "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> Pricing "
"section`. Once enabled, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> "
"Gift cards & eWallet` and :guilabel:`Create` a new eWallet or gift card "
"program."
msgstr ""
"如要為電子商務及銷售點（PoS）啟用電子錢包及禮品卡，請先啟用 :guilabel:`折扣、"
"忠誠度及禮品卡`（位於 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定 --> 定價"
"部分` 內）。啟用後，前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產品 --> 禮品卡及電"
"子錢包` 並:guilabel:`建立`新的電子錢包或禮品卡計劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:17
msgid ""
"eWallets allow customers to save credits on their online account and use "
"these credits as a payment method when buying items in an online store or a "
"brick-and-mortar store. eWallets can also be used to centralize multiple "
":ref:`gift cards <ewallet_gift/gift-cards>`."
msgstr ""
"電子錢包讓客戶將儲值餘額保存於網上帳戶，並在網上商店或實體店購物時用作付款方"
"式。電子錢包亦可用於集中管理多張:ref:`禮品卡 <ewallet_gift/gift-cards>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:21
msgid ""
"Before creating an eWallet program, it is necessary to create an eWallet "
"**top-up** product. Top-ups are pre-defined digital credit values added to "
"an eWallet in exchange for its equivalent in real currency. These credits "
"can then be used as a payment method in the eCommerce shop or :abbr:`PoS "
"(Point of Sale)`. Top-up values can be of different amounts."
msgstr ""
"建立電子錢包計劃前，必須先建立電子錢包 **增值** 產品。增值是指預先定義的數碼"
"信用額度，顧客以等值的真實貨幣兌換並加入電子錢包。這些信用額度隨後可在電子商"
"務網店或 :abbr:`PoS (銷售點)` 中用作付款方式。增值面額可設為不同金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:27
msgid ""
"A $50 top-up can be bought for $50, and adds that same amount of credits to "
"the eWallet."
msgstr "支付 $50 即可購買 $50 增值額，並將相同金額的儲值加入電子錢包。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:29
msgid ""
"To create a top-up product, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products -->"
" Products` and :guilabel:`Create` a new product. On the product template, "
"configure the options as follows:"
msgstr ""
"若要建立增值產品，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產品 --> 產品`，然"
"後 :guilabel:`建立` 新產品。在產品範本上，按以下方式配置選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Name`: enter a name for the top-up product (for example, "
"`$50 Top-Up`)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`產品名稱`：輸入增值產品的名稱（例如 `$50 增值`）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:94
msgid ":guilabel:`Can be Sold`: enabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:34
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:95
msgid ":guilabel:`Product Type`: select :guilabel:`Service`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`產品類型`：選擇 :guilabel:`服務`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:96
msgid ":guilabel:`Invoicing Policy`: select :guilabel:`Prepaid/Fixed Price`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`開立發票政策`：選擇 :guilabel:`預付/固定價格`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:36
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:97
msgid ":guilabel:`Create on Order`: select :guilabel:`Nothing`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`下單時建立`：選擇 :guilabel:`無`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:37
msgid ":guilabel:`Sales Price`: enter the amount of the top-up"
msgstr ":guilabel:`銷售價格`：輸入增值金額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:40
msgid ""
"In order to have eWallet top-ups of different amounts, create multiple top-"
"up products and modify the :guilabel:`Sales Price` accordingly."
msgstr ""
