#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:163
msgid "Configuring a discount"
msgstr "設定折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:166
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is applied to a sales quotation with the :guilabel:`Apply` "
"field set to :guilabel:`Discount`, the discount is visible to the customer."
msgstr ""
"如果在銷售報價單套用價格表，且:guilabel:`套用`欄位設為:guilabel:`折扣`，客戶"
