#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:169
msgid "To configure a percentage discount, follow these steps:"
msgstr "要配置百分比折扣，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:171
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Discount` for the :guilabel:`Apply` field."
msgstr "選擇 :guilabel:`折扣` 作為 :guilabel:`套用` 欄位的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:172
msgid ""
"Enter the percentage to be discounted in the :guilabel:`Discount` field. A "
"markup can be configured by using a negative value in this field."
msgstr "在:guilabel:`折扣`欄位中輸入折扣百分比。如要設定加價，可在該欄位輸入負數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:174
msgid ""
"Select the base price Odoo uses to calculate the discount percentage. The "
"default is :guilabel:`sales price`, which refers to the *Sales Price* field "
"on the product form. Click into the field to select a pricelist or "
":ref:`create a new one <sales/products/price-rules>` from the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:178
msgid ""
"Enter a value for the :guilabel:`Round off to` field (optional). This field "
"rounds the price to the nearest multiple of this value and is applied "
"*after* the discount."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`捨入至`欄位輸入數值（選填）。此欄位會將價格捨入至最接近該數值的"
"倍數，並於套用折扣*之後*生效。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:180
msgid ""
"Enter a price for the :guilabel:`Add` field (optional). The price is added "
"to the amount (or subtracted, if negative) calculated with the discount."
msgstr ""
"為 :guilabel:`加上` 欄位輸入價格（選填）。系統會將該價格加到折扣計算後的金額"
"中（若為負數則會扣減）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:182
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:207
msgid ""
"Enter the minimum amount of margin over the base price in the "
":guilabel:`Margins` fields (optional)."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`利潤率` 欄位中輸入高於基本價格的最低利潤金額（選填）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:185
msgid ""
"A Discount price rule configuration on the Create Pricelist Rules form."
msgstr "「建立價格表規則」表格上的折扣價格規則配置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:191
msgid "Configuring a surcharge"
msgstr "設定附加費"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:194
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is applied to a sales quotation with the :guilabel:`Apply` "
"field set to :guilabel:`Surcharge`, the surcharge is *not* visible to the "
