msgid "Select :guilabel:`Surcharge` for the :guilabel:`Apply` field."
msgstr "選擇 :guilabel:`附加費` 作為 :guilabel:`套用` 欄位的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:200
msgid "Enter the percentage to be added in the :guilabel:`Surcharge` field."
msgstr "在:guilabel:`附加費`欄位中輸入要加上的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:201
msgid ""
"Select the base price option Odoo uses to calculate the surcharge "
"percentage: :guilabel:`Sales Price`, :guilabel:`Cost` (both pulled from the "
"product form), or :guilabel:`Other Pricelist`."
msgstr ""
"選擇 Odoo 用於計算附加費百分比的基本價格選項：:guilabel:`銷售價"
"格`、:guilabel:`成本`（兩者皆取自產品表單），或:guilabel:`其他價格表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:203
msgid ""
"Enter a value for the :guilabel:`Round off to` field (optional). This field "
"rounds the price to the nearest multiple of this value and is applied "
"*after* the surcharge."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:205
msgid ""
"Enter a price for the :guilabel:`Add` field (optional). The price is added "
"to the amount (or subtracted, if negative) calculated with the surcharge."
msgstr ""
