msgstr ""
"負數附加費會變成折扣。如要讓價格以 9.99 結尾，請將:guilabel:`捨入至`數值設為 "
"`10`，並將:guilabel:`加上`設為 `-0.01`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:217
