msgid "Choosing :guilabel:`Edit` opens the price rule pop-up window."
msgstr "選擇 :guilabel:`編輯` 會開啟價格規則彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:296
msgid ""
"Choosing :guilabel:`Delete` triggers a confirmation window; click "
