#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:310
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Members` smart button."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`成員` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:311
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New` to open a blank contact form."
msgstr "點擊:guilabel:`新增`以開啟空白聯絡人表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:312
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Name` field, click and type the name of an existing "
"contact and select it or :doc:`create a new one "
