msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:315
msgid ""
"Another way to do this is through the :ref:`customer contact form "
"<sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>`."
msgstr ""
"另一種方式是透過 :ref:`客戶聯絡人表單 <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>` 進行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:321
msgid "Pricelist rule logic"
msgstr "價格表規則邏輯"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:323
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically selects a pricelist for a quotation when none has been "
"manually assigned. It checks the pricelists in the order they appear on the "
"*Pricelists* page, from top to bottom, and applies the first one whose "
"conditions match the quotation's details."
msgstr ""
"若未有手動指派價目表，Odoo 會自動為報價單選擇一個價目表。系統會按照價目表在 "
"*價目表* 頁面上由上至下的顯示順序進行檢查，並套用首個符合該報價單詳情條件的價"
"目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:327
msgid ""
"When multiple pricelist rules apply to the same product on the same "
"pricelist, Odoo determines priority using this order:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:330
msgid ""
":ref:`Most specific to least specific <sales/pricing/most-to-least-"
"specific>`: More specific rules take priority over general ones."
msgstr ""
":ref:`由最具體至最不具體 <sales/pricing/most-to-least-specific>`：較具體的規"
"則優先於一般規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:332
msgid ""
":ref:`Minimum quantity (largest first) <sales/pricing/minimum-quantity>`: "
"The higher quantity thresholds take priority over lower ones."
msgstr ""
":ref:`最少數量（由大至小） <sales/pricing/minimum-quantity>`：較高的數量門檻"
"會優先於較低的數量門檻。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:334
msgid ""
":ref:`Category order <sales/pricing/category-order>`: Manually configured "
"category hierarchy breaks remaining ties, with the subcategory taking "
"priority over the parent category."
msgstr ""
":ref:`類別順序 <sales/pricing/category-order>`：手動配置的類別層級會決定其餘"
"相同優先級的規則，其中子類別會優先於上層類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:336
msgid ""
":ref:`Creation date (newest first) <sales/pricing/creation-date>`: The most "
"recently created rule takes priority if all else is equal."
msgstr ""
":ref:`建立日期（最新優先） <sales/pricing/creation-date>`：若其他條件相同，則"
"以最近建立的規則為優先。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:342
msgid "1. Most specific to least specific"
msgstr "1. 從最具體到最不具體"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:344
msgid ""
"A rule on a specific variant always takes priority over a broader rule, so a"
" special price for one variant overrides a general category discount."
msgstr ""
"針對特定變體的規則總是優先於較廣泛的規則，因此單一變體的特別價格會覆蓋一般類"
"別折扣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:347
msgid "**Product variant**: Applies to the selected variant of the product."
msgstr "**產品款式**：適用於所選的產品款式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:348
msgid "**Product**: Applies to all variants of a product."
msgstr "**產品**：適用於某產品的所有變體。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:349
msgid "**Subcategory**: Applies to all products within the subcategory."
msgstr "**子類別**：適用於該子類別內的所有產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:350
msgid "**Parent category**: Applies to all products in the parent category."
msgstr "**上層類別**：適用於上層類別中的所有產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:351
msgid "**All products**: Applies to all products within the database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:352
msgid ""
"**All categories**: Applies to all products with an assigned category. This "
"doesn't include uncategorized products."
msgstr "**所有類別**：適用於所有已指定類別的產品，不包括未分類的產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:358
msgid "2. Minimum quantity (largest first)"
msgstr "2. 最低數量（由大至小）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:360
msgid ""
"If the product specificity is the same, then rules with a higher minimum "
"quantity take priority over rules with a lower (or no) minimum. This keeps "
"bulk-pricing rules (e.g., 10 units) from being overridden by a generic rule "
"that also matches."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:367
msgid "3. Category order"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:369
msgid ""
"If rules have the same specificity and same minimum quantity, Odoo uses the "
"manually configured category hierarchy, meaning the sequence is set on the "
"categories themselves."
msgstr ""
"若規則的適用具體程度及最低數量相同，Odoo 會採用手動設定的類別階層，即按照類別"
"本身設定的順序套用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:375
msgid "4. Creation date (newest first)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:377
msgid ""
"If everything else is equal, the most recently created rule takes priority. "
"This allows newer rules to override older ones with identical conditions, "
"which is useful when rules are updated or replaced without deleting the old "
"ones immediately."
msgstr ""
"如果其他條件相同，最新建立的規則會獲優先套用。這樣可讓新規則覆蓋條件相同的舊"
"規則，特別適合在更新或取代規則時使用，毋須即時刪除舊規則。"

