msgstr ":guilabel:`固定價格`：輸入 `2`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:613
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Save & Close` to add the pricelist rule to the pricelist. "
"The pricelist should now have three pricelist rules for all the package "
