"點擊:guilabel:`儲存並關閉`，將價目表規則加入價目表。現在該價目表應包含所有包"
"裝類型的三項價目表規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:617
msgid ""
"To enable the :guilabel:`Packaging` column in the *Rules* tab, enable it "
