msgstr ""
"要在 *規則* 分頁中啟用 :guilabel:`包裝` 欄，請從 :icon:`tune` :guilabel:`（篩"
"選）` 圖示中啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:621
msgid "Example of a pricelist for product packaging types."
msgstr "產品包裝類型價格表的範例。"

