msgstr ":doc:`discounts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products.rst:5
msgid "Manage your products"
msgstr "管理你的產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:3
msgid "Import products"
msgstr "匯入產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Sales** app provides a template for importing products with "
"categories and variants, which can be opened and edited with any spreadsheet"
" software (Microsoft Excel, OpenOffice, Google Sheets, etc.) A properly "
"formatted spreadsheet can be uploaded to an Odoo database. Within minutes, "
"all the products and their variants are live within Odoo and accessible in "
"the product catalog."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **銷售**應用程式提供用於匯入產品（包含類別及變體）的範本，可使用任何試算"
"表軟件（Microsoft Excel、OpenOffice、Google 試算表等）開啟及編輯。將格式正確"
"的試算表上載至 Odoo 資料庫後，所有產品及其變體即可在數分鐘內於 Odoo 上線，並"
"可在產品目錄中存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:11
msgid "Download template"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:13
msgid ""
"To import products with categories and variants, download the *Import "
"Template for Products*. Once downloaded, the template can be adjusted and "
"customized, then uploaded into an Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"如要匯入包含類別及變體的產品，請下載 *產品匯入範本*。下載後，你可以調整及自訂"
"該範本，然後上載至 Odoo 資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:16
msgid ""
"To download the template, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products"
" --> Products`. On the :guilabel:`Products` page, click the :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(Action)` icon in the upper-left corner. From the drop-down menu,"
" select the :guilabel:`Import records` option."
msgstr ""
"要下載範本，請前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產品 --> 產品`。"
"在:guilabel:`產品`頁面，點擊左上角的 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（動作）`圖示"
"。從下拉式選單中，選擇:guilabel:`匯入記錄`選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:20
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`Import records` opens a new page with an "
":guilabel:`Import Template for Products` link to download the template. Once"
" downloaded, open the spreadsheet file to customize it."
msgstr ""
"選擇:guilabel:`匯入記錄`會開啟一個新頁面，其中包含:guilabel:`產品匯入範本`連"
"結以下載範本。下載後，開啟試算表檔案進行自訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Import records option selectable from the cog icon on the Products page "
"in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "在 Odoo 銷售應用程式的「產品」頁面上，可從齒輪圖示中選取「匯入記錄」選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:27
msgid "Common product import template considerations"
msgstr "常見產品匯入範本注意事項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:29
msgid ""
"When modifying the product import template, keep in mind the following:"
msgstr "修改產品匯入範本時，請謹記以下事項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:31
msgid "Unnecessary columns may be removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:32
msgid "Keeping the :guilabel:`Internal Reference` column is recommended."
msgstr "建議保留:guilabel:`內部參考`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:33
msgid ""
"Having a unique identifier (e.g., `FURN_001`) for each product in the "
":guilabel:`Internal Reference` column can be helpful in many cases. This "
"number can even be reused from previous software spreadsheets to ease the "
"transition into Odoo. For example, when updating imported products, the same"
" file can be imported several times without creating duplicates."
msgstr ""
"在許多情況下，為每個產品在 :guilabel:`內部參考` 欄位設定唯一識別碼（例如"
"：`FURN_001`）會非常有幫助。你甚至可以重用之前軟件試算表中的編號，以便更順利"
"過渡至 Odoo。例如，在更新已匯入的產品時，可多次匯入同一檔案而不會建立重複項目"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:37
msgid ""
"Do **not** change the labels of columns that are meant to be imported. "
"Otherwise, Odoo won't recognize them, requiring them to be configured "
"manually on the import screen."
msgstr ""
"請 **勿** 更改要匯入的資料欄標籤。否則，Odoo 將無法識別這些欄位，需要你在匯入"
"畫面上以手動方式設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:39
msgid ""
"New columns may be added to the template spreadsheet, if desired. However, "
"newly added columns **must** exist in Odoo. If Odoo can't match a column's "
"name with a field, it can be matched manually during the import process."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可在範本試算表中新增欄位。然而，新增的欄位 **必須** 已存在於 Odoo "
"中。如果 Odoo 無法將欄位名稱與系統欄位配對，可在匯入過程中手動配對。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:43
msgid ""
"When importing a completed template, Odoo displays a page showing all the "
"elements of the newly configured product template spreadsheet separated by "
":guilabel:`File Column`, :guilabel:`Odoo Field`, and :guilabel:`Comments`. "
"To manually match a column name with a field in Odoo, click the "
":guilabel:`Odoo Field` drop-down menu next to the :guilabel:`File Column` "
"that needs a manual adjustment and select the appropriate field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:49
msgid ""
"The Odoo Field drop-down menu next to a Field Column that needs to be "
"manually adjusted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:53
msgid "Import product template spreadsheet"
msgstr "匯入產品範本試算表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:55
msgid ""
"After customizing the product template spreadsheet, return to the Odoo "
"product import page, where the template download link is found, and click "
"the :guilabel:`Upload File` button in the upper-left corner. A pop-up window"
" appears where the completed product template spreadsheet file can be "
"selected and uploaded to Odoo."
msgstr ""
"自訂產品範本試算表後，返回包含範本下載連結的 Odoo 產品匯入頁面，然後點擊左上"
"角的 :guilabel:`上載檔案` 按鈕。此時會出現一個彈出視窗，您可在其中選擇已完成"
"的產品範本試算表檔案並上載至 Odoo。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:60
msgid ""
"After that, Odoo displays a page that shows all the elements of the newly "
"configured product template spreadsheet, organized by :guilabel:`File "
"Column`, :guilabel:`Odoo Field`, and :guilabel:`Comments`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:64
msgid ""
"The import a file page in Odoo Sales after a product template has been "
"uploaded."
msgstr "上傳產品範本後，Odoo 銷售應用程式中的匯入檔案頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:67
msgid ""
"From here, the :guilabel:`File Column` can be manually assigned to an "
":guilabel:`Odoo Field`, if necessary."
msgstr "如有需要，您可在此手動將 :guilabel:`檔案欄位` 指派至 :guilabel:`Odoo 欄位`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:70
msgid ""
"To ensure everything is appropriate and that all the columns and fields are "
"aligned correctly, click the :guilabel:`Test` button in the upper-left "
"corner. If everything is lined up and applied correctly, Odoo displays a "
"blue banner at the top of the page that reads :guilabel:`Everything seems "
"valid`. If there are any errors, Odoo displays a red banner at the top of "
"the page with instructions on where to locate the specific issues and how to"
" fix them. Once those errors are fixed, click :guilabel:`Test` again to "
"ensure all necessary issues have been remedied appropriately."
msgstr ""
"為確保一切正確無誤且所有直欄與欄位均已正確對齊，請按一下左上角的 "
":guilabel:`測試` 按鈕。若所有項目皆已對齊並正確套用，Odoo 會在頁面頂部顯示藍"
"色橫幅，內容為 :guilabel:`一切似乎有效`。若出現任何錯誤，Odoo 會在頁面頂部顯"
"示紅色橫幅，提供尋找具體問題位置及修正方法的指示。修正這些錯誤後，請再次按一"
"下 :guilabel:`測試`，以確保所有必要問題均已妥善解決。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:77
msgid ""
"If additional product template spreadsheets need to be uploaded, click the "
":guilabel:`Load Data File` button, select the desired template, and repeat "
"the process."
msgstr ""
"如果需要上載更多產品範本試算表，請按一下 :guilabel:`載入資料檔案` 按鈕，選擇"
"所需的範本，然後重複此步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:80
msgid ""
"When everything is ready, click the :guilabel:`Import` button. When clicked,"
" Odoo instantly imports those products and reveals the main "
":guilabel:`Products` page, with a pop-up message in the upper-right corner. "
"This pop-up message informs the user how many products were successfully "
"imported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:85
msgid ""
"At this point, all the newly imported products are accessible and editable "
"on the :guilabel:`Products` page."
msgstr "此時，所有新匯入的產品均可在:guilabel:`產品`頁面中存取及編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:89
msgid "Import relation fields, attributes, and variants"
msgstr "匯入關聯欄位、屬性及款式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:91
msgid ""
"It's important to note that an item in an Odoo database always has "
"connections to other items. For example, a product is linked to product "
"categories, attributes, vendors, and related information. These "
"links/connections are known as relations."
msgstr ""
"請注意，Odoo 資料庫中的項目總是與其他項目有所關聯。例如，產品會連結至產品類別"
"、屬性、供應商及相關資訊。這些連結或關聯稱為「關聯」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:96
msgid ""
"To import product relations, the records of the related object **must be "
"imported first** from their own list menu."
msgstr "要匯入產品關聯，**必須先從各自的清單選單匯入** 相關物件的記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:100
msgid "Relation fields"
msgstr "關聯欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:102
msgid ""
"In Odoo, product forms include several fields that can be modified and "
"customized at any time. These fields are available on every tab of a product"
" form. While these fields can be edited directly on the product form, they "
"can also be modified via a product import. Relation fields of this nature "
"can **only** be imported for products if the fields already exist in the "
"database. For example, if a user attempts to import a product with a "
"*Product Type*, it must be one of the preconfigured product types in the "
"database (e.g., *Tracked Product*, *Untracked*, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，產品表單包含多個可隨時修改及自訂的欄位，並顯示於產品表單的每個分"
"頁上。這些欄位除了可直接於產品表單編輯外，亦可透過產品匯入進行修改。此類關聯"
"欄位**僅可**在欄位已存在於數據庫時為產品匯入。例如，若用戶嘗試匯入帶有*產品類"
"型*的產品，該類型必須為數據庫中預先配置的產品類型之一（例如*已追蹤產品*、*未"
"追蹤*等）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:109
msgid ""
"To import information for a relation field on a product import template "
"spreadsheet, add the name of the field as a column name/title on the "
"spreadsheet. Then add the desired relation field option on the appropriate "
"product line. When all desired relation field information has been entered, "
"save the spreadsheet and import it to the database. Go to the "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products`. On the "
":guilabel:`Product` page click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Action)` icon "
"and select :menuselection:`Import records --> Upload File`."
msgstr ""
"要在產品匯入範本試算表中匯入關聯欄位的資料，請在試算表中將該欄位的名稱加入為"
"欄名／標題，然後在適當的產品資料行加入所需的關聯欄位選項。輸入所有所需的關聯"
"欄位資料後，儲存試算表並將其匯入資料庫。前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程"
"式 --> 產品 --> 產品`。在 :guilabel:`產品` 頁面點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`（動作）` 圖示並選擇 :menuselection:`匯入記錄 --> 上載檔案`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:116
msgid ""
"Once the spreadsheet with the newly-configured relation field information "
"has been uploaded, click :guilabel:`Import`, and Odoo returns to the "
":guilabel:`Products` page. The new information can be found on the "
":guilabel:`Products` page."
msgstr ""
"上載包含新配置關聯欄位資訊的試算表後，點擊 :guilabel:`匯入`，Odoo 便會返回 "
":guilabel:`產品` 頁面。新資訊可於 :guilabel:`產品` 頁面查看。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:121
msgid "Attributes and values"
msgstr "屬性與值"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:123
msgid ""
"Odoo supports importing attributes and values for both pre-existing and "
"newly imported products. Attributes and values **must** be uploaded through "
"a separate spreadsheet or CSV file before they can be applied to other "
"products."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 支援為現有產品及新匯入的產品匯入屬性及屬性值。屬性及屬性值**必須**先透過"
"獨立的試算表或 CSV 檔案上載，才可套用至其他產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:127
msgid ""
"The column names/titles for the attributes and values spreadsheet should be:"
" :guilabel:`Attribute`, :guilabel:`Display Type`, :guilabel:`Variant "
"Creation Mode`, and :guilabel:`Values / Value`."
msgstr ""
"屬性及值試算表的欄名稱/標題應為：:guilabel:`屬性`、:guilabel:`顯示類"
"型`、:guilabel:`變體建立模式` 及 :guilabel:`值 / 值`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:130
msgid "An attributes and values spreadsheet template for imports."
msgstr "用於匯入的屬性及值試算表範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:133
msgid ":guilabel:`Attribute`: The name of the attribute (e.g., `Size`)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`屬性`：屬性名稱（例如：`尺寸`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display Type`: The display type used in the product configurator."
" There are three display type options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:137
msgid ":guilabel:`Radio`: Values displayed as radio buttons."
msgstr ":guilabel:`單選按鈕`：值將顯示為單選按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:138
msgid ":guilabel:`Selection`: Values displayed in a selection list."
msgstr ":guilabel:`選擇`：顯示於選擇清單中的數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:139
msgid ":guilabel:`Color`: Values denoted as a color selection."
msgstr ":guilabel:`顏色`：以顏色選項表示的數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:141
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Variant Creation Mode`: The way variants are created when applied"
" to a product. This option **cannot** be changed once the attribute has been"
" changed on at least one product. There are three variant creation mode "
"options:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`變體建立模式`：將屬性套用至產品時建立變體的方式。一旦至少一個產品"
"已更改該屬性，便 **無法** 更改此選項。變體建立模式共有三個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:145
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Instantly`: With this option, all possible variants are created "
"as soon as the attribute and its values are added to a product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`即時`：選用此選項後，只要將屬性及其值新增至產品，系統便會立即建立"
"所有可能的變體。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dynamically`: With this option, each variant is created **only** "
"when its corresponding attributes and values are added to a sales order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`動態`：選擇此選項時，系統 **僅會** 在將對應的屬性及屬性值加入銷售"
"訂單時，才建立各個變體。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Never`: With this option, variants are **never** created for the "
"attribute."
msgstr ":guilabel:`永不`：選用此選項時，系統 **永不** 會為該屬性建立變體。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Values/Value`: Values pertaining to the corresponding attribute. "
"If there are multiple values for the same attribute, they need to be on "
"separate lines in the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`數值/值`：與對應屬性相關的數值。若同一屬性有多個數值，須在試算表中"
"將它們分開不同行填寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:154
msgid ""
"Once the desired attributes and values have been entered and saved in the "
"spreadsheet, the sheet may be imported and uploaded to Odoo. To do that, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Attributes`. On "
"the :guilabel:`Attributes` page, click the :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(Action)` icon and select :menuselection:`Import records --> "
"Upload File`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:159
msgid ""
"Once the spreadsheet with the newly-configured attributes and values has "
"been uploaded, click :guilabel:`Import` to load the :guilabel:`Attributes` "
"page and review and edit the newly added attributes."
msgstr ""
"上傳包含新配置屬性及數值的試算表後，點擊 :guilabel:`匯入` 以載入 "
":guilabel:`屬性` 頁面，即可檢視及編輯新增的屬性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:166
msgid ""
"Before importing product variants, it's best to set up their product "
"attributes with the desired display type, creation mode, and values. "
"Attributes with names that are not found during the import process are "
