#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:14
msgid "Sales quotations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:16
msgid ""
"A *sales quotation* or quote is a document sent to a customer that outlines "
"the estimated costs and terms for goods and services. Once accepted, a "
"quotation can be converted into a sales order, which serves as the final "
"agreement before delivery and invoicing."
msgstr ""
"*銷售報價單* 或報價單是發送給客戶的文件，當中列明貨品及服務的預估費用與條款。"
"客戶接受後，報價單可轉換為銷售訂單，作為送貨及開立發票前的最終協議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:21
msgid "Sales quotation dashboard"
msgstr "銷售報價單儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:23
msgid ""
"The quotations dashboard shows :guilabel:`My Quotations` by default, "
"regardless of their current status. Additional filters may be applied by "
"clicking the :icon:`fa-search` :guilabel:`Search...` bar and selecting them "
"from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"報價單儀表板預設會顯示 :guilabel:`我的報價單`，不論其目前狀態為何。如要套用其"
"他篩選條件，可點擊 :icon:`fa-search` :guilabel:`搜尋...` 搜尋列，並從下拉式選"
"單中選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:27
msgid "View of the Quotations kanban dashboard's header."
msgstr "報價單看板儀表板標題列的畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Confirm`: Shows how many orders still require confirmation. "
"Click to filter the dashboard to show only those orders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`待確認`：顯示尚有多少張訂單需要確認。按一下即可篩選儀表板，只顯示"
"這些訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Deliver`: Shows how many orders still require delivery. Click "
"to filter the dashboard to show only those orders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`待送貨`：顯示尚有多少張訂單需要送貨。按一下即可篩選儀表板，只顯示"
"該等訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Invoice`: Shows how many orders still require invoicing. Click"
" to filter the dashboard to show only those orders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`待開立發票`：顯示仍須開立發票的訂單數量。點擊可篩選儀表板，僅顯示"
"該等訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:37
msgid ""
"The dashboard view may also be changed by using the buttons in the header. "
"High-level information about total orders and revenue is available in the "
"header as well."
msgstr "你亦可使用頁首的按鈕切換儀表板檢視。頁首亦會顯示總訂單數及總收益等概覽資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:40
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`Last # Days`: Sets the date range for which "
"orders are shown. Choose from 7 days, 30 days, 90 days, or 365 days."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`最近 # 天`：設定顯示訂單的日期範圍。可選擇 7 "
"天、30 天、90 天或 365 天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Orders`: Shows the total sales orders for the chosen time "
"period. Also shows the rate of change for sales orders. Rate of change data "
"may not be available for all time periods."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售訂單`：顯示所選時間段內的銷售訂單總數，以及銷售訂單的變化率。"
"並非所有時間段均提供變化率數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Revenue`: Shows the total sales revenue for the chosen time"
" period. Also shows the rate of change for sales revenue. Rate of change "
"data may not be available for all time periods."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售收益`：顯示所選時間段內的總銷售收益，同時顯示銷售收益的變化率"
"。變化率資料未必適用於所有時間段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:49
msgid "Sales flow overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:51
msgid ""
"Quotations fit into a broader sales flow that connects different stages of "
"customer interactions from initial interest to payment."
msgstr ""
"報價單是整體銷售流程的一環，將客戶從最初表達興趣到最終付款的各個互動階段連貫"
"起來。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:54
msgid "The typical flow follows these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:56
msgid ""
"*Quotation*: A proposal sent to the customer with product details and "
"pricing."
msgstr "*報價單*：發送給客戶的建議書，當中包含產品詳情及價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:57
msgid ""
"*Sales order*: Created automatically when the customer accepts the "
"quotation, confirming the sale."
msgstr "*銷售訂單*：當客戶接受報價單並確認銷售時，系統會自動建立此訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:59
msgid ""
"*Delivery* (if applicable): Products are shipped or services are delivered."
msgstr "*交貨*（如適用）：產品已付運或服務已交付。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:60
msgid ""
"*Invoice*: The final bill is issued based on the sales order or delivered "
"products/services."
msgstr "*發票*：最終賬單會根據銷售訂單或已交付的產品/服務發出。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:61
msgid ""
"*Payment*: The customer settles the invoice, completing the sales cycle."
msgstr "*付款*：客戶繳清發票，完成銷售週期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:63
msgid ""
"This flow helps businesses track the entire lifecycle of a sale while "
"keeping information consistent across apps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:66
msgid ""
"In Odoo, quotations are configured in the **Sales** app. They can also be "
"generated from other apps as part of the sales workflow:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:69
msgid ""
"**CRM**: :doc:`Convert opportunities <../crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes>` "
"into quotes to follow up on potential deals."
msgstr ""
"**CRM**：:doc:`將商機轉換 <../crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes>`為報價單，以跟進"
"潛在交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Helpdesk**: :doc:`Generate quotes from tickets "
"<../../services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales>` when offering paid services "
"or products."
msgstr ""
"**技術支援**：提供收費服務或產品時，可:doc:`從支援工單產生報價單 <../../"
"services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:73
msgid ""
"**Subscriptions**: :doc:`Offer recurring services <../subscriptions>` before"
" starting an automatic billing cycle."
msgstr "**訂閱**：:doc:`提供定期服務 <../subscriptions>`，然後開始自動賬單週期。"

