msgstr ""
"製作報價單範本時，網上簽署功能即為 :guilabel:`簽署` 選項，位於報價單範本表單"
"的 :guilabel:`網上確認` 欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:29
msgid ""
"The Online confirmation signature option found on every quotation template "
"in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo 每個報價單範本上設有的網上確認簽名選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:32
msgid ""
"On standard quotations, the online signature feature is the "
":guilabel:`Signature` option, located under the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab "
"of the quotation form."
msgstr ""
"在標準報價單上，網上簽名功能是:guilabel:`簽名`選項，位於報價單表單"
"的:guilabel:`其他資訊`分頁下。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:35
msgid ""
"The online signature feature option in the Other Info tab of a quotation "
"form in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo 報價單表單「其他資訊」分頁中的網上簽名功能選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:39
msgid "Order confirmations with online signatures"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:41
msgid ""
"When clients access quotations online through their customer portal, there's"
" a :guilabel:`Sign \\& Pay` button directly on the quotation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:44
msgid "The Sign and Pay button present on online quotations in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Odoo 銷售中網上報價單上的「簽署並付款」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:47
msgid ""
"When clicked, a :guilabel:`Validate Order` pop-up window appears. In this "
"pop-up window, the :guilabel:`Full Name` field is auto-populated, based on "
"the contact information in the database."
msgstr ""
"按一下後，系統會顯示:guilabel:`驗證訂單`彈出式視窗。在此彈出式視窗中，系統會"
"根據資料庫中的聯絡人資料，自動填入:guilabel:`全名`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:50
msgid "The Validate Order pop-up window for online signatures in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Odoo 銷售應用程式中用於網上簽署的「驗證訂單」彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:53
msgid ""
"Then, customers have the option to enter an online signature with any of the"
" following options: :guilabel:`Auto`, :guilabel:`Draw`, or :guilabel:`Load`."
msgstr ""
"然後，客戶可選擇使用以下任何一種方式輸入網上簽名：:guilabel:`自"
"動`、:guilabel:`繪畫` 或 :guilabel:`載入`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Auto` lets Odoo automatically generate an online signature based "
"on the information in the :guilabel:`Full Name` field. :guilabel:`Draw` lets"
" the customer use the cursor to create a custom signature directly on the "
"pop-up window. And :guilabel:`Load` lets the customer upload a previously-"
"created signature file from their computer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`自動` 讓 Odoo 根據 :guilabel:`全名` 欄位中的資料自動產生網上簽名"
"。:guilabel:`繪製` 讓客戶直接於彈出式視窗中使用游標建立自訂簽名。而 "
":guilabel:`載入` 則讓客戶從電腦上載先前建立的簽名檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:61
msgid ""
"After the customer has chosen any of the three previously mentioned "
"signature options (:guilabel:`Auto`, :guilabel:`Draw`, or :guilabel:`Load`),"
" they will click the :guilabel:`Accept \\& Sign` button."
msgstr ""
"客戶選擇上述三種簽名選項（:guilabel:`自動`、:guilabel:`繪製` 或 :guilabel:`載"
"入`）的其中一項後，便會點擊 :guilabel:`接受並簽署` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:65
msgid ""
"When :guilabel:`Accept \\& Sign` is clicked, the various payment method "
"options become available for them to choose from (if the *online payment* "
"option applies to this quotation)."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`接受並簽署` 後，客戶便可選擇各種付款方式（如 *網上付款* 選項"
"適用於此報價單）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:68
msgid ""
"Then, when the quotation is paid and confirmed, a delivery order is "
"automatically created (if the Odoo **Inventory** app is installed)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:72
msgid "View online signatures in Developer Mode"
msgstr "在開發人員模式下查看線上簽名"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:74
msgid ""
"Clients can view the online signature in :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>`."
msgstr "客戶可在 :ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>` 中檢視網上簽名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:76
msgid ""
"To view a online signature from a paid invoice, go to :menuselection:`Sales "
"app --> Orders --> Orders` and select the desired sales order. A new tab, "
":guilabel:`Customer Signature`, is available. Click the tab to view the "
"electronic signature as well as the :guilabel:`Signed By` and "
":guilabel:`Signed On` information."
msgstr ""
"要查看已付款發票的網上簽名，請前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 訂單 --> "
"訂單`，並選擇所需的銷售訂單。系統會顯示新的分頁:guilabel:`客戶簽名`。按一下該"
"分頁，即可查看電子簽名，以及:guilabel:`簽署人`及:guilabel:`簽署日期`資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:81
msgid "The Customer Signature tab on a sales order when in Developer Mode."
msgstr "在開發人員模式下，銷售訂單上的「客戶簽名」分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:3
msgid "Margins"
msgstr "利潤率"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *sales margin* is the profit gained from the sale of a product or service "
"after all the costs related to it have been accounted for."
msgstr "*銷售毛利* 是指在扣除所有相關成本後，銷售產品或服務所獲得的利潤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:11
msgid ""
"To activate the *Margins* feature, go to the :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Pricing` section, enable the "
":guilabel:`Margins` checkbox. Then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"要啟用 *利潤率* 功能，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定`。在 :guilabel:`定價` 部分中，勾選 :guilabel:`利潤率` 核取方塊，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:18
msgid "Configure price and cost"
msgstr "配置價格及成本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:20
msgid ""
"Each individual product must be configured to automatically calculate the "
"sales margin on each quotation and :abbr:`SO (sales order)` line. To enable "
"this feature, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> "
"Products`. Click :guilabel:`New` and on the product form fill out the "
":guilabel:`Sales Price` and :guilabel:`Cost` fields in the *General "
"Information* tab."
msgstr ""
"每項產品都必須進行設定，才能自動計算每張報價單及 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）` 資料"
"行上的銷售利潤。如要啟用此功能，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產"
"品 --> 產品`。點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，並在產品表單的 *一般資料* 分頁中填寫 "
":guilabel:`銷售價格` 及 :guilabel:`成本` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:25
msgid "Sales Price and Cost fields of a product form."
msgstr "產品表單中的「銷售價格」及「成本」欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:28
msgid "Odoo calculates the margin with the following formula:"
msgstr "Odoo 使用以下公式計算利潤："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:30
msgid ""
"Sales~Margin = Sales~Price - Cost\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"銷售毛利 = 銷售價格 - 成本\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:33
msgid "The margin percentage is calculated with the following formula:"
msgstr "利潤率百分比按以下公式計算："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:35
msgid ""
"\\frac{Sales~Price - Cost~Price}{Sales~Price} \\times 100\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{售價 - 成本價}{售價} \\times 100\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:39
msgid "Compute margins on sales orders"
msgstr "計算銷售訂單利潤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:41
msgid ""
"To calculate the margins on a :abbr:`SO (sales order)`, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations` and :ref:`create a new "
"quotation <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>`. While adding products"
" to the quotation, a new field, :guilabel:`Margin`, automatically appears at"
" the bottom of the to the quotation. This field displays the order's total "
"margin in the configured currency as well as the percentage."
msgstr ""
"若要計算 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）` 的毛利，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程"
"式 --> 訂單 --> 報價單`，並 :ref:`建立新報價單 <sales/create_quotations/"
"create-quotation>`。將產品新增至報價單時，報價單底部會自動顯示新欄位 "
":guilabel:`毛利`。此欄位會以所設定的貨幣顯示訂單的總毛利及百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:47
msgid "Sales order with Margin field on the bottom."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:53
msgid "Compute margins on sales order lines"
msgstr "計算銷售訂單資料行上的毛利"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:55
msgid ""
"To display a product's margin and the margin percentage per line item, click"
" the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings adjust)` icon in the "
":guilabel:`Order Lines` tab. Then, select the checkboxes for "
":guilabel:`Margin` and :guilabel:`Margin (%)`. The :guilabel:`Margin` and "
":guilabel:`Margin (%)` columns are not displayed by default, but once "
"enabled, the columns appear on all new and existing quotations and "
":abbr:`SOs (sales orders)`."
msgstr ""
"要顯示每個明細項目的產品毛利及毛利率，請按一下 :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` "
":guilabel:`(調整設定)` 圖示（位於 :guilabel:`訂單明細` 分頁中）。然後，勾選 "
":guilabel:`毛利` 及 :guilabel:`毛利 (%)` 的核取方塊。預設不會顯示 "
":guilabel:`毛利` 和 :guilabel:`毛利 (%)` 欄位，但啟用後，這些欄位將會出現在所"
"有新建及現有的報價單與 :abbr:`SO (銷售訂單)` 上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:61
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Margin` column shows the profit earned from the sale after "
"accounting for all associated costs, in the configured currency value. The "
":guilabel:`Margin (%)` shows the margin value as a percentage. The margin "
"for one unit is multiplied by the quantity to determine the margin for the "
"entire line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:66
msgid ""
"Editing the :guilabel:`Margin` column automatically recalculates the "
":guilabel:`Unit Price` of the product on the :abbr:`SO (sales order)`. Both "
"columns can be edited on the :abbr:`SO (sales order)` until an invoice is "
"created."
msgstr ""
"編輯 :guilabel:`毛利` 欄位會自動重新計算該產品的 :guilabel:`單價`（即 "
":abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）` 中的單價）。在開立發票前，這兩個欄位都可以在 :abbr:`SO"
"（銷售訂單）` 上進行編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:71
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Margin` and :guilabel:`Margin (%)` columns are not editable "
"since they are automatic calculations. To change the calculation, refer to "
":ref:`Configure price and cost <sales/margin/configure-price-and-cost>` "
"section for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:76
msgid "Margin calculation with a pricelist"
msgstr "使用價格表計算利潤率"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:78
msgid ""
"To calculate the margin with an applied pricelist, begin with configuring a "
"pricelist for the product. Follow these steps:"
msgstr "要計算套用價格表後的毛利，請先為產品設定價格表。請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:81
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Pricelists` and click the "
":guilabel:`New` button."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產品 --> 價格表`，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`新增` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:83
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the pricelist and click :guilabel:`Add a line` to "
":ref:`create a new pricelist rule <sales/products/price-rules>`."
msgstr ""
"輸入價格表名稱，然後按一下:guilabel:`新增資料行`以:ref:`建立新的價格表規則 "
"<sales/products/price-rules>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:85
msgid "Configure the pricelist and click :guilabel:`Save & Close` button."
msgstr "設定價目表後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:86
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations` and :ref:`create "
"a quotation <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 訂單 --> 報價單` 並 :ref:`建立報價單 "
"<sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:88
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Pricelist` field, select the newly made pricelist."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`價格表` 欄位中，選擇新建的價格表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:89
msgid ""
"Click on :guilabel:`Update Prices` to refresh the product price and margin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:92
msgid "Use case: Conditional discounts"
msgstr "使用案例：條件式折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:94
msgid ""
"A clothing store wants to create a seasonal 5% discount on blue denim jeans."
" The discount requires a minimum of two pairs of jeans in an order and is "
"valid only from October to the end of December."
msgstr ""
"一間服裝店想為藍色牛仔褲建立 5% 季節性折扣。該折扣要求訂單中至少包含兩條牛仔"
"褲，且僅於 10 月至 12 月底期間有效。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:97
msgid ""
"First go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Pricelists` and "
"create a new pricelist for the seasonal discount. Click :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` to configure a price rule for seasonal discount. Include the specific "
"product it applies to, the type of discount, the minimum quantity needed to "
"trigger the discount, and the date range the discount is active."
msgstr ""
"首先前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產品 --> 價格表`，並為季節性折扣建"
"立新的價格表。按一下 :guilabel:`新增資料行` 以配置季節性折扣的價格規則。當中"
"應包括適用的特定產品、折扣類型、觸發折扣所需的最低數量，以及折扣生效的日期範"
"圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:102
