#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:105
msgid ""
"After saving the pricelist, go to a :abbr:`SO (sales order)` containing blue"
" denim jeans and select the newly created pricelist in the "
":guilabel:`Pricelist` field."
