#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:108
msgid "Sales order with a new pricelist selected."
msgstr "已選擇新價格表的銷售訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:112
msgid ""
"The discount only applies if the :abbr:`SO (sales order)` meets both the "
"date range and minimum quantity requirements."
msgstr ""
"只有當 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）` 同時符合日期範圍及最低數量要求時，該折扣才會適"
"用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:115
msgid ""
"After the changes are made, click :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Update "
"Prices` to update the :guilabel:`Margin`, :guilabel:`Margin (%)`, and "
":guilabel:`Amount`. The margin is recalculated based on the pricelist-"
