#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:57
msgid ""
"Using an :doc:`../../../websites/ecommerce` integration, the **Sales** app "
"can automatically fill in :guilabel:`Optional Products`, "
":guilabel:`Accessory Products`, and :guilabel:`Alternative Products` based "
"on the database's historical sales order (SO) data and existing products."
msgstr ""
"透過 :doc:`../../../websites/ecommerce` 整合，**銷售** 應用程式可根據資料庫的"
"歷史銷售訂單（SO）資料及現有產品，自動填寫:guilabel:`選購產品`、:guilabel:`配"
"件產品`及:guilabel:`替代產品`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:64
msgid ""
"To enable the feature, install the *eCommerce* module, then navigate to "
