"The automation rule covers the last five years of :abbr:`SOs (sales "
"orders)`."
msgstr "此自動化規則涵蓋過去五年的 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:92
msgid ""
"For products with the same number of :abbr:`SO (sales order)` occurrences or"
" category counts, suggestions are randomized to prevent repeated product "
"suggestions."
msgstr ""
"對於在 :abbr:`SO (銷售訂單)` 中出現次數或類別數量相同的產品，系統會隨機顯示建"
