#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:95
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Automate suggested products` feature runs once a week or on "
"demand from the product form. It is valid for all types of suggestions "
"(optional, accessory, and alternative)."
