#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:98
msgid ""
"The fields can be manually changed, but once a field is changed, the "
"automatic suggestions stop for that field. To restart the automation or "
"trigger a suggestion update for a product, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales"
" app --> Products --> Products`. Select a product, click the :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, and select :guilabel:`Update suggested "
"products`."
msgstr ""
"這些欄位可以手動更改，但一旦更改某個欄位，該欄位的自動建議便會停止。要重新啟"
