"品 --> 產品`。選取一個產品，按一下 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（操作）` 圖示，"
"然後選擇 :guilabel:`更新建議產品`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:103
msgid ""
"The product form's Action submenu showing the Update suggested products "
"option."
msgstr "產品表單的「操作」子選單，顯示「更新建議產品」選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:109
msgid "Setting optional product sections in quotations"
msgstr "在報價單中設定可選產品部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:111
msgid ""
"When developing a quotation for customers, entire sections of the quotation "
"can be set as optional products, even if they haven't been configured in the"
" product form. To create a section, click the :guilabel:`Add a section` link"
" and enter its desired name in the :guilabel:`Enter a description` field. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(drop-down menu)` and choose "
":icon:`fa-dot-circle-o` :guilabel:`Set Optional`."
msgstr ""
"為顧客制定報價單時，即使尚未在產品表單中配置，報價單的整個區段亦可設為可選產"
"品。要建立區段，請按一下 :guilabel:`新增區段` 連結，並在 :guilabel:`輸入描"
"述` 欄位中輸入所需名稱。按一下 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（下拉式選單"
"）`，然後選擇 :icon:`fa-dot-circle-o` :guilabel:`設為可選`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:117
msgid "The dropdown menu with the \"Set Optional\" text highlighted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:120
msgid ""
"Once a section is set to optional, the font color changes to reflect its "
"status. All products within that section default to a quantity of `0`, "
"ensuring they are not included in the total cost automatically. Both portal "
"users (such as customers or vendors) and employees with access to create "
"quotations and sales orders can update these quantities. Once a quantity is "
"set to `1` or more, the product is added to the quote total."
msgstr ""
"將章節設為可選後，字體顏色會隨之變更以反映其狀態。該章節內所有產品的預設數量"
"均為 `0`，確保它們不會自動計入總成本。門戶網站用戶（例如客戶或供應商）以及具"
"備建立報價單和銷售訂單權限的員工，均可更新這些數量。只要將數量設為 `1` 或以上"
"，該產品便會加入報價單總計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:126
msgid ""
"Once an optional product section has been created in a quotation, users who "
"have been :doc:`granted portal access "
"<../../../general/users/user_portals/portal_access>` can interact with the "
"quotation there. They can view the quotation and decide whether or not to "
"add the optional products to their final sales order."
msgstr ""
"在報價單中建立可選產品部分後，已:doc:`獲授予門戶存取權限 <../../../general/"
"users/user_portals/portal_access>`的用戶便可在該處與報價單互動。他們可檢視報"
"價單，並決定是否在最終銷售訂單中加入可選產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:131
msgid ""
"An optional products section with the quanitty and corresponding amount set "
"to 0."
msgstr "可選產品區段，其中數量及相應金額均設為 0。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:5
msgid ""
"Before getting into detail about how to use product variants on quotations "
"and sales orders, it's recommended to learn about "
":doc:`../products_prices/products/variants` in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:8
msgid ""
"Once familiarized with the basics surrounding product variants, the "
"following covers how product variants can be added to quotations and sales "
"orders using the *product configurator* or *order grid entry*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:13
msgid ""
"It should be noted that the setting is titled *Variant Grid Entry* on the "
"**Sales** app settings page and titled *Order Grid Entry* on product forms. "
"Be sure to keep that in mind."
msgstr ""
"請注意，此設定在 **銷售** 應用程式設定頁面上名為 *款式網格輸入*，而在產品表單"
"上則名為 *訂單網格輸入*。請務必留意。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:19
msgid ""
"When working with product variants, Odoo uses the product configurator by "
"default. To add the variant grid entry option, that feature **must** be "
"enabled in the Odoo **Sales** application. The variant grid entry option "
"provides a pop-up window on the quotation/sales order to simplify the "
"variant selection process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:24
msgid ""
"To enable that setting, go to the :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. In the *Product Catalog* section, ensure the "
":guilabel:`Variants` checkbox is ticked in order to use product variants on "
"quotations and sales orders. Then, tick the :guilabel:`Variant Grid Entry` "
"checkbox and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"要啟用該設定，請前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`。在 *產品"
"目錄* 部分，確保已剔選:guilabel:`變體`複選框，以便在報價單及銷售訂單上使用產"
"品變體。然後，剔選:guilabel:`變體網格輸入`複選框，並點擊:guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:29
msgid ""
"The Product Catalog section showing the Variants and Variant Grid Entry "
"options enabled."
msgstr "「產品目錄」部分顯示已啟用「變體」及「變體網格輸入」選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:35
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Variant Grid Entry` setting is enabled, both options "
"(*Product Configurator* and *Order Grid Entry*) become available on every "
"product form."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`款式網格輸入` 設定後，每張產品表單上都會提供這兩個選項（*產品"
"配置器* 及 *訂單網格輸入*）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:38
msgid ""
"To configure a product form to use either a product configurator or variant "
"grid entry, start by navigating to the :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Products` to view all the products in the database."
msgstr ""
"要配置產品表單以使用產品配置器或變體網格輸入，請先前往 :menuselection:`銷售應"
"用程式 --> 產品 --> 產品`，以查看數據庫中的所有產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:42
msgid ""
"Then, select the desired product to configure, or click :guilabel:`New` to "
"create a new product from scratch. Once on the product form, click into the "
"*Attributes & Variants* tab, where product variants can be viewed, modified,"
" and added. Add an attribute with **at least two values** to the product "
"form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:47
msgid ""
"Doing so displays the :guilabel:`Product Configurator` and :guilabel:`Order "
"Grid Entry` options in the :guilabel:`Sales Variant Selection` section. "
"These options determine which method is used when adding product variants to"
" quotations or sales orders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:51
msgid ""
"Sales variant selection options on the attributes and variants tab on "
"product form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:54
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Product Configurator` provides a pop-up window that displays "
"all the available product variants for that particular product when it's "
"added to a quotation. However, only one variant can be selected at a time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:58
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Order Grid Entry` provides the same information as the "
":guilabel:`Product Configurator` in a table layout, allowing the user to "
"select larger numbers of unique product variants and add them to a quotation"
" or sales order in a single view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:63
msgid "Product configurator"
msgstr "產品配置器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:65
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Product Configurator` option is selected on the product "
"form, the feature appears as a *Configure your product* pop-up window when "
"the product with **at least two** variants is added to a quotation or sales "
"order. The :guilabel:`Product Configurator` is the default option for new "
"products after the :guilabel:`Variant Grid Entry` feature is enabled on the "
"*Settings* page."
msgstr ""
"如果在產品表單上選擇了 :guilabel:`產品配置器` 選項，當具有 **至少兩個** 變體"
"的產品新增至報價單或銷售訂單時，該功能會以 *配置您的產品* 彈出視窗的形式顯示"
"。:guilabel:`產品配置器` 是新產品在 *設定* 頁面啟用 :guilabel:`變體網格輸入` "
"功能後的預設選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:70
msgid ""
"The product configurator pop-up window that appears on a quotation or sales "
"order."
msgstr "在報價單或銷售訂單上顯示的產品配置器彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:73
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Product Configurator` option helps salespeople choose exactly"
" which product variant to add to the quotation or sales order using a format"
" similar to online shopping."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:77
msgid ""
"All products configured with variants display a *Configure your product* "
"pop-up window by default. This is true even with the :guilabel:`Variant Grid"
" Entry` option disabled."
msgstr ""
"所有已配置變體的產品，預設都會顯示 *配置你的產品* 彈出式視窗。即使已停"
"用:guilabel:`變體網格輸入`選項亦是如此。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:81
msgid "Order grid entry"
msgstr "訂單網格輸入"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:83
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Order Grid Entry` option is selected on a product form, "
"the order grid entry feature appears as a *Choose Product Variants* pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
"如果在產品表單上選取了 :guilabel:`訂單網格輸入` 選項，訂單網格輸入功能會以 "
"*選擇產品變體* 彈出視窗顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:86
msgid ""
"The choose product variants pop-up window that appears on a quotation in "
"Odoo."
msgstr "在 Odoo 報價單上出現的「選擇產品變體」彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:89
msgid ""
"The *Choose Product Variants* pop-up window features all the variant options"
" for that particular product. From this pop-up window, the salesperson can "
"designate how many of each variant they'd like to add to the quotation or "
"sales order at once."
msgstr ""
"*選擇產品變體* 彈出視窗會顯示該產品的所有變體選項。銷售人員可在該視窗中，一次"
"指定要加入報價單或銷售訂單的各款變體數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:93
msgid ""
"When all the desired quantities and variants have been selected, the "
"salesperson clicks :guilabel:`Confirm`, and those orders are instantly added"
" to the quotation or sales order in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab."
msgstr ""
"選取所有所需數量及變體後，銷售人員點擊 :guilabel:`確認`，系統便會即時將這些訂"
"單加入報價單或銷售訂單的 :guilabel:`訂單明細` 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:97
msgid ""
"Populated order lines tab after order grid entry has been chosen to select "
"products."
msgstr "選擇使用訂單網格輸入來選取產品後，已填入資料的「訂單明細」分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:101
msgid ":doc:`../products_prices/products/variants`"
msgstr ":doc:`../products_prices/products/variants`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:8
msgid ""
"The *PDF Quote Builder* in the Odoo **Sales** app transforms a standard, "
"text-heavy quote into a polished, branded proposal. Instead of sending a "
"table of products and prices, it enables users to sandwich a quotation "
"between professionally designed PDF pages."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **銷售** 應用程式中的 *PDF 報價單建立工具* 可將標準、文字繁多的報價單轉"
"化為精緻且具品牌特色的建議書。用戶無需只傳送產品與價格表，而是可將報價單夾在"
"專業設計的 PDF 頁面之間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:12
msgid ""
"The PDF Quote Builder seamlessly combines user-provided marketing documents,"
" technical sheets, branded cover pages, and Odoo-generated quotes in one "
"document. Quotation templates can be configured to include specific PDFs in "
"the quote, ensuring documents reach the intended customers. Dynamic text in "
"PDF templates allows users to extract **Sales** app data and customize files"
" for each project or customer."
msgstr ""
"PDF 報價單建立工具能將使用者提供的市場推廣文件、技術規格表、品牌封面頁，以及 "
"Odoo 產生的報價單無縫整合為單一文件。報價單範本可設定在報價單中包含指定的 "
"PDF 檔案，確保將正確的文件傳送給目標客戶。PDF 範本中的動態文字可讓使用者擷取 "
"**銷售** 應用程式的資料，並為每個專案或客戶自訂文件內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:18
msgid ""
"Empty text fields on the PDF can be completed directly from the quotation "
"form in the **Sales** app. This approach lets users personalize quotes "
"without editing the PDF itself."
msgstr ""
"PDF 上的空白文字欄位可直接從 **銷售** 應用程式中的報價單表單填寫。此方法讓用"
"戶無需編輯 PDF 本身即可個人化報價單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:21
msgid ""
"Users can also configure PDFs on the product form. These files are then "
"automatically added to the quote when a product is included. Beyond "
"assembling quotes, the PDF Quote Builder also enables PDFs to be featured on"
" the online store product page. This ensures customers can access detailed "
"product information directly on the website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Odoo Quick Tips - Create a PDF quote [video] "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tQNydBZt-VI>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 快速提示 - 建立 PDF 報價單 [影片] <https://www.youtube.com/"
"watch?v=tQNydBZt-VI>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:30
msgid ""
"It is recommended to edit PDF forms with Adobe software. The form fields in "
"the header and footer PDF templates are required to retrieve dynamic values "
"in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:35
msgid "Add dynamic text to PDFs"
msgstr "為 PDF 加入動態文字"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:35
msgid "Add dynamic text fields to PDFs."
msgstr "將動態文字欄位新增至 PDF。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:40
msgid "Add PDFs to quotes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:40
msgid "Add a PDF header or footer to a quote."
msgstr "為報價單加入 PDF 頁首或頁尾。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:45
msgid "Add PDFs to products"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:45
msgid ""
"Set up the PDF headers and footers for products. These appear on sales "
"quotes and online store pages."
msgstr "設定產品的 PDF 頁首及頁尾。這些內容會顯示於銷售報價單及網店頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:56
msgid ""
"To add custom PDF files to quotes, the :guilabel:`PDF Quote builder` feature"
" *must* be configured."
msgstr ""
"如要在報價單中加入自訂 PDF 檔案， *必須* 先配置 :guilabel:`PDF 報價單建立器` "
"功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:58
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings`. "
"Scroll to the *Quotations & Orders* section, enable the :guilabel:`PDF Quote"
" builder` feature, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:62
msgid "Add PDF as Header/Footer"
msgstr "將 PDF 新增為頁首/頁尾"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:65
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:39
msgid ""
"Odoo does not permit spaces in PDF field names. Only use letters, numbers, "
"hyphens, or underscores."
msgstr "Odoo 不允許 PDF 欄位名稱包含空格。請只使用英文字母、數字、連字號或底線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:68
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Sales** app can add a custom PDF as a header or footer. The "
":guilabel:`Quote Builder` tab in a quote allows the selection of multiple "
"headers and footers for insertion into the final PDF quote."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:72
msgid ""
"To add a custom PDF as a header or footer, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales"
" app --> Configuration --> Headers/Footers`. On this page, click "
":guilabel:`New` to create a new header or footer, or click "
":guilabel:`Upload` to add a PDF file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:76
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Upload` lets the user select a PDF file from their "
"computer. Select the :guilabel:`Document Type` to set the order in which the"
" PDF appears in the quote. :guilabel:`Header` places the PDF before the "
"quote, and :guilabel:`Footer` places it after. Further configuration can be "
"done by clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` "
"icon in the top-right corner of the document card and selecting "
":guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr ""
"按一下:guilabel:`上傳`，使用者即可從電腦選擇 PDF 檔案。選擇:guilabel:`文件類"
"型`，以設定 PDF 在報價單中顯示的順序。:guilabel:`頁首`會將 PDF 置於報價單之前"
"，而:guilabel:`頁尾`則會將其置於之後。如要進行進一步設定，請按一下文件卡片右"
"上角的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（垂直省略符號）`圖示，然後選"
"擇:guilabel:`編輯`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:82
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` to open a blank document form. In the :guilabel:`File "
"Content` field, click the :guilabel:`Upload your file` button and select the"
" PDF to upload. Once uploaded, Odoo automatically names the document after "
"the file name. The :guilabel:`Name` field then becomes editable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:87
msgid ""
"To modify the uploaded file, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)`,"
" :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`(Download)`, or :icon:`fa-trash` "
":guilabel:`(Clear)` icon next to the file name. If the PDF includes form "
"fields, they are automatically recognized as dynamic text fields. View and "
"edit these fields by clicking :guilabel:`Configure dynamic fields`. For more"
" details, refer to :doc:`pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text`."
msgstr ""
"要修改已上載的檔案，請按一下檔案名稱旁邊的 :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(編"
"輯)`、:icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`(下載)` 或 :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`"
"(清除)` 圖示。如果 PDF 包含表單欄位，系統會自動將其識別為動態文字欄位。按一"
"下 :guilabel:`設定動態欄位` 即可檢視及編輯這些欄位。詳情請參閱 "
":doc:`pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:93
msgid ""
"The :doc:`quote_template` field assigns the PDF to the selected template, "
"restricting the PDF's use to that template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:97
msgid ""
"Headers and footers can also be added to a quotation template by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Quotation Templates`. "
"Select a template and then in the :guilabel:`Quote Builder` tab, "
":guilabel:`Add` or :guilabel:`Upload` a PDF directly."
msgstr ""
"你亦可前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> 報價單範本`，為報價單範本"
"加入頁首及頁尾。選擇範本後，在:guilabel:`報價單建立工具`分頁中，直"
"接:guilabel:`新增`或:guilabel:`上載` PDF。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:101
msgid "A configured document form for a header."
msgstr "已設定頁首的文件表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:104
msgid ""
"The HVAC PDF file is configured as a Header and the **Sales** app recognizes"
" the form fields as dynamic text fields."
msgstr ""
"該 HVAC PDF 檔案已配置為頁首，而 **銷售** 應用程式會將表單欄位識別為動態文字"
"欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:3
msgid "Add a PDF or a URL to a product"
msgstr "為產品加入 PDF 或網址"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Sales** app lets users add a custom PDF or URL to a *product "
"template* or variant using the PDF Quote builder. By attaching a PDF or a "
"URL, users can include extra information or resources in their quotes, "
"online product pages, or for manufacturing."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **銷售** 應用程式可讓用戶使用 PDF 報價單建立工具，為 *產品範本* 或變體加"
"入自訂 PDF 或 URL。透過附加 PDF 或 URL，用戶可以在報價單、網上產品頁面或製造"
"用途中加入額外資料或資源。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:12
msgid "Add a PDF or URL to a product template"
msgstr "新增 PDF 或網址至產品範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:14
msgid ""
"To add a custom PDF to a product template, go to the :menuselection:`Sales "
"app --> Products --> Products`, and select the desired product. Next, click "
"the :guilabel:`Documents` smart button at the top of the product template "
"page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:18
msgid "The Documents smart button on a Sales product form."
msgstr "銷售產品表單上的「文件」智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:21
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload` to open the user's local file directory then select"
" and upload a PDF to Odoo. Odoo automatically creates a PDF document form "
"from the uploaded PDF, with the :guilabel:`Sales Visibility` set to "
":guilabel:`Hidden` and the :guilabel:`Publish on website` toggle disabled by"
" default. Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` "
"icon in the corner of the document card and select :guilabel:`Edit` to "
"further :ref:`configure the PDF form <sales/add_pdf_products/pdf-form-"
"configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`上載` 以開啟用戶的本機檔案目錄，然後選取並將 PDF 上載至 Odoo"
"。Odoo 會自動根據已上載的 PDF 建立 PDF 文件表單，而預設會將 :guilabel:`銷售可"
"見度` 設為 :guilabel:`隱藏`，並停用 :guilabel:`發佈至網站` 開關。點擊文件卡片"
"角落的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（垂直省略號）` 圖示並選取 "
":guilabel:`編輯`，即可進一步 :ref:`設定 PDF 表單 <sales/add_pdf_products/pdf-"
"form-configuration>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` to open a blank PDF form and manually :ref:`configure "
"the document form <sales/add_pdf_products/pdf-form-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 以開啟空白的 PDF 表格，然後手動 :ref:`設定文件表格 "
"<sales/add_pdf_products/pdf-form-configuration>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:35
msgid "Add a PDF or URL to a product variant"
msgstr "將 PDF 或網址新增至產品變體"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:37
msgid ""
"A PDF document or URL can also be added to a product variant, rather than "
"the product template. The document form for the product variant is the same "
"as the product template's document form, **except** it doesn't include the "
"*E-Commerce* section and thus cannot be published on the website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:41
msgid ""
"To add a PDF to a product variant, navigate to the :menuselection:`Sales app"
" --> Products --> Product Variants`, select the product variant, click the "
":guilabel:`Documents` smart button, and :ref:`upload the PDF "
"<sales/add_pdf_products/add-pdf-to-product>`."
msgstr ""
"如要將 PDF 加入產品變體，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產品 --> 產"
"品變體`，選擇該產品變體，按一下 :guilabel:`文件` 智能按鈕，然後 :ref:`上載 "
"PDF <sales/add_pdf_products/add-pdf-to-product>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:46
msgid ""
"If the variant is added to a quotation, and there are documents on a product"
" *and* on its variant, **only** the documents in the variant are shown in "
"the *Quote Builder* tab of the quotation."
msgstr ""
"如果將變體加入報價單，而產品 *及* 其變體均有文件，則報價單的 *報價單建構工"
"具* 分頁中 **僅** 會顯示該變體的文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:53
msgid "Document form configuration"
msgstr "文件表單設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:56
msgid ""
"To save a document form entry, the user **must** add a URL or PDF to the "
"document form. Odoo won't save the entry without one, even if the rest of "
"the form is configured."
msgstr ""
"要儲存文件表單項目，用戶 **必須** 在文件表單中加入網址或 PDF。即使已配置表單"
"的其餘部分，若欠缺網址或 PDF，Odoo 亦不會儲存該項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:60
msgid "General Information"
msgstr "一般資訊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:62
msgid ""
"Fill out the following information in the top section of the document form:"
msgstr "在文件表單的頂部填寫以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Select either :guilabel:`File` or a :guilabel:`URL` from "
"the drop-down menu. If a PDF is uploaded, the :guilabel:`Type` field is "
"automatically set to :guilabel:`File` and cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類型`：從下拉式選單選擇 :guilabel:`檔案` 或 :guilabel:`網址`。如果"
"上載了 PDF，:guilabel:`類型` 欄位會自動設為 :guilabel:`檔案`，且無法變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL`: This field is only clickable if the :guilabel:`Type` field "
"is set to :guilabel:`URL`. Enter a URL link to an online PDF document."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`網址`：只有當 :guilabel:`類型` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`網址` 時，此欄"
"位才可點擊。請輸入網上 PDF 文件的網址連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: This field is grayed out (not clickable) until a URL is "
"entered or a PDF is uploaded. If the URL is entered, the :guilabel:`Name` "
"field is left blank, and it can then be edited. If a PDF document has been "
"uploaded, the :guilabel:`Name` field is auto-populated with the file name, "
"and it can then be edited."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`File Content (base64)`: This field displays the uploaded file. "
"Click it to open the file directory and select a different PDF."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`檔案內容 (base64)`：此欄位顯示已上載的檔案。按一下即可開啟檔案目錄"
"並選擇另一個 PDF。"

