msgstr ""
":guilabel:`隱藏`：PDF 或網址不會在**銷售**應用程式中顯示。此選項最適合擬在網"
"站上發佈，但不在報價單或客戶門戶網站顯示的數碼產品文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On quote`: The PDF document or URL can be sent to customers at "
"any time. It is also available for download on the customer portal. This "
"options is best for product description files."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`報價時`：可隨時向客戶傳送 PDF 文件或網址，客戶亦可在客戶門戶網站下"
