"displayed."
msgstr ""
"已選擇頁首及頁尾的「報價單建立工具」分頁。\n"
"畫面會顯示自訂備註表單欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:28
msgid ""
"Odoo provides the option to print a PDF of the quote for record keeping. To "
"print the PDF quote, navigate to the confirmed quote, and click the "
":icon:`fa-cog` :menuselection:`Actions --> Print --> PDF Quote`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 提供列印報價單 PDF 檔案的選項，方便存檔記錄。要列印 PDF 報價單，請前往已"
"確認的報價單，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :menuselection:`動作 --> 列印 --> PDF "
"報價單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:32
msgid "A sales order drop-down menu with the option to Print PDF Quote."
msgstr "包含「列印 PDF 報價單」選項的銷售訂單下拉式選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:35
msgid ""
"Open the PDF quote file to confirm the configured header, footer, and "
"additional PDFs before printing."
msgstr "列印前，請開啟 PDF 報價單檔案，確認已配置的頁首、頁尾及額外 PDF 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:39
msgid ""
