msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:44
msgid ""
"A car dealership wants to include its vehicle purchase order form with each "
"quotation. They create a PDF template of the form and upload it to the "
"**Sales** app as a header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:47
msgid ""
"When they create a quote for a customer, they select the header in the "
"*Quote Builder* tab and manually fill in the customized note form fields."
msgstr ""
"當他們為客戶建立報價單時，可在*報價單產生器*分頁中選擇頁首，並手動填寫自訂備"
"註表單欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:50
msgid ""
"The Quote Builder tab with a vehicle purchase order form selected as the "
"header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:53
msgid ""
"After the quote has been signed and confirmed, the car seller downloads and "
"prints a copy of the PDF quote for the customer. The PDF quote contains the "
"vehicle purchase order form as the header, the quote details in the body, "
"and the dealership's standard footer."
msgstr ""
"報價單簽署並確認後，汽車銷售員會下載並列印一份 PDF 報價單給客戶。PDF 報價單的"
"頁首為車輛採購訂單表單，內文為報價詳情，頁尾則為經銷商的標準頁尾。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:60
msgid "Add headers and footers to a quote template"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:63
msgid ""
"Headers and footers added to a quote template are **only** available when "
"that template is applied — they do not appear as standalone header or footer"
" options for quotes."
msgstr ""
"加入至報價單範本的頁首及頁尾 **僅** 在套用該範本時可用，不會作為報價單的獨立"
"頁首或頁尾選項顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:66
msgid ""
"To add PDFs to a quote template, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Quote Templates`, and select the desired template. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Quote Builder` tab and click :guilabel:`Add Headers and "
"footers`. In the *Add: Headers and footers* pop-up, select the PDF to be "
"added to the quote template. Selected PDFs are displayed in the "
":guilabel:`Quote Builder` tab as cards."
msgstr ""
"要將 PDF 加入至報價單範本，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> "
"報價單範本`，並選取所需的範本。按一下 :guilabel:`報價單建立工具` 分頁，然後按"
"一下 :guilabel:`新增頁首及頁尾`。在 *新增：頁首及頁尾* 彈出式視窗中，選取要加"
"入至報價單範本的 PDF。已選取的 PDF 會以卡片形式顯示於 :guilabel:`報價單建立工"
"具` 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:72
msgid ""
"To remove a header or footer, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
":guilabel:`vertical ellipsis` icon on the card and select "
":guilabel:`Delete`. Deleting a header or footer from a quote template only "
"removes it from the template. It remains available in the *Quote Builder* "
"tab and the *Headers/Footers* page."
msgstr ""
"若要移除頁首或頁尾，請點擊卡片上的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`垂直省略"
"號` 圖示，然後選擇 :guilabel:`刪除`。從報價範本中刪除頁首或頁尾，只會將其從該"
"範本移除。該項目仍會保留在 *報價建立器* 分頁及 *頁首/頁尾* 頁面中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes.rst:78
msgid ":doc:`../quote_template`"
msgstr ":doc:`../quote_template`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:8
msgid "Configure dynamic form fields in PDFs"
msgstr "設定 PDF 中的動態表單欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:10
msgid ""
"When creating custom PDFs to import into the **Sales** app, use *dynamic "
"form fields* to auto-fill the PDF content with relevant information from the"
" Odoo database, including names and prices."
msgstr ""
"建立自訂 PDF 並匯入至 **銷售** 應用程式時，可使用 *動態表單欄位*，自動以 "
"Odoo 資料庫中的相關資訊（包括名稱及價格）填寫 PDF 內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:13
msgid ""
"*Dynamic form fields* are configurable text fields that can be added to a "
"PDF form, and Odoo automatically fills them with values from the sales "
"order/product associated with the quote."
msgstr ""
"*動態表單欄位* 是可配置的文字欄位，可新增至 PDF 表單中；Odoo 會自動使用與報價"
"單關聯的銷售訂單/產品數值來填寫這些欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:17
msgid "Formatting tips"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:19
msgid ""
"When designing the base PDF template for a quote’s header or footer, keep "
"the placements of *dynamic form field* in mind. Use the following tips to "
"avoid overlapping text and other formatting issues:"
msgstr ""
"為報價單的頁首或頁尾設計基礎 PDF 範本時，請留意 *動態表單欄位* 的擺放位置。請"
"參考以下貼士，避免文字重疊及其他格式問題："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Leave whitespace**: Ensure there is enough room for dynamic data to expand"
" without overlapping logos or borders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Add line breaks**: Place dynamic form fields, like *Customer Name*, on "
"their own lines. Alternatively, put them at the end of phrases to avoid text"
" breaking. Long names can push static text out of alignment."
msgstr ""
"**加入換行符號**：將動態表單欄位（例如 *客戶名稱*）獨立置於一行。或者將其放在"
"句末，以免文字斷行。過長的名稱可能會導致靜態文字無法對齊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:28
msgid ""
"Odoo recommends editing PDF forms with Adobe software. Form fields in header"
" and footer templates are required to retrieve dynamic values in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 建議使用 Adobe 軟件編輯 PDF 表單。頁首和頁尾範本必須包含表單欄位，才可"
"在 Odoo 中擷取動態值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:32
msgid ""
"If the PDF is too large to send as an email attachment, try using \"system "
"fonts\" (e.g., Arial, Helvetica, Times New Roman) instead of custom fonts to"
" reduce the file size."
msgstr ""
"若 PDF 檔案過大而無法作為電郵附件傳送，可嘗試改用「系統字型」（例如 Arial、"
"Helvetica、Times New Roman）代替自訂字型，以縮減檔案大小。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:36
msgid "Create dynamic form fields in PDF"
msgstr "在 PDF 中建立動態表單欄位"

