"`將 PDF 轉換為 PDF 表單 <Adobe_>`_，然後在需要插入 Odoo 資料的位置加入 *動態"
"表單欄位*。雙擊該欄位以開啟 :guilabel:`屬性`，即可將 Odoo 欄位連結至 *動態表"
"單欄位*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:66
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`General tab`, enter the name of the Odoo field for the "
":guilabel:`Name`. Set the :guilabel:`Common Properties` to "
":guilabel:`Visible` unless the field needs to be hidden until data is "
"populated."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`一般分頁` 中，於 :guilabel:`名稱` 輸入 Odoo 欄位的名稱。將 "
":guilabel:`通用屬性` 設為 :guilabel:`可見`，除非需要在填入資料前隱藏該欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:70
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`Appearance` tab and select the :guilabel:`Font "
"Size`, :guilabel:`Font Choice`, and :guilabel:`Text Color` to match the "
"template's existing text or branding. Click the :guilabel:`Options` tab and "
"set the text alignment to match the template’s design."
msgstr ""
"接下來，按一下 :guilabel:`外觀` 分頁，並選取 :guilabel:`字體大"
"小`、:guilabel:`字體選擇` 及 :guilabel:`文字顏色`，以配合範本原有的文字或品牌"
"風格。按一下 :guilabel:`選項` 分頁，並設定文字對齊方式以配合範本的設計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:75
msgid "Generic PDF editor"
msgstr "通用 PDF 編輯器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:77
msgid ""
"Open the PDF with the PDF editor, add a *dynamic form field* where the Odoo "
"information is needed. Link the Odoo fields to the *dynamic form fields* by "
"opening the field’s :guilabel:`Properties` window. Then, in the "
":guilabel:`Name` for that field, enter the name of the Odoo field."
msgstr ""
"使用 PDF 編輯器開啟 PDF，並在需要顯示 Odoo 資料的位置新增 *動態表單欄位*。開"
"啟該欄位的 :guilabel:`屬性` 視窗，即可將 Odoo 欄位連結至 *動態表單欄位*。然後"
"，在該欄位的 :guilabel:`名稱` 中輸入 Odoo 欄位的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:81
msgid ""
"If possible, configure the :guilabel:`Font Size`, :guilabel:`Font Choice`, "
"and :guilabel:`Text Color` to match the template's existing text or "
"branding. Click the :guilabel:`Options` tab and set the text alignment to "
"match the template’s design."
msgstr ""
"如情況許可，請設定 :guilabel:`字體大小`、:guilabel:`字體選擇` 及 "
":guilabel:`文字顏色`，以配合範本原有的文字或品牌風格。點擊 :guilabel:`選項` "
"分頁，並設定文字對齊方式以配合範本設計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:88
msgid "Map PDF form fields to Odoo"
msgstr "將 PDF 表單欄位對應至 Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:90
msgid ""
"This step connects any *dynamic form field* in the PDF to the corresponding "
"Odoo field by specifying the exact location of that information. Once the "
"PDF file is ready, save the changes and upload it to Odoo via "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Headers/Footers` and "
"clicking :guilabel:`Upload`."
msgstr ""
"此步驟透過指定資訊的準確位置，將 PDF 中的任何*動態表單欄位*連接至對應的 Odoo "
"欄位。PDF 檔案準備就緒後，請儲存變更，然後前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程"
"式 --> 配置 --> 頁首／頁尾`並按一下:guilabel:`上載`，將檔案上載至 Odoo。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:95
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically detects *dynamic form fields* in the uploaded PDF and "
"displays the :guilabel:`Configure dynamic fields` link. Click the "
":guilabel:`Configure dynamic fields` link to go to the :guilabel:`Form "
"Fields` page."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會自動偵測已上載 PDF 中的*動態表格欄位*，並顯示:guilabel:`配置動態欄"
"位`連結。點擊:guilabel:`配置動態欄位`連結前往:guilabel:`表格欄位`頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:99
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Form Field Name` column is populated with the *dynamic form "
"fields* from the PDF. The :guilabel:`Path` column specifies the path to the "
"Odoo field corresponding to each *dynamic form field*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:103
msgid "Configured text form fields in the PDF quote builder."
msgstr "在 PDF 報價單建立工具中已設定的文字表單欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:106
msgid ""
"To edit, click the :guilabel:`Path` cell of the desired form field row and "
"enter the Odoo field name. Refer to the :ref:`sales/dynamic_text/common-"
"dynamic-text-values` section for typical field names. Refer to the "
