msgstr "尋找 Odoo 欄位名稱或路徑"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:116
msgid ""
"Users can enable :ref:`developer-mode` in Odoo and hover over the desired "
"field to see its technical name, which is the :guilabel:`Field` value in the"
" pop-up window. Or, while in Developer Mode, navigate to the "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Email Templates` menu. In the "
"search bar, search for \"Sales\", then open a *Sales template* to see the "
":ref:`available dynamic form fields and their paths <email_template/dynamic-"
"placeholders>`."
msgstr ""
"使用者可在 Odoo 中啟用 :ref:`developer-mode`，將滑鼠懸停在所需欄位上以檢視其"
