#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Create quotation and section templates in the Odoo Sales app, from scratch "
"or from an existing quotation, and configure their terms and settings. Apply"
" templates to quotations, preview them in the customer portal, and cancel "
"multiple quotations at once."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 銷售應用程式中，從零開始或根據現有報價單建立報價單及區段範本，並設定"
"其條款與設定。將範本套用至報價單、在客戶入口網站預覽，以及一次過取消多份報價"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:11
msgid "Quotation and section templates"
msgstr "報價單及章節範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:13
msgid ""
"Quotation and section templates are reusable building blocks for quotations "
"in Odoo's **Sales** app. A quotation template prefills an entire quotation. "
"A section template prefills one section of a quotation."
msgstr ""
"報價單及章節範本是 Odoo **銷售**應用程式中可用於報價單的可重複使用組件。報價"
"單範本會預填整份報價單，而章節範本則預填報價單中的單一章節。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:17
msgid ""
"Use templates for products or services that are sold often. Templates let "
"salespeople send tailored quotations faster, without building each quotation"
" from scratch."
msgstr ""
"為經常銷售的產品或服務使用範本。範本可讓銷售人員更快發送度身訂造的報價單，無"
"需每次從頭建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:20
msgid ""
"Both template types are permanently enabled features in the **Sales** app. "
"No settings need to be activated before creating them."
msgstr ""
"這兩種範本類型均為 **銷售** 應用程式中永久啟用的功能，建立前無需啟用任何設定"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:26
