"Create a quotation or section template by going to :menuselection:`Sales app"
" --> Configuration --> Templates`. The *Templates* page displays, where "
"quotation and section templates can be created, viewed, and edited."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> 範本`，以建立報價單或章節範本。"
"系統會顯示*範本*頁面，您可在此建立、檢視及編輯報價單及章節範本。"

