msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Set the template type to :guilabel:`Quotation` or "
":guilabel:`Section`. The :guilabel:`Quotation` option is the default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類型`：將範本類型設為 :guilabel:`報價單` 或 :guilabel:`章節`。系統"
"預設為 :guilabel:`報價單` 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quote calculator`: Links to a new or existing spreadsheet that "
"performs complex calculations for the template. When a spreadsheet is "
"selected, a :guilabel:`Quote calculator` smart button displays on the sales "
"quotation form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`報價計算機`：連結至為範本執行複雜計算的新試算表或現有試算表。選擇"
"試算表後，銷售報價單表單上會顯示 :guilabel:`報價計算機` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Share`: Makes the template accessible to specific sales teams. "
"Select which teams can access it in the :guilabel:`Sales Team` field. Leave "
"blank to make it visible to all database users."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`分享`：讓特定銷售團隊可存取範本。請在 :guilabel:`銷售團隊` 欄位中"
"選擇可存取的團隊。若留空，則所有資料庫用戶均可見。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Restricts the template to one company in a :doc:`multi-"
"company environment <../../../general/companies/multi_company>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：在 :doc:`多公司環境 <../../../general/companies/"
"multi_company>` 中，將範本限制為僅供一間公司使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:50
msgid "Create a new quotation template on Odoo Sales."
msgstr "在 Odoo 銷售建立新的報價單範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:53
msgid ""
"Section templates have only the *Lines* tab. The *Terms & Conditions*, "
"*Quote Builder*, and *Settings* tabs are available only on quotation "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"章節範本只有*明細行*分頁。*條款及細則*、*報價單建立工具*及*設定*分頁僅適用於"
"報價單範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:56
msgid ""
"In the *Lines* tab, three kinds of lines can be added. Products are added by"
" clicking :guilabel:`Add a product` or :guilabel:`Catalog`. Sections are "
"added by clicking :guilabel:`Add a section` and organize products under "
"headers. Notes are added by clicking :guilabel:`Add a note` and hold extra "
"information such as warranty details or terms."
msgstr ""
"在 *明細* 分頁中，您可新增三種明細行。按一下 :guilabel:`新增產品` 或 "
":guilabel:`目錄` 即可新增產品；按一下 :guilabel:`新增章節` 可新增章節，以標題"
"整理產品；按一下 :guilabel:`新增備註` 則可新增備註，以記錄保養詳情或條款等額"
"外資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:64
msgid "Add a product"
msgstr "新增產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:66
msgid ""
"Add a product to a template by clicking :guilabel:`Add a product` in the "
"*Lines* tab and selecting the product. Templates do not support combo "
"products due to the product variations the combo requires."
msgstr ""
"在 *明細* 分頁中點擊 :guilabel:`新增產品` 並選擇產品，即可將產品新增至範本。"
"由於組合產品需要設定產品變體，因此範本不支援組合產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:70
msgid "To add a product, follow these steps:"
msgstr "若要新增產品，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:72
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a product`. A blank field appears in the "
":guilabel:`Product` column."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`加入產品`。隨後，:guilabel:`產品` 欄會出現一個空白欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:73
msgid ""
"Type the product name in the :guilabel:`Product` field, then select the "
"product from the drop-down menu."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`產品` 欄位中輸入產品名稱，然後從下拉式選單中選擇該產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:75
msgid ""
"Edit the :guilabel:`Quantity` field if needed. The default quantity is `1`."
msgstr "如有需要，請編輯 :guilabel:`數量` 欄位。預設數量為 `1`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:76
msgid ""
"To reorder the line, drag the :icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`(six-"
"squares)` icon on the left side of the line to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"如要重新排列資料行，請將該行左側的 :icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`（六個方"
"格）` 圖示拖曳至所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:79
msgid ""
"To add several products at once, click :guilabel:`Catalog` instead of "
":guilabel:`Add a product`. On the :ref:`Product catalog "
"<essentials/product_catalog/database-record>` page, select multiple products"
" and quantities, and click :guilabel:`Back to Template` to return to the "
"template."
msgstr ""
"如要一次新增多個產品，請點擊 :guilabel:`目錄`，而非 :guilabel:`新增產品`。在 "
":ref:`產品目錄 <essentials/product_catalog/database-record>` 頁面上，選擇多個"
"產品及數量，然後點擊 :guilabel:`返回範本` 以返回範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:84
msgid ""
"It is possible to add event-related products (booths and registrations) to "
"quotation templates. To do so, click the :guilabel:`Product` field, type in "
"`Event`, and select the desired event-related product from the resulting "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"您可以將活動相關產品（攤位及報名）新增至報價單範本。為此，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`產品` 欄位，輸入 `活動`，然後從出現的下拉式選單中選擇所需的活動相"
"關產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:91
msgid "Add sections to a quotation or section template"
msgstr "為報價單或分節範本新增分節"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:93
msgid ""
"Add a section to a template by clicking :guilabel:`Add a section` in the "
"*Lines* tab and typing the section name. A section is a header that groups "
"the lines of a quotation. In a section template, an added section becomes a "
"subsection."
msgstr ""
"在 *明細行* 分頁按一下 :guilabel:`新增章節` 並輸入章節名稱，即可將章節新增至"
"範本。章節是用於將報價單明細分組的標題。在章節範本中，新增的章節會成為子章節"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:97
msgid "To add a section, follow these steps:"
msgstr "要新增章節，請依照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:99
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add a section`. A blank field appears."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`新增區段`。畫面會顯示空白欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:100
msgid ""
"Type the section name and, if needed, a description. Click outside the field"
" to save it."
msgstr "輸入部分名稱，如有需要亦可輸入說明。按一下欄位外部即可儲存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:101
msgid ""
"To reorder the section, drag the :icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`(six-"
"squares)` icon on the left side of the line to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"如要重新排列該部分，請將資料行左側的 :icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`（六個"
"方格）` 圖示拖曳至所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:103
msgid ""
":ref:`Add products <sales/quote_template/product>` below the section header "
"to include them in the section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:106
msgid ""
"The section header can set the quantity and unit for every product in the "
"section at once. Enter the new values in the :guilabel:`Quantity` and "
":guilabel:`Unit` fields on the section header line. Odoo updates the "
":guilabel:`Quantity` and :guilabel:`Unit` fields of every product in that "
"section automatically."
msgstr ""
"區段標題可一次為該區段中的所有產品設定數量和單位。在區段標題行的 "
":guilabel:`數量` 及 :guilabel:`單位` 欄位中輸入新數值。Odoo 會自動更新該區段"
"中每個產品的 :guilabel:`數量` 及 :guilabel:`單位` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:112
msgid "Configuration options in the section header drop-down menu"
msgstr "區段標題下拉式選單中的設定選項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:114
msgid ""
"More section configuration options are available from the :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon on the section header line."
" The following list describes the drop-down menu options:"
msgstr ""
"點擊章節標題行上的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（垂直省略號）` 圖示，可"
"查看更多章節設定選項。以下列出下拉式選單的選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:117
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a line`: Adds a product line to the section."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`新增資料行`：在該區段新增一個產品資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:118
msgid ""
":icon:`subdirectory_arrow_right` :guilabel:`Add a subsection`: Adds a "
"section inside the current section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:120
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-eye-slash` :guilabel:`Hide Prices`: Shows the product list and "
"section subtotal, but hides individual product prices on the customer portal"
" and on the quotation or sales order PDF. A :icon:`fa-eye-slash` "
":guilabel:`(Hide Prices)` icon appears on the section header. To disable it,"
" select :icon:`fa-eye` :guilabel:`Show Prices` from the same menu."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-eye-slash` :guilabel:`隱藏價格`：顯示產品清單及分區小計，但在顧客門"
"戶網站以及報價單或銷售訂單 PDF 上隱藏個別產品價格。分區標題上會顯示一個 "
":icon:`fa-eye-slash` :guilabel:`（隱藏價格）` 圖示。如要停用，請從同一選單選"
"擇 :icon:`fa-eye` :guilabel:`顯示價格`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:124
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-compress` :guilabel:`Hide Composition`: Shows only the section "
"header and subtotal and hides the products on the customer portal and on the"
" quotation or sales order. Products appear grayed out on the template, and a"
" :icon:`fa-compress` :guilabel:`(Hide Composition)` icon appears on the "
"section header. To disable it, select :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`Show "
"Composition` from the same menu."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-compress` :guilabel:`隱藏組成`：僅顯示分節標題及小計，並在客戶門戶"
"、報價單或銷售訂單上隱藏產品。產品在範本上會顯示為灰色，且分節標題上會出"
"現:icon:`fa-compress` :guilabel:`（隱藏組成）`圖示。若要停用此功能，請從同一"
"選單選擇:icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`顯示組成`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:129
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-dot-circle-o` :guilabel:`Set Optional`: Turns the section into an "
":ref:`optional products section <sales/optional_products/sections>`. A "
":icon:`fa-dot-circle-o` :guilabel:`(Set Optional)` icon appears on the "
"section header. To disable it, select :icon:`fa-dot-circle-o` "
":guilabel:`Unset Optional` from the same menu."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-dot-circle-o` :guilabel:`設為可選`：將區段轉為 :ref:`可選產品區段 "
"<sales/optional_products/sections>`。區段標題上會顯示 :icon:`fa-dot-circle-"
"o` :guilabel:`（設為可選）` 圖示。要停用此功能，請從同一選單選擇 :icon:`fa-"
"dot-circle-o` :guilabel:`取消設為可選`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:133
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-sticky-note-o` :guilabel:`Add a note`: :ref:`Adds a note "
"<sales/quote_template/note>` inside the section."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-sticky-note-o` :guilabel:`新增備註`：在區段內 :ref:`新增備註 "
"<sales/quote_template/note>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:135
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-arrow-up` :guilabel:`Move Up`: Moves the section and its contents "
"up one line."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-arrow-up` :guilabel:`上移`：將此部分及其內容向上移動一行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:136
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-arrow-down` :guilabel:`Move Down`: Moves the section and its "
"contents down one line."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-arrow-down` :guilabel:`下移`：將此區段及其內容向下移動一行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:137
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`Duplicate`: Copies the section and its contents "
"directly below the original section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:139
msgid ""
":icon:`delete` :guilabel:`Delete`: Removes the section and every product and"
" note inside it."
msgstr ":icon:`delete` :guilabel:`刪除`：移除該區段及其內的所有產品和備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:147
msgid "Add notes to a template"
msgstr "在範本中加入備註"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:149
msgid ""
"Add a note to a template by clicking :guilabel:`Add a note` in the *Lines* "
"tab and typing the text. A note appears on the quotation as text for the "
"customer."
msgstr ""
"在 *資料行* 分頁點擊 :guilabel:`加入備註` 並輸入文字，即可將備註加至範本。備"
"註會在報價單上顯示為給客戶的文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:152
msgid "To add a note, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如要新增備註，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:154
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add a note`. A blank field appears."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`新增備註`。畫面上會出現一個空白欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:155
msgid "Type the note, then click outside the field to save it."
msgstr "輸入備註，然後點擊欄位外側以儲存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:156
msgid ""
"To reorder the note, drag the :icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`(six-"
"squares)` icon on the left side of the line to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"若要重新排列備註順序，請將資料行左側的 :icon:`drag_indicator` :guilabel:`(六"
"個方格)` 圖示拖曳至所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:162
msgid "Delete a line from a template"
msgstr "從範本中刪除明細行"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:164
msgid ""
"Delete any product, section, or note from the *Lines* tab by clicking the "
":icon:`delete` :guilabel:`(remove record)` icon on the far-right side of "
"that line. Deleting a section also deletes every product and note inside it."
msgstr ""
"要從 *明細行* 分頁刪除任何產品、部分或備註，請按一下該行最右側的 "
":icon:`delete` :guilabel:`（移除記錄）` 圖示。刪除部分亦會一併刪除其中的所有"
"產品及備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:171
msgid "Add Terms & Conditions to a quotation template"
msgstr "為報價單範本新增條款及細則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:173
msgid ""
"Add terms and conditions to a quotation template by typing them in the "
"*Terms & Conditions* tab of the template form. Use the tab for contractual "
"points, such as returns and refunds, warranty, and after-sale services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:177
msgid ""
"Terms and conditions are optional. A quotation template can be saved without"
" them. The *Terms & Conditions* tab is not available on section templates."
msgstr ""
"條款及細則為選填項目，即使未有填寫亦可儲存報價單範本。章節範本不設 *條款及細"
"則* 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:180
msgid ""
"For company-wide terms that apply to every quotation, see the Odoo "
"documentation on :doc:`default terms and conditions "
"<../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions>`."
msgstr ""
"有關適用於所有報價單的公司通用條款，請參閱 Odoo 說明文件中關於:doc:`預設條款"
"及細則 <../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions>`的頁"
"面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:186
msgid "Use the PDF quote builder in a quotation template"
msgstr "在報價單範本中使用 PDF 報價單建立工具"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:189
msgid ""
"The *Quote Builder* tab requires the :ref:`PDF Quote builder "
"<sales/pdf_quote_builder/configuration>` setting. If the setting is not "
"enabled, the tab does not appear on the quotation template form. The tab is "
"not available on section templates."
msgstr ""
"*報價建立工具* 分頁需要 :ref:`PDF 報價建立工具 <sales/pdf_quote_builder/"
"configuration>` 設定。如果未啟用此設定，該分頁將不會顯示於報價單範本表單中。"
"此分頁不適用於章節範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:193
msgid ""
"The *Quote Builder* tab :ref:`assigns specific headers and footers to a "
"quotation template <pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes/add-to-quote-"
"template>`. Those headers and footers are available on a quotation only when"
" the quotation template is applied to it."
msgstr ""
"*報價建立工具* 分頁可 :ref:`為報價單範本指派特定的頁首及頁尾 "
"<pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes/add-to-quote-template>`。只有在報價單套用該"
"報價單範本時，這些頁首及頁尾才可在該報價單上使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:200
msgid "Configure quotation template settings"
msgstr "配置報價單範本設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:202
msgid ""
"The *Settings* tab of a quotation template controls how quotations are "
"confirmed and which journal invoices them. The tab has a *Confirmation* and "
"an *Invoicing* section. The *Settings* tab is not available on section "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"報價單範本的 *設定* 分頁用於控制報價單的確認方式，以及用作開立發票的日記賬。"
"該分頁設有 *確認* 及 *開立發票* 兩個部分。區段範本不提供 *設定* 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:206
msgid "The following list describes the fields in the *Confirmation* section:"
msgstr "以下列表說明 *確認* 部分中的欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:208
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quotation Validity`: The number of days the quotation template is"
" valid. The default value of `0` keeps the template valid indefinitely."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`報價單有效期`：報價單範本的有效天數。預設值為 `0`，表示範本永久有"
"效。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online Signature`: A global setting that applies to all sales "
"orders. It requests an online signature from the customer to confirm an "
"order, even if *Online Signature* isn't enabled on the **Sales** *Settings* "
"page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`網上簽名`：適用於所有銷售訂單的全域設定。即使在 **銷售** *設定* 頁"
"面未啟用 *網上簽名*，系統仍會要求客戶提供網上簽名以確認訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prepayment`: A global setting that applies to all sales orders. "
"It sets the percentage of the sales order total that the customer must pay "
"before the order is confirmed. It allows online payment, even if *Online "
"Payment* isn't enabled on the Sales *Settings* page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預付款`：適用於所有銷售訂單的全局設定，用於設定客戶在確認訂單前必"
"須支付的銷售訂單總額百分比。即使銷售*設定*頁面未啟用*網上付款*，此設定仍允許"
"網上付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:218
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online Signature` and :guilabel:`Prepayment` can be enabled at "
"the same time. When both are enabled, the customer must sign **and** pay to "
"confirm an order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`網上簽署` 與 :guilabel:`預付款項` 可同時啟用。兩者皆啟用時，客戶必"
"須簽署 **並** 付款，方可確認訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:221
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Confirmation Mail`: The email template sent to the customer when "
"an order is confirmed. Select an existing email template or :ref:`create a "
"new one <sales/quote_template/create-confirmation-mail>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:225
msgid ""
"In the *Invoicing* section, the :guilabel:`Invoicing Journal` field sets the"
" journal that invoices every sales order from the quotation template. If the"
" field is empty, Odoo uses the sales journal with the lowest sequence."
msgstr ""
"在 *開立發票* 部分中， :guilabel:`開立發票日記賬` 欄位用於設定為該報價單範本"
"中每張銷售訂單開立發票的日記賬。如果該欄位留空，Odoo 會使用序號最低的銷售日記"
"賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:232
