"此連接器支援追蹤來自 Shopify 訂單的市場推廣數據，例如 :guilabel:`UTM 活"
"動`、:guilabel:`來源` 及 :guilabel:`媒介`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector.rst:121
msgid ""
"Attributes are fetched during order synchronization and stored on the sales "
"order in Odoo."
msgstr "系統會在訂單同步期間擷取屬性，並將其儲存在 Odoo 的銷售訂單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector.rst:122
