#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:11
msgid ""
"The Shopify connector synchronizes deliveries and shipping information, "
"creates invoices and registers payments, and processes returns and refunds "
"between Shopify and Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Shopify 連接器會在 Shopify 與 Odoo 之間同步送貨及配送資訊、建立發票及登記付款"
"，以及處理退貨與退款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:17
