msgstr "選擇送貨方式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:19
msgid ""
"The delivery mode is configured on the Shopify account form. Go to "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Shopify: Accounts` and "
"either select an existing Shopify account form or click :guilabel:`New`. "
"Using the :guilabel:`Delivery Handled On` drop-down menu, users can "
"configure which platform handles the delivery: :ref:`Odoo "
"<shopify/fulfillment/odoo-deliveries>` or :ref:`Shopify (E-commerce "
"Platform) <shopify/fulfillment/shopify-deliveries>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:25
msgid "Example of the Delivery Handled On field on the Shopify account form."
msgstr "Shopify 帳戶表單中「送貨處理方式」欄位的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:29
msgid ""
"`Tutorial: Shopify connector delivery flow for Odoo 19 | Odoo.sh <shopify-"
"delivery-flow_>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:36
msgid ""
"Configuring deliveries to be handled in Odoo is useful when a company's "
"warehouse team is transitioning or already operating within Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:39
msgid ""
"When the Shopify account form is set to *Delivery Handled On: Odoo*, the "
"Shopify connector automatically creates a warehouse delivery form during the"
" order sync. To process a Shopify delivery in Odoo, go to "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Shopify: Accounts` and "
"select the desired Shopify account form."
msgstr ""
"當 Shopify 帳戶表單設為 *送貨處理：Odoo* 時，Shopify 連接器會在同步訂單期間自"
"動建立倉庫送貨單。如要在 Odoo 中處理 Shopify 送貨，請前往:menuselection:`銷售"
"應用程式 --> 配置 --> Shopify：帳戶`，然後選取所需的 Shopify 帳戶表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:44
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-dollar` :guilabel:`Orders` smart button to see all the "
"sales orders (SO) from the Shopify store. Select the desired :abbr:`SO "
"(sales order)` and click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` smart "
"button."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-dollar` :guilabel:`訂單` 智能按鈕，即可查看來自 Shopify 商店的"
"所有銷售訂單（SO）。選擇所需的:abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）`，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"truck` :guilabel:`送貨` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:48
msgid ""
"The warehouse delivery form is created in the :guilabel:`Ready` stage in "
"Odoo. Click :guilabel:`Validate` to confirm the delivery. Once validated, a "
":guilabel:`Scheduled for Synchronization with E-commerce Platform` badge "
"displays on the form. A scheduled action running every 10 minutes pushes the"
" shipment to Shopify. Alternatively, click :guilabel:`Update to E-commerce` "
"to push the update manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:54
msgid ""
"Example of a warehouse transfer when Odoo is configured to handle "
"deliveries."
msgstr "Odoo 設定為處理送貨時的倉庫調撥範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:57
msgid ""
"If the delivery successfully updates to Shopify, a green "
":guilabel:`Synchronized with E-commerce Platform` badge displays, and a log "
"note with a success message is added to the delivery form. If the delivery "
"fails to update, a red :guilabel:`Synchronization with E-commerce Platform "
"failed` badge displays, and a log note with a failure message is added to "
"the delivery form."
msgstr ""
"如果送貨資料成功更新至 Shopify，系統會顯示綠色的 :guilabel:`已與電子商務平台"
"同步` 徽章，並在送貨單加入附有成功訊息的記錄備註。如果送貨資料更新失敗，系統"
"會顯示紅色的 :guilabel:`與電子商務平台同步失敗` 徽章，並在送貨單加入附有失敗"
"訊息的記錄備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:62
msgid ""
"If successful, the order is marked as *Fulfilled* on Shopify, along with the"
" carrier and tracking number from Odoo. Shopify notifies the customer after "
"the fulfillment is created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:66
msgid ""
"If deliveries are handled in Odoo, returns initiated in Shopify do **not** "
"sync automatically, and must be handled manually in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:74
msgid ""
"Configuring deliveries to be handled in Shopify is useful when the orders "
"are fulfilled entirely within Shopify or by a third-party logistics "
"provider. When the Shopify account form is set to *Delivery Handled On: "
"E-commerce Platform*, the Shopify connector automatically creates a "
"warehouse delivery in Odoo for any pulled order tagged *Unfulfilled*. The "
"form is created in the :guilabel:`Ready` stage and lists the associated "
"sales order's products and their quantities as separate line items."
msgstr ""
"當訂單完全在 Shopify 內或由第三方物流供應商履行時，設定由 Shopify 處理送貨會"
"十分有用。當 Shopify 帳戶表單設為*送貨處理平台：電子商務平台*時，Shopify 連接"
"器會為任何標記為*未履行*的提取訂單在 Odoo 中自動建立倉庫送貨單。該表單會建立"
"在:guilabel:`就緒`階段，並將相關銷售訂單的產品及其數量列為個別項目行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:81
msgid ""
"Although the entire delivery process takes place in Shopify, the delivery "
"details (carrier, tracking number, and quantities) are pulled into Odoo once"
" an actual delivery is created on Shopify. When the delivered order is then "
"pulled into Odoo, its warehouse delivery form updates to the "
":guilabel:`Done` stage. Similarly, if a pulled order already has the "
"*Fulfilled* tag, Odoo creates its warehouse delivery form directly in the "
":guilabel:`Done` stage."
msgstr ""
"雖然整個送貨流程都在 Shopify 中進行，但一旦在 Shopify 上建立實際送貨單，送貨"
"詳情（承運商、追蹤編號及數量）便會提取至 Odoo。之後當已送貨的訂單提取至 Odoo "
"時，其倉庫送貨單會更新為 :guilabel:`完成` 階段。同樣地，如果已提取的訂單已帶"
"有 *已出貨* 標籤，Odoo 會直接在 :guilabel:`完成` 階段建立其倉庫送貨單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:87
msgid ""
"Example of a warehouse transfer when Shopify is configured to handle "
"deliveries."
msgstr "將 Shopify 設定為處理送貨時的倉庫調撥範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:90
msgid ""
"Corresponding warehouse delivery forms are created as a backorder of the "
"default picking, to reduce inventory if there is a difference between the "
"actual :abbr:`SO (sales order)` request and the delivered quantity."
msgstr ""
"如果實際的 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）` 要求與已交付數量之間存在差異，系統會將相應"
"的倉庫送貨單建立為預設揀貨單的欠單，以扣減庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:95
msgid ""
"If a delivery exists in Shopify but is not created in Odoo for any reason "
"(including a discrepancy at the order or invoice level), an activity is "
"scheduled for resolution."
msgstr ""
"如果 Shopify 中存在送貨單，但因任何原因（包括訂單或發票層級的差異）未有在 "
"Odoo 建立，系統便會排程一項活動以作跟進解決。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:98
msgid ""
"Split fulfillments are fully supported and synchronized correctly. Multiple "
"fulfillments can be created for the same order, including:"
msgstr "系統完全支援分批出貨並能正確同步。同一張訂單可建立多個出貨記錄，包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:101
msgid "Fulfillments from different locations."
msgstr "來自不同地點的訂單履行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:102
msgid "Multiple fulfillments from the same location."
msgstr "從同一地點進行多次履約出貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:103
msgid "Different carriers for different shipments."
msgstr "不同貨件採用不同承運商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:104
msgid "Partial quantity fulfillment across shipments."
msgstr "跨次發貨履行部分數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:106
msgid ""
"All fulfillment details, including location, carrier, tracking numbers, and "
"fulfilled quantities, are synced accurately with Odoo, with corresponding "
"stock moves and delivery updates."
msgstr ""
"所有訂單履行詳情（包括位置、承運商、追蹤編號及已履行數量）均會準確同步至 Odoo"
"，並相應更新庫存移動及送貨資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:112
msgid "Shipping synchronization"
msgstr "運送同步"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:114
msgid ""
"When a Shopify order includes a shipping fee and carrier, Odoo adds the "
"default :guilabel:`E-commerce Shipping` product to the invoice and order "
"with the shipping fee. The actual name of the delivery carrier selected by "
"the customer (such as Sendcloud, Shiprocket, or FedEx) is added to the "
"description of that invoice or order line."
msgstr ""
"當 Shopify 訂單包含運費及承運商時，Odoo 會將預設的 :guilabel:`電子商務送貨` "
"產品連同運費加入發票及訂單。客戶所選送貨承運商的實際名稱（例如 Sendcloud、"
"Shiprocket 或 FedEx）會加入該發票或訂單行的描述中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:119
msgid ""
"Example of the E-commerce Shipping product on an sales order in the Sales "
"app."
msgstr "銷售應用程式中銷售單上「電子商務運費」產品的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:125
msgid "Manage stock locations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:127
msgid ""
"The Shopify connector allows syncing Shopify stock locations to Odoo stock "
"locations, ensuring movements are recorded against the correct warehouse and"
" inventory stays accurate across multiple fulfillment centers. Once mapped, "
"delivery pickings are automatically assigned to the corresponding Odoo "
"location during fulfillment synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Shopify 連接器可將 Shopify 庫存位置同步至 Odoo 庫存位置，確保移動記錄於正確的"
"倉庫，並讓多個配送中心的庫存保持準確。對應完成後，在同步訂單配送期間，系統會"
"將交貨揀貨單自動指派至相應的 Odoo 位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:132
msgid ""
"To map a Shopify store's stock location to an Odoo stock location, refer to "
"the :ref:`shopify/manage/configure-multi-location` section of the *Shopify "
"order management* page."
msgstr ""
"若要將 Shopify 商店的庫存位置對應至 Odoo 庫存位置，請參閱 *Shopify 訂單管理* "
"頁面的 :ref:`shopify/manage/configure-multi-location` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:135
msgid ""
"To view or edit mapped Shopify to Odoo stock locations, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Shopify: Locations` or click"
" the :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`Locations` smart button on the Shopify "
"account form. The :guilabel:`Locations` page displays the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:139
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: Shopify stock location."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:140
msgid ":guilabel:`Stock Location`: Odoo stock location."
msgstr ":guilabel:`庫存位置`：Odoo 庫存位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:141
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:165
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stock Synchronization`: When enabled, it controls exactly which "
"inventory is synced back to Shopify or pulled from Shopify."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:144
msgid ""
"To edit the stock location mapping, click the :guilabel:`Stock Location` "
"field and select an option in the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"要編輯庫存位置對應，請點擊 :guilabel:`庫存位置` 欄位，並在下拉式選單中選擇一"
"個選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:147
msgid "Example of the Locations page for the Shopify connector in Sales app."
msgstr "銷售應用程式中 Shopify 連接器的位置頁面範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:153
msgid "Syncing inventory with deliveries"
msgstr "將庫存與送貨同步"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:155
msgid ""
"The Shopify connector uses scheduled actions to sync orders, deliveries, and"
" stock between Shopify and Odoo. Deliveries received from Shopify are "
"processed using a backorder-based approach: partial fulfillments "
"automatically generate the required backorders in Odoo, so fulfilled and "
"remaining quantities are tracked correctly. Inventory syncs immediately "
"after order syncing to minimize stock discrepancies between the two "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"Shopify 連接器會使用排程動作，在 Shopify 與 Odoo 之間同步訂單、送貨及庫存。"
"從 Shopify 接收的送貨會以欠單方式處理：部分出貨會自動在 Odoo 中生成所需的欠單"
"，從而準確追蹤已出貨及剩餘數量。訂單同步後會隨即同步庫存，以盡量減少兩個平台"
"之間的庫存差異。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:161
msgid ""
"Refer to the :doc:`manage` page for more information on order syncing. For "
"information on inventory syncing with returns, refer to the "
":ref:`shopify/fulfillment/returns` section."
msgstr ""
"有關訂單同步的更多資訊，請參閱 :doc:`manage` 頁面。有關退貨庫存同步的資訊，請"
"參閱 :ref:`shopify/fulfillment/returns` 章節。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:167
msgid "Carrier and tracking management"
msgstr "承運商及追蹤管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:169
msgid ""
"Carriers are mapped automatically during order synchronization. If a "
":ref:`carrier does not exist in Odoo <inventory/shipping/third_party>`, it "
"is created automatically. Tracking numbers are synchronized both ways "
"between Shopify and Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:176
msgid "Accounting and payments"
msgstr "會計及付款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:178
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Create Invoice` option is available on the "
":ref:`Configuration tab <shopify/setup/administrative-settings>` of the "
"Shopify account form. This option controls whether Odoo automatically "
"creates invoices when importing orders from Shopify."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:182
msgid "When enabled:"
msgstr "啟用後："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:184
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically creates and posts the invoice when an order is marked as "
"paid in Shopify."
msgstr "當訂單在 Shopify 標記為已付款時，Odoo 會自動建立並過賬發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:185
msgid "The payment is automatically registered."
msgstr "付款會自動登記。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:186
msgid ""
"The invoice is generated using the order details, including products, "
"quantities, and pricing."
msgstr "系統會使用訂單詳情（包括產品、數量及價格）來產生發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:187
msgid ""
"If no journals are configured, the payment journal is split based on the "
"payment provider."
msgstr "如未配置日記賬，付款日記賬會根據付款服務商進行分拆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:189
msgid ""
"When disabled, the invoice must be created manually from the sales order."
msgstr "停用此功能後，必須從銷售訂單手動建立發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:192
msgid "This feature applies only to orders marked as fully paid in Shopify."
msgstr "此功能僅適用於在 Shopify 標記為全數付款的訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:194
msgid "An invoice automatically created and paid for a Shopify order in Odoo."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中為 Shopify 訂單自動建立並付款的發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:197
msgid ""
"Also in the *Configuration* tab, there is a *Journals* section that allows "
"configuring accounting journals for payments and sales. Refer to "
":ref:`shopify/setup/administrative-settings` for more details."
msgstr ""
"此外，在 *設定* 分頁中，*日記賬* 部份可用於設定付款及銷售的會計日記賬。詳情請"
"參閱 :ref:`shopify/setup/administrative-settings`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:204
msgid "Creating returns and refunds"
msgstr "建立退貨及退款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:207
msgid ""
"If :ref:`deliveries are handled in Odoo <shopify/fulfillment/odoo-"
"deliveries>`, returns initiated in Shopify do **not** sync automatically, "
"and must be :doc:`done manually <../products_prices/returns>` in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`在 Odoo 處理送貨 <shopify/fulfillment/odoo-deliveries>`，在 "
"Shopify 發起的退貨 **不會** 自動同步，必須在 Odoo :doc:`手動處理 <../"
"products_prices/returns>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:211
msgid ""
":ref:`Returns <shopify/fulfillment/returns>` and :ref:`refunds "
"<shopify/fulfillment/refunds>` start in the Shopify platform. When an order "
"is pulled from Shopify using the scheduled action or *Fetch Orders*, the "
"return and refund are created in Odoo along with the associated delivery "
"record (if applicable). This sync is ongoing: if a return or refund is "
"created on Shopify after the order has already been fetched, it is still "
"synced when the order is fetched again."
msgstr ""
":ref:`退貨 <shopify/fulfillment/returns>` 和 :ref:`退款 <shopify/fulfillment/"
"refunds>` 均在 Shopify 平台發起。使用排程動作或 *擷取訂單* 從 Shopify 提取訂"
"單時，系統會在 Odoo 中建立退貨及退款，並連同相關的交貨紀錄（如適用）。此同步"
"會持續進行：如果訂單提取後才在 Shopify 上建立退貨或退款，下次重新提取該訂單時"
"仍會同步更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:217
msgid ""
"During the sync, Odoo first checks whether a return or refund already exists"
" on the :abbr:`SO (sales order)` using the unique identifiers provided by "
"Shopify. Only returns and refunds that do not yet exist in Odoo are synced."
msgstr ""
"同步期間，Odoo 會先使用 Shopify 提供的唯一識別碼，檢查:abbr:`SO（銷售訂單"
"）`上是否已存在退貨或退款。只有尚不存在於 Odoo 中的退貨和退款才會進行同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:224
msgid "Creating a return"
msgstr "建立退貨"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:226
msgid ""
"Go to the desired Shopify order and click :guilabel:`Return`. On the *Return"
" and exchange* page, enter the quantity of products to return for a single "
"or multiple deliveries."
msgstr ""
"前往所需的 Shopify 訂單，然後點擊 :guilabel:`退貨`。在 *退貨及換貨* 頁面上，"
"為單個或多個送貨單輸入要退回的產品數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:229
msgid "Example of the Return and Exchange page in Shopify."
msgstr "Shopify 退貨及換貨頁面的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:232
msgid ""
"In the *Return shipping options* section, click :guilabel:`Add files` to "
"upload a return label. Enter a tracking number in the :guilabel:`Tracking "
"number` field and select a carrier option in the :guilabel:`Shipping "
"carrier` drop-down menu. Click :guilabel:`Create return` to open a return."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:236
msgid "Example of the Shipping options section on the Return form in Shopify."
msgstr "Shopify 退貨表單中「運送選項」部分的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:239
msgid ""
"The return is initially set as *Return in progress*, and is not synced to "
"Odoo in this state. The return must be closed first to make it eligible for "
"synchronization. Click :guilabel:`Process and refund` to continue the "
"process."
msgstr ""
"退貨最初會設為 *退貨處理中*，在此狀態下不會同步至 Odoo。必須先關閉退貨，才符"
"合同步資格。點擊 :guilabel:`處理及退款` 以繼續流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:243
msgid ""
"On the *Process return* page, verify the return item information and select "
"a :guilabel:`Restock at` option. Then, click :guilabel:`Process and refund` "
"again to confirm and close the return in Shopify."
msgstr ""
"在 *處理退貨* 頁面上，核對退貨項目資料並選擇 :guilabel:`重新入庫地點` 選項。"
"然後，再次點擊 :guilabel:`處理並退款` 以在 Shopify 中確認並關閉該筆退貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:247
msgid "Example of the Restock at option on the Return form in Shopify."
msgstr "Shopify 退貨表格上「重新入庫位置」選項的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:251
msgid ""
"To keep stock consistent between the two platforms, always select "
":guilabel:`Restock at` when creating a return. If the option is not "
"selected, Shopify's stock is not reduced, but Odoo's stock still is."
msgstr ""
"為確保兩個平台之間的庫存保持一致，建立退貨單時請務必選取:guilabel:`補貨於`。"
"若未選取此選項，Shopify 的庫存將不會減少，但 Odoo 的庫存仍會相應扣減。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:255
msgid ""
"Shopify allows creating one return for multiple fulfillments. Odoo splits "
"the return into multiple deliveries or fulfillments accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Shopify 容許為多個訂單履行建立單一退貨單。Odoo 會相應將退貨拆分為多個送貨單或"
"訂單履行單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:259
msgid "Syncing and processing a return in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 同步及處理退貨"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:262
msgid ""
"Returns with a :guilabel:`Cancelled` status on Shopify are not synced. "
"However, if a return was already synced before being canceled on Shopify, an"
" activity is scheduled on the return, prompting the user to manually cancel "
"it and adjust stock accordingly."
msgstr ""
"在 Shopify 上狀態為:guilabel:`已取消`的退貨不會同步。不過，如果退貨在 "
"Shopify 上被取消前已經同步，系統會在該退貨記錄上安排一項活動，提示用戶手動取"
"消並相應調整庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:266
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:353
msgid ""
"In Odoo, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Shopify: "
"Accounts` and select the desired Shopify account. Click :icon:`fa-refresh` "
":guilabel:`Fetch Orders` to manually pull data from Shopify. Click "
":icon:`fa-dollar` :guilabel:`Orders` and select the desired :abbr:`SO (sales"
" order)`."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> Shopify：帳戶`，並"
"選取所需的 Shopify 帳戶。按一下 :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`擷取訂單` 以手"
"動從 Shopify 提取資料。按一下 :icon:`fa-dollar` :guilabel:`訂單`，並選取所需"
"的 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:271
msgid ""
"A return is created as a warehouse receipt form on the associated :abbr:`SO "
"(sales order)`. Click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button"
" to view the *Transfers* page which lists all stock movements for the "
":abbr:`SO (sales order)`. Click the warehouse receipt entry with a `Return "
"of WH/OUT/reference number` in the :guilabel:`Source Document` column."
msgstr ""
"退貨會在相關的:abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）`上建立為倉庫收貨單。點擊:icon:`fa-truck` "
":guilabel:`送貨`智能按鈕，即可檢視列出該:abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）`所有庫存調動"
"的*調撥*頁面。點擊帶有 `Return of WH/OUT/參考編號`（顯示於:guilabel:`來源單"
"據`欄）的倉庫收貨項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:276
msgid "Example of the Transfers page for a Shopify SO in the Sales app."
msgstr "銷售應用程式中 Shopify 銷售訂單「調撥」頁面的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:279
msgid ""
"The warehouse receipt is always created in the :guilabel:`Ready` stage, so "
"that the user can review it before validation. On the form, the return date "
"from Shopify is set as the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date`. The "
":guilabel:`E-commerce Return Identifier` field displays the unique return "
"identifier number that Shopify added for traceability and to avoid "
"duplication during synchronization. The warehouse receipt form lists the "
"return products and their quantities on their own order lines. Click "
":guilabel:`Validate` when the return product is received. The stage on the "
"warehouse receipt form changes to :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
"倉庫收貨單建立時必定處於:guilabel:`就緒`階段，以便用戶在驗證前先作檢查。在表"
"單上，來自 Shopify 的退貨日期會設為:guilabel:`預定日期`。:guilabel:`電子商務"
"退貨識別碼`欄位會顯示 Shopify 新增的唯一退貨識別碼，以便追蹤並避免同步時重複"
"。倉庫收貨單表單會在獨立的訂單資料行中，列出退貨產品及其數量。收到退貨產品後"
"，請按一下:guilabel:`驗證`。倉庫收貨單表單上的階段隨即變為:guilabel:`完成`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:288
msgid ""
"If Shopify creates a single return for multiple fulfillments, Odoo splits it"
" into separate return records, one per fulfillment."
msgstr ""
"如果 Shopify 為多項履約建立單一退貨單，Odoo 會將其拆分為多筆獨立的退貨記錄，"
"每項履約對應一筆記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:291
msgid ""
"Example of the warehouse receipt for a Shopify return in the Sales app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:295
msgid "Processing the refund for the return"
msgstr "處理退貨退款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:297
msgid ""
"Go back to the :abbr:`SO (sales order)` by clicking the SO number in the "
"breadcrumbs. Click the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Invoices` smart"
" button. The credit note line item is highlighted in blue and shows a "
"negative amount in the :guilabel:`Total` column. Click the credit note to "
"open the form."
msgstr ""
"點擊導覽路徑中的銷售訂單編號，返回 :abbr:`SO (銷售訂單)`。點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`發票` 智能按鈕。貸記單資料行會以藍色反白顯示，並"
"在 :guilabel:`總計` 欄顯示負數金額。點擊該貸記單即可開啟表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:302
msgid "Example of the Invoices page for a Shopify return in the Sales app."
msgstr "「銷售」應用程式中 Shopify 退貨發票頁面的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:305
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:370
msgid ""
"The credit note is always created in the :guilabel:`Draft` stage to allow "
"for user review. On the credit note form, Shopify sets the refund date as "
"the :guilabel:`Invoice Date`. The :guilabel:`E-commerce Refund Identifier` "
"field displays the unique refund identifier number that Shopify added for "
"traceability and to prevent duplication during synchronization."
msgstr ""
"貸記單一律會以:guilabel:`草稿`階段建立，以便用戶審核。在貸記單表單上，"
"Shopify 會將退款日期設為:guilabel:`發票日期`。:guilabel:`電子商務退款識別"
"碼`欄位會顯示 Shopify 加入的唯一退款識別碼編號，以便追蹤及防止同步期間出現重"
"複項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:310
msgid "Example of a credit note draft for a Shopify return in the Sales app."
msgstr "銷售應用程式中 Shopify 退貨的貸項通知單草稿範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:313
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:375
msgid ""
"Verify the products and quantities are correct, and click "
":guilabel:`Confirm` to process the credit note. The status is updated to "
":guilabel:`Posted`. Then, click :guilabel:`Pay`, and in the *Pay* pop-up "
"window, click :guilabel:`Create Payment` to complete the refund. The credit "
"note form displays a :guilabel:`Paid` banner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:319
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:381
msgid ""
"When Shopify creates a refund without associated return lines, Odoo "
"generates a credit note containing a single line using the configured "
"*Refund Adjustment Product* found in the Shopify account form's *Default "
"Products* tab as *E-commerce Refund Adjustment*."
msgstr ""
"當 Shopify 建立沒有關聯退貨明細行的退款時，Odoo 會產生一張包含單一明細行的貸"
"記單，當中會使用在 Shopify 帳戶表單 *預設產品* 分頁中配置為 *電子商務退款調"
"整* 的 *退款調整產品*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:326
msgid "Creating a refund"
msgstr "建立退款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:329
msgid ""
"Refunds created using a refund adjustment product are not visible via the "
":icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Invoices` smart button on the sales "
"order, since the button only shows credit notes made against an invoice line"
" of the sales order. Refunds using the refund adjustment product apply to "
"the whole invoice, rather than a specific invoice line. To view the refund, "
"users must go to :menuselection:`Invoicing app --> Customers --> Refunds`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:335
msgid ""
"The Shopify connector automatically syncs refund data for orders in Shopify "
"accounts with :guilabel:`Create Invoice` enabled. It tracks refunds with "
"returned products, or as manual refunds on the whole order. Refunds can be "
"created partially or fully, depending on the products and quantities "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"對於已啟用 :guilabel:`建立發票` 的 Shopify 賬戶，Shopify 連接器會自動同步該等"
"賬戶中訂單的退款資料。系統會追蹤附帶退貨產品的退款，或針對整張訂單的手動退款"
"。視乎所選產品及數量，系統可建立部分退款或全額退款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:340
msgid ""
"Refunds are created only when the associated order has one invoice, and that"
" invoice is in the *Posted* stage. If these conditions are not met, the "
"refund is skipped."
msgstr ""
"只有當相關訂單擁有一張發票，且該發票處於*已過賬*階段時，系統才會建立退款。若"
"未符合這些條件，則會略過退款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:343
msgid ""
"To create a refund without a product return, go to the desired order in "
"Shopify and click :guilabel:`Refund`. On the *Refund* page, verify the "
"refund products and quantities, then click :guilabel:`Refund` to confirm and"
" close the refund."
msgstr ""
"如要在不退貨的情況下建立退款，請在 Shopify 前往相關訂單，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`退款`。在 *退款* 頁面上，核對退款產品及數量，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`退款` 以確認並完成退款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:347
msgid "Example of the Refund page in Shopify."
msgstr "Shopify 退款頁面的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:351
msgid "Syncing and processing a refund in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 同步及處理退款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:358
msgid ""
"On the :abbr:`SO (sales order)`, there are :icon:`fa-truck` "
":guilabel:`Delivery` and :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Invoices` "
"smart buttons. The :doc:`fiscal position "
"<../../../finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>` from the original "
"order is applied to both the invoice and the generated credit note, to "
"ensure consistent tax treatment."
msgstr ""
"在 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）` 上，設有 :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`交貨` 及 "
":icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`發票` 智能按鈕。原訂單的 :doc:`財務狀"
"況 <../../../finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>` 會同時套用至發票及所"
"產生的貸記單，以確保稅務處理一致。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:363
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Invoices` smart button. The "
"credit note line item is highlighted in blue and shows a negative amount in "
"the :guilabel:`Total` column. Click the credit note to open the form."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`發票` 智能按鈕。貸記單細項會以藍色"
"醒目顯示，並在 :guilabel:`總計` 欄顯示負數金額。點擊該貸記單即可開啟表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:367
msgid "Example of the Invoices page for a Shopify SO in the Sales app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:385
msgid "Example of a processed credit note in the Sales app."
msgstr "「銷售」應用程式中已處理貸記單的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:389
msgid "Optional: Canceling a delivery associated with a refund"
msgstr "選用：取消與退款相關的送貨"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:391
msgid ""
"When a customer requests a refund before the order is shipped, the order "
"sync still generates an invoice and a warehouse delivery form in Odoo. Users"
" must manually cancel the delivery form when processing the refund."
msgstr ""
"當客戶在訂單發貨前要求退款時，訂單同步仍會在 Odoo 中產生發票及倉庫送貨單。用"
"戶在處理退款時必須手動取消該送貨單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:395
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Shopify: Accounts` and"
" select the desired Shopify account. Click the :icon:`fa-dollar` "
":guilabel:`Orders` smart button and select the desired :abbr:`SO (sales "
"order)`. Click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button, then "
"click :guilabel:`Cancel` on the warehouse delivery form."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> Shopify：帳戶`，然後選取所需的 "
"Shopify 帳戶。按一下 :icon:`fa-dollar` :guilabel:`訂單` 智能按鈕，並選取所需"
"的 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）`。按一下 :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`送貨` 智能按鈕"
"，然後在倉庫送貨表單上按一下:guilabel:`取消`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:400
msgid ""
"The warehouse delivery form's status changes to :guilabel:`Cancelled`. Since"
" the products were never shipped to the customer, there is no need to do a "
"manual stock adjustment."
msgstr ""
"倉庫送貨單的狀態會變更為 :guilabel:`已取消`。由於產品從未運送給顧客，因此無需"
"手動調整庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:404
msgid "Refund amount reconciliation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:406
msgid ""
"Shopify and Odoo may calculate refund totals differently due to rounding, "
"taxes, or other adjustments. To maintain accounting accuracy:"
msgstr ""
"由於四捨五入、稅項或其他調整，Shopify 與 Odoo 計算的退款總額可能有所不同。為"
"確保會計準確性："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:409
msgid ""
"Odoo compares the refund total received from Shopify with the amount "
"computed from the generated credit note."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會將從 Shopify 收到的退款總額，與根據所產生貸項通知單計算出的金額作比較"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:411
msgid ""
"If a difference is detected, an additional adjustment line is automatically "
"added using the configured *Adjustment Product*."
msgstr "如果偵測到差異，系統會自動使用已設定的*調整產品*新增額外調整項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:413
msgid ""
"This ensures that the final credit note total exactly matches the refund "
"amount received from Shopify."
msgstr "這樣可確保最終貸記單總額與從 Shopify 收到的退款金額完全相符。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:417
msgid "Special cases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:419
msgid ""
"**Insufficient refund data**: If a refund does not contain enough "
"information to be processed correctly, Odoo does not create the refund "
"automatically. Instead, an activity is scheduled on the order to notify the "
"user and allow manual review."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:422
msgid ""
"**Restocked items but missing returns**: If Shopify reports restocked items "
"as part of a refund, but no corresponding return exists in Odoo, Odoo "
"schedules an activity on the order. This prompts the user to manually verify"
" and synchronize inventory movements, to maintain stock consistency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:425
msgid ""
"**Refund deleted after synchronization**: If a refund that was previously "
"fetched from Shopify is later deleted in Shopify, subsequent refunds for the"
" same order are not synchronized, to avoid data inconsistency."
msgstr ""
"**同步後刪除退款**：如果先前從 Shopify 擷取的退款紀錄其後在 Shopify 中被刪除"
"，系統將不會同步同一訂單的後續退款，以免出現資料不一致的情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:428
msgid ""
"**Fulfillment scope**: Refunds associated with unsupported fulfillment flows"
" are not processed automatically."
msgstr "**履行範圍**：系統不會自動處理與不受支援的履行流程相關的退款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/fulfillment.rst:432
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:465
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:256
msgid ":doc:`../shopify_connector`"
msgstr ":doc:`../shopify_connector`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:10
msgid "Shopify order management"
msgstr "Shopify 訂單管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:12
msgid ""
"Once a :doc:`Shopify account is configured <setup>`, products, orders, and "
"inventory can be synchronized between Shopify and Odoo, either automatically"
" through scheduled actions or manually from the account's "
":guilabel:`Operations` tab."
msgstr ""
"一旦:doc:`Shopify 帳戶設定完成 <setup>`，即可在 Shopify 與 Odoo 之間同步產品"
"、訂單及庫存。你可透過排程動作自動同步，或在帳戶的:guilabel:`操作`分頁手動同"
"步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Tutorial: Shopify connector account form overview <shopify-account-form-"
"overview_>`_"
msgstr "`教學：Shopify 連接器帳戶表單概覽 <shopify-account-form-overview_>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:24
msgid ""
"It is recommended to create products, also referred to as *Offers*, in Odoo "
"externally (for example, by importing the catalog or using another preferred"
" method), and ensure that categories and sales taxes are properly configured"
" for accurate results. Refer to the following instructions for adding "
"products to the **Sales** app."
msgstr ""
"建議在 Odoo 透過外部方式（例如匯入目錄或使用其他偏好方式）建立產品（亦稱為 "
"*優惠* ），並確保已正確設定類別及銷售稅，以取得準確結果。請參閱以下指示，了解"
"如何在 **銷售** 應用程式中新增產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:29
msgid ""
":ref:`New Odoo users with no existing products <shopify/manage/new-odoo-"
"users>`"
msgstr ":ref:`未有現有產品的新 Odoo 用戶 <shopify/manage/new-odoo-users>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:30
msgid ""
":ref:`Existing Odoo users with products <shopify/manage/existing-odoo-"
"users>`"
msgstr ":ref:`已擁有產品的現有 Odoo 用戶 <shopify/manage/existing-odoo-users>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:35
msgid "Product matching logic"
msgstr "產品配對邏輯"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:37
msgid ""
"When an order sync or a *Fetch Products* action is done, Odoo goes through "
"the following logic to match Shopify and Odoo products:"
msgstr ""
"當執行訂單同步或 *擷取產品* 操作時，Odoo 會按照以下邏輯配對 Shopify 與 Odoo "
"產品："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:40
msgid ""
"When an offer is pulled with the same SKU as the internal reference, it is "
"automatically mapped."
msgstr "當擷取到的優惠項目與內部參考具有相同 SKU 時，系統會自動將其對應。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:41
msgid ""
"If an SKU exists in Shopify but not in Odoo, it is linked to the default "
"E-commerce Sale product (archived). The product's category and taxes must be"
" configured manually afterward."
msgstr ""
"如果某個 SKU 存在於 Shopify 但不存在於 Odoo，它將會連結至預設的電子商務銷售產"
"品（已封存）。之後必須手動設定該產品的類別及稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:43
msgid ""
"Shopify product variants are **not** created using Odoo attribute lines; "
"they are created as independent products. Attribute values are **not** "
"handled in this flow."
msgstr ""
"Shopify 產品變體**不會**使用 Odoo 屬性行建立，而是作為獨立產品建立。此流"
"程**不會**處理屬性值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:49
msgid "New Odoo users with no existing products"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:51
msgid ""
"To import a Shopify product catalog into an empty Odoo database, sign in to "
"the Shopify store admin account. Go to the :guilabel:`Products` page and "
"click :guilabel:`Export`. The *Export products* pop-up window displays."
msgstr ""
"要將 Shopify 產品目錄匯入至空白的 Odoo 資料庫，請登入 Shopify 商店管理員帳戶"
"。前往 :guilabel:`產品` 頁面並點擊 :guilabel:`匯出`。*匯出產品* 彈出視窗隨即"
"顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:55
msgid ""
"Refer to Shopify's `exporting products instructions <shopify-export-"
"products_>`_ to complete the export action and then edit the export document"
" to comply with Odoo's recommended :ref:`import data guidelines "
"<essentials/export_import_data/import-data>`. Ensure that each product "
"variant has its own SKU. For more guidance, refer to the :ref:`product "
"matching logic <shopify/manage/product-matching>` used by the Shopify "
"connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:64
msgid "Existing Odoo users with products"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:66
msgid ""
"Depending on the scenario, there are two methods to add Shopify products "
"into an existing product catalog in the **Sales** app: :ref:`adding a new "
"Shopify product to the Sales app <shopify/manage/add-new-products>` and "
":ref:`syncing existing products in Shopify and the Sales app "
"<shopify/manage/sync-existing-products>`."
msgstr ""
"視乎情況，有兩種方法可將 Shopify 產品新增至 **銷售** 應用程式中的現有產品目錄"
"：:ref:`將新的 Shopify 產品新增至銷售應用程式 <shopify/manage/add-new-"
"products>` 及 :ref:`同步 Shopify 與銷售應用程式中的現有產品 <shopify/manage/"
"sync-existing-products>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:74
msgid "Adding a new Shopify product to the Sales app"
msgstr "將新的 Shopify 產品新增至銷售應用程式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:77
msgid ""
"Refer to the :ref:`Shopify connector's product matching logic "
"<shopify/manage/product-matching>` when adding Shopify products with "
"variants."
msgstr ""
"新增含變體的 Shopify 產品時，請參閱 :ref:`Shopify 連接器的產品配對邏輯 "
"<shopify/manage/product-matching>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:80
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Create Products` setting assists with product creation and "
"mapping when using :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch Orders` or :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch Products` to pull Shopify data. Refer to the "
":ref:`shopify/setup/administrative-settings` section of the *Shopify "
"Connector configuration* page for the setting description."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:85
msgid ""
"To enable the setting, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration -->"
" Shopify: Accounts` and select the desired Shopify account form. Click the "
"*Configuration* tab, and in the *Products* section, select the "
":guilabel:`Create Products` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"若要啟用此設定，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> Shopify：帳"
"戶`，並選擇所需的 Shopify 帳戶表單。點擊 *配置* 分頁，然後在 *產品* 部分中，"
"勾選 :guilabel:`建立產品` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:89
msgid ""
"Then, in the *Operations* tab, either click the :icon:`fa-refresh` "
":guilabel:`Fetch Orders` or :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch Products` "
"action to sync products. Both actions follow the same logic when the "
":guilabel:`Create Products` setting is enabled; the difference is in which "
"products are fetched."
msgstr ""
"然後，在 *操作* 分頁中，按一下 :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`擷取訂單` 或 "
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`擷取產品` 操作以同步產品。啟用 :guilabel:`建立"
"產品` 設定時，兩個操作會採用相同邏輯；兩者的分別在於所擷取的產品不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:94
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch Products` pulls all products in the "
"Shopify store that are created or updated after the specified date."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`擷取產品` 會從 Shopify 商店擷取在指定日期之後建"
"立或更新的所有產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:96
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch Orders` pulls orders created or updated "
"after the specified date. Only products that are in the pulled sales orders "
"are updated or created."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`擷取訂單` 會擷取在指定日期之後建立或更新的訂單"
"。只有已擷取銷售訂單中的產品會獲得更新或建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:100
msgid ""
"After selecting a :guilabel:`Created/Updated after` date for the :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch Products` action, a warning pop-up displays. Users"
" can still continue the action after closing the pop-up and clicking "
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch Products`."
msgstr ""
"選擇:guilabel:`建立／更新日期晚於`日期以進行:icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`擷"
"取產品`操作後，畫面會顯示警告彈出視窗。用戶關閉彈出視窗並按一下:icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`擷取產品`後，仍可繼續該操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:105
msgid ""
"There are 100 products in the **Sales** app, and 20 of them were created or "
"updated after January 1. Five sales orders were created in January, "
"containing eight products in their sales order lines."
msgstr ""
"**銷售** 應用程式中有 100 項產品，其中 20 項是在 1 月 1 日之後建立或更新的。"
"1 月份建立了五張銷售訂單，其銷售訂單明細中包含八項產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:109
msgid ""
"To update all products, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration "
"--> Shopify: Accounts` and select the desired Shopify account form. In the "
"*Operations* tab, click next to the :guilabel:`Created/Updated after` field "
"(also referred to as the *Last Products Sync*), and in the calendar pop-up, "
"select `January 1` and click :guilabel:`Apply`. Click :icon:`fa-refresh` "
":guilabel:`Fetch Products`, and Odoo pulls all 20 products created or "
"updated after January 1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:115
msgid ""
"Example of the Last Products Sync field configured to January 1 for Fetch "
"Products."
msgstr "為「提取產品」將「上次產品同步」欄位設定為 1 月 1 日的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:118
msgid ""
"To update products via sales orders, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Shopify: Accounts` and select the desired Shopify account "
"form. On the *Operations* tab, click next to the :guilabel:`Created/Updated "
"between` (Order sync) field and set the date range to `January 1` - `January"
" 31` in the calendar pop-up, then click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""
"如要透過銷售訂單更新產品，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> "
"Shopify：帳戶`，並選取所需的 Shopify 帳戶表單。在 *操作* 分頁中，點擊 "
":guilabel:`建立/更新時間介乎`（訂單同步）欄位旁邊的位置，在彈出的日曆視窗中將"
