#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:251
msgid "Customer matching"
msgstr "客戶配對"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:253
msgid ""
"The **Sales** app matches Shopify customers with Odoo customers using the "
"email and billing name configured on the :ref:`contact form "
"<contacts/contact-form>`. If no match is found, a new customer is created. "
"The billing and shipping addresses are created as child contacts."
msgstr ""
"**銷售**應用程式會使用:ref:`聯絡人表單 <contacts/contact-form>`上設定的電郵地"
"址及帳單名稱，將 Shopify 客戶與 Odoo 客戶配對。若找不到相符項目，系統會建立新"
"客戶，並將帳單地址及送貨地址建立為子聯絡人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:258
msgid ""
"If state or country mapping fails, an activity is created for manual "
"correction."
msgstr "如果州／省或國家／地區對應失敗，系統會建立一項活動以供手動修正。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:263
msgid "Price and tax mapping"
msgstr "價格及稅項對應"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:265
msgid ""
"The **Sales** app automatically detects the currency from the Shopify order."
" :doc:`Fiscal positions "
"<../../../finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>` handle tax mapping "
"from products in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"**銷售**應用程式會自動從 Shopify 訂單偵測貨幣。:doc:`稅務規則 <../../../"
"finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>`會處理 Odoo 產品的稅項對應。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:268
msgid ""
"Shipping is added as separate order lines using configurable default "
"products. Discounts are directly deducted from product or shipping prices "
"before subtotal calculation, to reduce rounding differences between Shopify "
"and Odoo totals. Original Shopify product prices are shown in the line "
"description only when they differ from the final imported price (or when a "
"discount is applied)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:274
msgid ""
"The discrepancy check is performed only on the final total of the sales "
"order, regardless of which taxes are applied on the order lines. Since "
"Shopify may use different rounding methods, differences of a few cents (for "
"example, 0.01) can occur between Shopify and Odoo due to rounding. Such "
"rounding discrepancies are resolved by adding an adjustment line for the "
"difference amount."
msgstr ""
"系統只會對銷售訂單的最終總額執行差異檢查，而不論訂單資料行套用了哪種稅項。由"
"於 Shopify 可能採用不同的捨入方法，Shopify 與 Odoo 之間可能會因捨入而出現幾仙"
"（例如 0.01）的差異。這類捨入差異會透過為差額新增調整行來解決。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:281
msgid ""
"If the auto-invoice configuration on the account is enabled, invoices are "
"generally created automatically for paid orders. However, for orders where a"
" discrepancy adjustment is added, the invoice is **not** created "
"automatically, even if the order is marked as paid in Shopify."
msgstr ""
"若賬戶已啟用自動開立發票設定，系統通常會為已付款的訂單自動建立發票。不過，對"
"於已加入差異調整的訂單，即使該訂單在 Shopify 中標記為已付款，系統亦 **不會** "
"自動建立發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:288
msgid "Enable auto-create taxes"
msgstr "啟用自動建立稅項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:290
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Create Taxes` feature allows Odoo to automatically create "
"taxes when importing orders from Shopify. When enabled (default behavior), "
"Odoo tries to find a matching tax and creates one if no match exists. When "
"disabled, taxes are determined using the order's fiscal position and the "
"product's configured taxes in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"透過 :guilabel:`建立稅項` 功能，Odoo 可於從 Shopify 匯入訂單時自動建立稅項。"
"啟用時（預設行為），Odoo 會嘗試尋找相符的稅項，如沒有相符項目便會建立新稅項。"
"停用時，系統會根據訂單的財務位置及產品在 Odoo 中設定的稅項來釐定稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:295
msgid ""
"To enable the :guilabel:`Create Taxes` feature, go to :menuselection:`Sales "
"app --> Configuration --> Shopify: Accounts` to select the desired Shopify "
"account form. On the *Configuration* tab, enable the :guilabel:`Create "
"Taxes` checkbox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:299
msgid ""
"Then either wait for the scheduled order sync (occurs every 10 minutes) or "
"manually sync orders by clicking the :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch "
"Orders` button on the *Operations* tab."
msgstr ""
"然後，你可等待系統定時同步訂單（每 10 分鐘進行一次），或在 *操作* 分頁點擊 "
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`擷取訂單` 按鈕手動同步訂單。"

