msgid "Push inventory to Shopify"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:312
msgid ""
"When :guilabel:`Update Inventory` is enabled, Odoo pushes stock to Shopify "
"after orders are pulled (manually or automatically)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:315
msgid "Only stock from the mapped Odoo location is pushed."
msgstr "系統只會推送來自已對應 Odoo 位置的庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:316
msgid ""
"The free quantity (*Quantity on Hand* minus *Reserved Quantity*) of the "
"product at the mapped location is pushed to Shopify as the available "
"quantity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:318
msgid ""
"Only products that satisfy all inventory synchronization settings are "
"considered for synchronization."
msgstr "只有符合所有庫存同步設定的產品，才會納入同步範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:322
msgid ""
"Odoo does not push the inventory of all products every time. Only the stock "
"updated after the last inventory sync is pushed. When a product's quantity "
"changes at the mapped location, Odoo detects it and automatically pushes "
"that product's updated inventory in the next scheduled action."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 不會每次都推送所有產品的庫存，只會推送自上次庫存同步後有更新的庫存。當產"
"品在對應位置的數量有所變更時，Odoo 會偵測到此變更，並在下次排程動作中自動推送"
"該產品的更新庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:328
msgid ""
"Make sure the inventory levels on both platforms are in sync first to avoid "
"discrepancies during synchronization."
msgstr "請先確保兩個平台上的庫存水平保持一致，以免在同步期間出現差異。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:331
msgid ""
"To push stock manually, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration "
"--> Shopify: Accounts` to select the desired Shopify account form. Click the"
" :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Push Inventory` button in the *Operations* "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"如要手動推送庫存，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> Shopify："
"帳戶`，並選擇所需的 Shopify 帳戶表單。在 *作業* 分頁中，按一下 :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`推送庫存` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:338
msgid "Pull inventory from Shopify"
msgstr "從 Shopify 提取庫存"

