msgstr "庫存會根據對應的位置及對應的報價更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:351
msgid ""
"The on-hand quantity of a specific product at a specific location, fetched "
"from Shopify, is updated in Odoo as the on-hand quantity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:353
msgid ""
"If the location or the offer related to the inventory is not found in Odoo, "
"that inventory record is ignored and not updated."
msgstr ""
"如果在 Odoo 中找不到與該庫存相關的地點或優惠，系統會忽略該庫存記錄，不會進行"
"更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:359
msgid "Configure multi-location support"
msgstr "配置多地點支援"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:361
msgid ""
"The Shopify connector supports multi-location inventory management from Odoo"
" to Shopify. To use it, Shopify locations must be mapped to Odoo stock "
"locations. Odoo pushes the quantity available from the mapped location to "
"the corresponding Shopify location."
msgstr ""
"Shopify 連接器支援由 Odoo 至 Shopify 的多地點庫存管理。使用此功能前，必須將 "
"Shopify 地點對應至 Odoo 庫存地點。Odoo 會將已對應地點的可用數量推送至相應的 "
"Shopify 地點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:365
msgid ""
"To map Odoo locations to Shopify locations and keep track of stock, navigate"
" to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Shopify: Accounts`. "
"Select the desired Shopify account. Click the *Configuration* tab. In the "
"*Stock* section, select an existing location or click :guilabel:`Search "
"more` and click :guilabel:`New` to create a :ref:`new location "
"<inventory/use_locations/create-new-locations>`."
msgstr ""
"要將 Odoo 位置對應至 Shopify 位置並追蹤庫存，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用"
"程式 --> 配置 --> Shopify：帳戶`。選擇所需的 Shopify 帳戶。點擊 *配置* 分頁。"
"在 *庫存* 部分，選擇現有位置，或點擊 :guilabel:`搜尋更多` 並點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增` 以建立 :ref:`新位置 <inventory/use_locations/create-new-"
"locations>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:371
msgid ""
"Example of the Stock Location field in the Configuration tab of the Shopify "
"account form."
msgstr "Shopify 帳戶表單中「設定」分頁內「庫存位置」欄位的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:374
msgid ""
"After the next scheduled *Fetch Orders* action, a :guilabel:`Locations` "
"smart button displays. To change the *Stock Location*, click the "
":guilabel:`Locations` smart button. The *Locations* page displays all the "
"Shopify locations in the :guilabel:`Name` column and the **Inventory** app "
"locations in the :guilabel:`Stock Location` column."
msgstr ""
"在下次排程的 *擷取訂單* 動作後，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`位置` 智能按鈕。要更改 "
"*庫存位置*，請點擊 :guilabel:`位置` 智能按鈕。*位置* 頁面會在 :guilabel:`名"
"稱` 欄顯示所有 Shopify 位置，並在 :guilabel:`庫存位置` 欄顯示 **庫存** 應用程"
"式的位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:379
msgid ""
"To sync the two locations together, enable the :guilabel:`Stock "
"Synchronization` checkbox. This controls exactly which inventory is synced "
"back to Shopify or pulled from Shopify. The :guilabel:`Stock "
"Synchronization` checkbox is available per offer, per location, per account,"
" and on the individual product (:guilabel:`Track Inventory`)."
msgstr ""
"要同步兩個位置，請啟用 :guilabel:`庫存同步` 核取方塊。這可精確控制哪些庫存會"
"同步回 Shopify 或從 Shopify 提取。:guilabel:`庫存同步` 核取方塊可按優惠、位置"
"、帳戶及個別產品（:guilabel:`追蹤庫存`）提供。"

