msgid "Logging system"
msgstr "記錄系統"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:418
msgid ""
"The Shopify connector creates detailed API logs on the Shopify account form "
"via the :guilabel:`Logs` smart button. Users **must** be in :ref:`developer "
"mode <developer-mode>` for the :guilabel:`Logs` smart button to display."
msgstr ""
"Shopify 連接器會在 Shopify 帳戶表單上透過 :guilabel:`日誌` 智能按鈕建立詳細"
"的 API 日誌。用戶 **必須** 處於 :ref:`開發者模式 <developer-mode>`，系統才會"
"顯示 :guilabel:`日誌` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:422
msgid ""
"The *Logs* page displays every log entry in list view and organizes them "
"with the following columns:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:424
msgid ":guilabel:`Created on`: The date and time the log entry was created."
msgstr ":guilabel:`建立日期`：建立日誌項目的日期及時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:425
msgid ":guilabel:`Created by`: OdooBot, which displays as `1`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`建立者`：OdooBot，顯示為 `1`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:426
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Database Name`: The name of the Odoo database where the entry was"
" recorded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:427
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Displays either :guilabel:`Server` or :guilabel:`Client`. "
":guilabel:`Server` is used for entries raised while Odoo is exchanging data "
"with Shopify through the API (fetching orders or products, pushing inventory"
" or fulfillments). :guilabel:`Client` is used for entries raised while Odoo "
"processes data it has already received, and for entries where a "
"synchronization step was skipped."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:432
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: Identifies the e-commerce account the entry belongs to, in"
" the form Account name-ID (for example, My Shopify Store-3), where ID is the"
" database ID of the account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`名稱`：識別該項目所屬的電子商務帳戶，格式為「帳戶名稱-ID」（例如："
"My Shopify Store-3），其中 ID 為該帳戶的資料庫 ID。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:434
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Level`: Indicates whether the log is an :guilabel:`Error` or "
":guilabel:`Info`. :guilabel:`Error` means the action failed; the fetch, the "
"record processing, or the update sent to Shopify did not complete. "
":guilabel:`Info` means the action completed without failing, but a step was "
"deliberately skipped, for example an order ignored because of its Shopify "
"status, or an invoice not created because the order has several payment "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`級別`：表示日誌屬於 :guilabel:`錯誤` 或 :guilabel:`資"
"訊`。:guilabel:`錯誤` 表示操作失敗；擷取、記錄處理或傳送至 Shopify 的更新未能"
"完成。:guilabel:`資訊` 表示操作已完成且未發生失敗，但系統刻意跳過了某個步驟，"
"例如因訂單的 Shopify 狀態而略過該訂單，或因訂單包含多筆付款交易而未建立發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:439
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Path`: The origin of the entry. Connector entries always display "
"as :guilabel:`E-Commerce`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`路徑`：記錄的來源。連接器記錄一律會顯示為 :guilabel:`電子商務`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:441
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Line`: The line number of the entry. Connector entries always "
"display `1`, since the line is not tracked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:443
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Function`: Displays the function that is the source of the entry,"
" such as `_sync_orders`, `_process_order_data`, or "
"`_auto_create_credit_note`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`函式`：顯示作為該記錄來源的函式，例如 "
"`_sync_orders`、`_process_order_data` 或 `_auto_create_credit_note`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:447
msgid ""
"Developer mode can be enabled using :kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`K` and typing "
"`debug`."
msgstr "你可以按下 :kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`K` 並輸入 `debug`，以啟用開發人員模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:449
msgid ""
"To view the log entry form, click an entry. The form is comprised of two "
"sections: *Creation Details* and *Logging Details*."
msgstr ""
"要查看日誌記錄表單，請點擊其中一項記錄。該表單包含兩個部分：*建立詳情*及*日誌"
"詳情*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:452
msgid ""
"The *Creation Details* section lists the :guilabel:`Created on`, "
":guilabel:`Created by`, and :guilabel:`Database Name`. The *Logging Details*"
" section lists the :guilabel:`Type`, :guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Level`, "
":guilabel:`Path`, :guilabel:`Line`, :guilabel:`Function`, and "
":guilabel:`Message`. The :guilabel:`Message` is a detailed description of "
"the error."
msgstr ""
"*建立詳情* 部分列出 :guilabel:`建立日期`、:guilabel:`建立者` 及 :guilabel:`資"
"料庫名稱`。*記錄詳情* 部分列出 :guilabel:`類型`、:guilabel:`名"
"稱`、:guilabel:`級別`、:guilabel:`路徑`、:guilabel:`行`、:guilabel:`函式` 及 "
":guilabel:`訊息`。:guilabel:`訊息` 是錯誤的詳細說明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:458
msgid "Email notifications"
msgstr "電郵通知"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/manage.rst:460
msgid ""
"In case of critical failures (order import failure, stock update failure, or"
" fulfillment failure), automated email notifications are sent to the "
"assigned salesperson or administrator. This ensures immediate visibility and"
" corrective action."
msgstr ""
"若發生嚴重錯誤（匯入訂單失敗、更新庫存失敗或履行訂單失敗），系統會自動向指定"
"的銷售人員或管理員發送電郵通知。這能確保團隊即時掌握情況並採取修正行動。"

