msgstr "配置管理設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:127
msgid ""
"The *Configuration* tab settings can be changed anytime, even while the "
"Shopify account is connected. All changes are logged in the account form's "
"chatter. These settings control how data is imported and processed."
msgstr ""
"即使已連結 Shopify 帳戶，你仍可隨時更改 *配置* 分頁的設定。所有變更都會記錄在"
"帳戶表單的通訊欄中。這些設定控制系統如何匯入及處理資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:131
msgid ""
"Select any of the listed features to configure the administrative settings:"
msgstr "選取任何列出的功能以配置系統管理設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create Products`: Controls what happens when a Shopify product is"
" pulled and no Odoo product matches it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建立產品`：控制當拉取 Shopify 產品但沒有相符的 Odoo 產品時，系統會"
"執行的操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:136
msgid ""
"Odoo always looks for a product whose internal reference equals the Shopify "
"SKU. When :guilabel:`Create Products` is enabled, if no match is found, a "
"new Odoo product is created from the Shopify data. Once an offer is mapped, "
"its title and Shopify identifiers are refreshed on every pull, regardless of"
" this setting. However, the mapped Odoo product itself is not updated "
"afterward, since cost, description, weight, barcode, and image are only read"
" when the product is first created. When :guilabel:`Create Products` is "
"disabled, the offer is mapped to the default :guilabel:`E-commerce Sale` "
"product instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:145
msgid "A product must have an SKU in Shopify to be imported into Odoo."
msgstr "產品必須在 Shopify 中設有 SKU，才能匯入至 Odoo。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stock Location`: A stock location must be defined and must belong"
" to the selected company. If not configured, Odoo automatically creates a "
"dedicated Shopify stock location. In a multi-location setup, complete the "
"new Shopify account form and connect to Shopify. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`Fetch Locations` button in the *Operations* tab to pull "
"all locations from Shopify. By default, they are all mapped to the defined "
"default warehouse location, and the mapping can be changed as needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Update Inventory`: When enabled, the scheduled action that pushes"
" inventory from Odoo to Shopify runs for this account. If users do not want "
"to push inventory from Odoo to Shopify, keep it disabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`更新庫存`：啟用後，系統會為此帳戶執行將庫存從 Odoo 推送至 Shopify "
"的排程動作。若用戶不想將庫存從 Odoo 推送至 Shopify，請保持停用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Journal` and :guilabel:`Sales Journal`: Journals used to "
"register payments and create sales orders during order synchronization. If "
"no existing journal is found, Odoo automatically uses one of the journals of"
" the current company."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`付款日記賬` 及 :guilabel:`銷售日記賬`：用於在訂單同步期間登記付款"
"及建立銷售訂單的日記賬。如找不到現有日記賬，Odoo 會自動使用目前公司的其中一個"
"日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:159
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team` and :guilabel:`Salesperson`: The responsible team and"
" user assigned to orders imported from Shopify. If no existing team is "
"found, Odoo automatically creates one and assigns it to the account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售團隊`及:guilabel:`銷售人員`：獲指派處理從 Shopify 匯入之訂單的"
"負責團隊及使用者。如找不到現有團隊，Odoo 會自動建立一個團隊並將其指派給該帳戶"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:162
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create Taxes`: Import taxes from Shopify with the sales order. "
"Odoo tries to find a matching tax and creates one if no match exists. If "
"disabled, taxes are determined using the order's fiscal position and the "
"product's configured taxes in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建立稅項`：隨銷售訂單從 Shopify 匯入稅項。Odoo 會嘗試尋找相符的稅"
"項，若找不到則會建立一項。若停用，系統會根據訂單的財務位置及產品在 Odoo 中設"
"定的稅項來決定稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:165
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create Invoice`: Automatically create an invoice and register "
"payment when importing paid orders from Shopify. If disabled, the user must "
"manually create the invoice from the sales order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`建立發票`：從 Shopify 匯入已付款訂單時，自動建立發票並登記付款。若"
"停用此選項，用戶必須從銷售訂單手動建立發票。"

