#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:244
msgid "Multi-store and multi-company management"
msgstr "多商店及多公司管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:246
msgid ""
"The **Sales** app supports configuring multiple Shopify stores under the "
"same Odoo company. Each Shopify store requires a Shopify account form and "
"operates independently, with its own sync timestamps and configuration. All "
"orders, products, and inventory are scoped per connected Shopify store. "
"Multi-company environments are supported, with a separate configuration per "
"company."
msgstr ""
"**銷售**應用程式支援在同一 Odoo 公司下配置多個 Shopify 商店。每個 Shopify 商"
"店都需要填寫一個 Shopify 帳戶表單並獨立運作，各自擁有獨立的同步時間戳記及配置"
"。所有訂單、產品及庫存均按已連接的 Shopify 商店劃分範圍。系統支援多公司環境，"
"每間公司皆可獨立配置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopify_connector/setup.rst:251
msgid ""
"The only exception is when the same internal Odoo location is synced with "
"more than one Shopify store location: the Shopify account forms share the "
"same inventory from that Odoo location instead of having separate inventory "
"scopes."
msgstr ""
"唯一的例外情況是當同一個 Odoo 內部庫存位置與多於一個 Shopify 商店位置同步：這"
"些 Shopify 帳戶表單會共用該 Odoo 位置的相同庫存，而非各自擁有獨立的庫存範圍。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector.rst:5
msgid "TikTok Connector"
msgstr "TikTok 連接器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:3
msgid "TikTok Shop connector features"
msgstr "TikTok Shop 連接器功能"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **TikTok Shop Connector** streamlines your social commerce operations by"
" synchronizing orders, products, and inventory between TikTok Shop and Odoo."
" It reduces manual data entry between systems and enhances order management,"
" enabling efficient tracking of TikTok Shop sales within Odoo."
msgstr ""
"**TikTok Shop 連接器** 透過在 TikTok Shop 與 Odoo 之間同步訂單、產品及庫存，"
"簡化您的社交商務營運。它可減少系統之間的人手資料輸入並強化訂單管理，讓您可在 "
"Odoo 內有效追蹤 TikTok Shop 銷售。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:12
msgid "The **TikTok Shop Connector** is able to:"
msgstr "**TikTok Shop 連接器** 能夠："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:14
msgid ""
"Synchronize (TikTok Shop to Odoo) all confirmed orders (:abbr:`FBS "
"(Fulfilled By Seller)`) with status :guilabel:`AWAITING_SHIPMENT` or "
":guilabel:`AWAITING_COLLECTION`, including:"
msgstr ""
"同步（從 TikTok Shop 至 Odoo）所有已確認訂單（:abbr:`FBS (由賣家配送)`），其"
"狀態為 :guilabel:`AWAITING_SHIPMENT` 或 :guilabel:`AWAITING_COLLECTION`，包括"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:18
msgid "Item ID reference"
msgstr "項目 ID 參考"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:21
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Odoo to TikTok Shop) all available product quantities "
"(:abbr:`FBS (Fulfilled By Seller)`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:24
msgid ""
"Synchronize the TikTok Shop product catalog into Odoo or map existing Odoo "
"products to TikTok Shop Item IDs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:27
msgid ""
"Arrange package pickups with supported logistics providers directly in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:29
msgid ""
"Support multiple seller accounts, with one TikTok Shop marketplace (shop) "
"per account."
msgstr "支援多個賣家帳戶，每個帳戶對應一個 TikTok Shop 市場（商店）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:32
msgid ""
"The **TikTok Shop Connector** is designed to synchronize sales orders and "
"inventory. Other actions, such as downloading monthly fee reports, handling "
"disputes, or issuing refunds **must** be managed from the *TikTok Shop "
"Partner Center*, as usual."
msgstr ""
"**TikTok Shop 連接器** 旨在同步銷售訂單及庫存。其他操作（例如下載每月費用報表"
"、處理爭議或辦理退款）仍 **必須** 如常透過 *TikTok Shop Partner Center* 管理"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:37
msgid "TikTok Shop supported marketplaces"
msgstr "TikTok Shop 支援的市場"

