#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:3
msgid "TikTok Shop order management"
msgstr "TikTok Shop 訂單管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:5
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to manage TikTok Shop orders, inventory, deliveries,"
" and sales reporting within Odoo using the **TikTok Shop Connector**. It "
"covers product catalog mapping, order synchronization, delivery processes, "
"platform fee handling, and sales analysis to streamline social commerce "
"operations across supported regions."
msgstr ""
"本指南說明如何使用 **TikTok Shop 連接器**，在 Odoo 中管理 TikTok Shop 的訂單"
"、庫存、送貨及銷售報告。內容涵蓋產品目錄對應、訂單同步、送貨流程、平台費用處"
"理及銷售分析，助你簡化支援地區內的社交商務營運。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:13
msgid ""
"To ensure accurate synchronization, it is crucial to properly map the SKUs "
"between the platforms. The TikTok Shop :guilabel:`Seller SKU` must "
"correspond exactly to the :guilabel:`Internal Reference` of the product or "
"its variant."
msgstr ""
"為確保同步準確，在各平台之間正確對應 SKU 至關重要。TikTok Shop 的 "
":guilabel:`賣家 SKU` 必須與產品或其變體的 :guilabel:`內部參考` 完全一致。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:20
msgid ""
"If you are starting a new Odoo database and your products exist only on "
"TikTok Shop, you can import your TikTok Shop product catalog into Odoo. In "
"*TikTok Shop Partner Center*, use the :menuselection:`Bulk action --> Bulk "
"edit products` feature to export your product catalog, including TikTok Shop"
" Item IDs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:27
msgid ""
"Then import the exported catalog into Odoo via :menuselection:`Inventory -->"
" Products --> Import`. Map the TikTok Shop Item ID to the :guilabel:`Product"
" external ID` field in Odoo to link your TikTok Shop and Odoo products."
msgstr ""
"然後透過 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 產品 --> 匯入` 將匯出的目錄匯入 Odoo。請將 "
"TikTok Shop 商品 ID 對應至 Odoo 中的 :guilabel:`產品外部 ID` 欄位，以連結您"
"的 TikTok Shop 與 Odoo 產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:34
msgid ""
"If you have an existing product catalog in Odoo, map your TikTok Shop "
"listings to these products. Use the :guilabel:`Sync Catalog` button in Odoo "
"to automatically match active products."
msgstr ""
"如果你在 Odoo 中已有現成的產品目錄，可將你的 TikTok Shop 上架商品對應至這些產"
"品。使用 Odoo 中的:guilabel:`同步目錄`按鈕，即可自動配對有效產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:39
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the :guilabel:`Upload in bulk` button in the seller center "
"can be used if products from Odoo need to be synchronized to TikTok."
msgstr ""
"此外，如需將 Odoo 的產品同步至 TikTok，亦可使用賣家中心的 :guilabel:`批量上"
"傳` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:43
msgid ""
"Product catalog synchronization is an automated process. Ensure accurate SKU"
" mapping to avoid duplication errors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:49
msgid ""
"Orders are automatically fetched from TikTok Shop and synchronized in Odoo "
"at regular intervals."
msgstr "系統會定期自動從 TikTok Shop 提取訂單，並在 Odoo 中同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:51
msgid ""
"Synchronization Scope: Only orders with status :guilabel:`AWAITING_SHIPMENT`"
" or :guilabel:`AWAITING_COLLECTION` are fetched, as these require shipping "
"action."
msgstr ""
"同步範圍：只會擷取狀態為 :guilabel:`AWAITING_SHIPMENT` 或 "
":guilabel:`AWAITING_COLLECTION` 的訂單，因為這些訂單需要執行送貨操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:53
msgid ""
"Processing Intervals: Sync orders and Webhooks of order status changes are "
"processed every 5 minutes. Shipping labels are processed every 15 minutes. "
"Inventory is processed every 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"處理間隔：同步訂單及訂單狀態變更的 Webhook 每 5 分鐘處理一次。送貨標籤每 15 "
"分鐘處理一次。庫存每 30 分鐘處理一次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:55
msgid ""
"Status Updates: When an order is canceled on TikTok Shop, its status updates"
" in Odoo. However, canceling an order in Odoo does not reflect on TikTok "
"Shop."
msgstr ""
"狀態更新：當訂單在 TikTok Shop 上取消時，其狀態會在 Odoo 中更新。然而，在 "
"Odoo 中取消訂單並不會反映在 TikTok Shop 上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:57
msgid ""
"Customer Creation: For each synchronized order, Odoo uses the buying "
"identifier to search for existing contacts. If none exist, Odoo creates a "
"sales order and a contact."
msgstr ""
"建立客戶：對於每張同步的訂單，Odoo 會使用購買識別碼搜尋現有聯絡人。如果找不到"
"任何聯絡人，Odoo 會建立一張銷售訂單及一個聯絡人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:59
msgid ""
"Default Products: If a product or delivery carrier isn't found, Odoo uses a "
"default product or carrier found by :guilabel:`Internal Reference` or name, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"預設產品：若找不到產品或送貨承運商，Odoo 會使用分別透過 :guilabel:`內部參考` "
"或名稱找到的預設產品或承運商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:70
msgid ""
"To synchronize an order whose status hasn't changed since the last "
"synchronization, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales --> Configuration --> "
"Shops` and click the target TikTok Shop. Modify the :guilabel:`Last Order "
"Synchronization` date to a date prior to the order's last status change. "
"Finally, click the :guilabel:`Sync Orders` button to trigger immediate "
"synchronization."
msgstr ""
"若要同步自上次同步後狀態未有變更的訂單，請前往:menuselection:`銷售 --> 設"
"定 --> 商店`，然後按一下目標 TikTok 商店。將:guilabel:`上次訂單同步`日期修改"
"為訂單最後一次狀態變更之前的日期。最後，按一下:guilabel:`同步訂單`按鈕以觸發"
"即時同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:78
msgid ""
"For :abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled By Merchant)` orders, the **TikTok Shop "
"Connector** creates a picking in the :menuselection:`Inventory` app, a sales"
" order, and a customer record, upon synchronization."
msgstr ""
"對於 :abbr:`FBM (賣家自配送)` 訂單，**TikTok Shop 連接器** 會在同步後於 "
":menuselection:`庫存` 應用程式中建立揀貨單、銷售訂單及客戶記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:81
msgid ""
"Arrange Shipment: Confirm the picking in Odoo, then navigate to *TikTok Shop"
" Partner Center* and arrange shipment to generate the shipping label and "
"tracking number."
msgstr ""
"安排發貨：在 Odoo 確認揀貨單，然後前往 *TikTok Shop Partner Center* 安排發貨"
"，以產生送貨標籤及追蹤編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:83
msgid ""
"Fetch Shipping Label: Odoo retrieves the shipping label and tracking number "
"automatically on orders with TikTok status of 'Awaiting Collection', "
"attaching them to the corresponding delivery order. If PDF generation fails,"
" a link to the label is provided."
msgstr ""
"擷取送貨標籤：Odoo 會自動為 TikTok 狀態為「等待取件」的訂單擷取送貨標籤及追蹤"
"編號，並將其附加至相應的送貨單。若 PDF 產生失敗，系統會提供標籤的連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:86
msgid ""
"Validate Stock Out: Validate the stock movement in Odoo to update inventory "
"levels and confirm the order has left the warehouse."
msgstr "驗證出庫：在 Odoo 中驗證庫存移動，以更新庫存數量並確認訂單已離開倉庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:90
msgid "TikTok Shop delivery statuses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Awaiting Shipment`: The order is ready for shipment arrangement."
msgstr ":guilabel:`等待發貨`：訂單已準備好安排發貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Awaiting Collection`: The seller has arranged shipment and "
"received a tracking number from the logistics provider."
msgstr ":guilabel:`等待取件`：賣家已安排付運，並已從物流供應商取得追蹤編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipped`: The parcel has been dropped off or picked up by the "
"logistics provider."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已付運`：包裹已交寄或由物流供應商取件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:96
msgid ":guilabel:`Cancelled`: The order has been canceled."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已取消`：訂單已取消。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pickup Failed`: The logistics provider failed to pick up the "
"parcel and the seller must rearrange shipment."
msgstr ":guilabel:`取件失敗`：物流供應商未能提取包裹，賣家必須重新安排發貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:101
msgid ""
"TikTok Shop requires a tracking reference for each delivery. If the carrier "
"doesn't provide one automatically, set it manually in *TikTok Shop Partner "
"Center*. Check supported logistics providers for the region."
msgstr ""
"TikTok Shop 要求每筆送貨訂單均須提供追蹤參考編號。若承運商未有自動提供，請在 "
"*TikTok Shop Partner Center* 手動設定，並查看該地區支援的物流供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:108
msgid ""
"TikTok Shop orders are automatically created in Odoo as sales orders in the "
"**Sales app**. Shipment can be arranged in *TikTok Shop Partner Center*, "
"including choosing a logistics provider and generating a shipping label. "
"Odoo imports any shipping labels and tracking numbers and associates them "
"with the sales order. Stock movements are confirmed in Odoo to reduce "
"inventory levels. Enabling synchronizing inventory in shop settings pushes "
"stock levels to TikTok shop in order to prevent overselling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:118
msgid ""
"Due to TikTok Shop's policy of not sharing customer email addresses, "
"invoices cannot be sent directly from Odoo. Instead, invoices can be "
"generated in Odoo and manually uploaded to *TikTok Shop Partner Center*. "
":ref:`Register a bank journal <accounting/journals/bank-cash-cc>` (e.g., "
"\"TikTok Payments\") with a suspense account. Since TikTok shop processes "
"batch payments, all invoices linked to a payment in Odoo can be processed by"
" :ref:`creating a batch payment <accounting/batch/creation>`."
msgstr ""
"由於 TikTok Shop 的政策不會分享客戶電郵地址，因此無法直接從 Odoo 傳送發票。不"
"過，你可在 Odoo 產生發票，並手動上載至 *TikTok Shop Partner Center*。請 "
":ref:`登記銀行日記賬 <accounting/journals/bank-cash-cc>`（例如：「TikTok "
"Payments」），並設定暫記賬戶。由於 TikTok Shop 會處理批量付款，因此 Odoo 中所"
"有連結至某筆付款的發票，均可透過 :ref:`建立批量付款 <accounting/batch/"
"creation>` 來處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:126
msgid "Analyzing TikTok Shop sales with Odoo's reporting"
msgstr "使用 Odoo 報表分析 TikTok Shop 銷售"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:128
msgid ""
"Odoo's dashboard consolidates sales data from all channels. To analyze "
"TikTok Shop sales specifically, set up sales teams. Go to "
":menuselection:`Sales --> Configuration --> Shops` and assign a dedicated "
"sales team to each TikTok Shop for isolated reporting. Use the dashboard "
"filters to view sales data for the assigned TikTok sales team."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的儀表板整合了所有渠道的銷售數據。如要專門分析 TikTok Shop 的銷售情況，"
"請設定銷售團隊。前往:menuselection:`銷售 --> 配置 --> 商店`，並為每個 TikTok "
"Shop 指派專屬的銷售團隊，以便獨立製作報表。使用儀表板篩選器，即可查看所指派 "
"TikTok 銷售團隊的銷售數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:3
msgid "TikTok Shop connector configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:5
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to set up the **TikTok Shop Connector** in Odoo to "
"integrate TikTok Shop Seller accounts and manage multiple marketplaces "
"efficiently. Follow these steps to configure the account, synchronize the "
"product catalog, and prepare the shop for go-live."
msgstr ""
"本指南說明如何在 Odoo 中設定 **TikTok Shop 連接器**，以整合 TikTok Shop 賣家"
"賬戶並有效管理多個網上商城。請按照以下步驟設定賬戶、同步產品目錄，並為網店正"
"式上線作好準備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:12
msgid "Configuring a *TikTok Shop Connector* requires:"
msgstr "設定 *TikTok Shop 連接器* 需要："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:14
msgid "A TikTok Shop Seller account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:15
msgid ""
"A valid email address and password for the *TikTok Shop Partner Center*."
msgstr "有效的 *TikTok Shop Partner Center* 電郵地址及密碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:16
msgid "A brief description of the integration purpose."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:17
msgid "An Odoo database URL and tester account credentials."
msgstr "Odoo 資料庫網址及測試員帳戶憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:20
msgid ""
"The *TikTok Shop Partner Center* account used for API access is separate "
"from a TikTok Shop Seller account."
msgstr ""
"用於 API 存取的 *TikTok Shop Partner Center* 帳戶，與 TikTok Shop 賣家帳戶是"
"分開獨立的。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:24
msgid "Create a TikTok Shop Partner Center account"
msgstr "建立 TikTok Shop Partner Center 帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:26
msgid ""
"Navigate to :guilabel:`TikTok Shop Partner Center`, and go to the TikTok "
"Shop platform. Log in with the TikTok account or create a new one if needed."
msgstr ""
"前往 :guilabel:`TikTok Shop 合作夥伴中心`，並進入 TikTok Shop 平台。使用 "
"TikTok 帳戶登入，或在有需要時建立新帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:29
msgid "Registration page for TikTok Shop Partner Center."
msgstr "TikTok Shop 合作夥伴中心的註冊頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:32
msgid ""
"Once logged in, select :guilabel:`Add category and market` and fill in all "
"the information. Choose :guilabel:`App developers (ISV)` as the "
":guilabel:`Business category`. Fill the registration region and target "
"market, then click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"登入後，選擇 :guilabel:`新增類別及市場` 並填寫所有資料。選擇 :guilabel:`應用"
"程式開發商（ISV）` 作為 :guilabel:`業務類別`。填寫註冊地區及目標市場，然後按 "
":guilabel:`下一步`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:36
msgid "Business category setup on TikTok Shop Partner Center."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:39
msgid ""
"Fill the :guilabel:`Partner Name` and contact email, then click "
":guilabel:`Get app key now`. Submit the application and wait for approval."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:43
msgid "Create an app on TikTok Shop Partner Center"
msgstr "在 TikTok Shop 合作夥伴中心建立應用程式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:45
msgid ""
"To obtain the :guilabel:`Service ID`, :guilabel:`App Key`, and "
":guilabel:`App Secret` for Odoo integration, log in to the *TikTok Shop "
"Partner Center*, navigate to :menuselection:`App & Service` on the sidebar. "
"Click :guilabel:`Manage` next to the app name. Choose :guilabel:`Custom` as "
"the :guilabel:`App & service type`. Select :guilabel:`eCommerce Management /"
" Connectors` as the :guilabel:`Service category`. Enter the name of the app "
"and market. Ensure :guilabel:`Enable API` is ON. Enter the redirect URL as "
"`https://<your database url>.odoo.co m/tiktok/return_from_authorization`."
msgstr ""
"如要取得用於 Odoo 整合的 :guilabel:`服務 ID`、:guilabel:`App Key` 及 "
":guilabel:`App Secret`，請登入 *TikTok Shop Partner Center*，並在側邊欄前往 "
":menuselection:`應用程式與服務`。按一下應用程式名稱旁邊的 :guilabel:`管理`。"
"選擇 :guilabel:`自訂` 作為 :guilabel:`應用程式與服務類型`。選擇 :guilabel:`電"
"子商務管理 / 連接器` 作為 :guilabel:`服務類別`。輸入應用程式名稱及市場。確保 "
":guilabel:`啟用 API` 已開啟。將重新導向網址輸入為 `https://<your database "
"url>.odoo.co m/tiktok/return_from_authorization`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:53
msgid "App and service type configuration settings in TikTok Shop."
msgstr "TikTok Shop 中的應用程式及服務類型配置設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:56
msgid "Go to :guilabel:`Manage API` in the created app."
msgstr "前往已建立應用程式中的:guilabel:`管理 API`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:58
msgid "Manage API button under the basic information section."
msgstr "基本資料部分下的管理 API 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:61
msgid "Make sure to enable these services:"
msgstr "請確保啟用以下服務："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:63
msgid ":guilabel:`Finance Information`,"
msgstr ":guilabel:`財務資料`，"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:64
