#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Learn how to manually create a renewal quotation for an Odoo subscription, "
"from confirming the order to invoicing and registering payment."
msgstr ""
"了解如何為 Odoo 訂閱手動建立續約報價單，涵蓋確認訂單、開立發票以至登記付款的"
"完整流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:3
msgid "Renew subscriptions"
msgstr "續訂訂閱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:9
msgid ""
"Subscription renewal is the process customers follow when they willingly "
"choose to continue a subscription product or service. Subscribers go through"
" the renewal process at different intervals -- weekly, monthly, annually, "
"etc. -- depending on the duration of the agreed-upon contract. Most "
"companies that offer subscriptions prefer to automate the renewal process "
"for customers. However, manual subscription renewals are still used in some "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"訂閱續訂是指客戶自願選擇繼續使用訂閱產品或服務時所進行的流程。訂閱者會根據雙"
"方協定合約的期限，按不同週期（每週、每月、每年等）進行續訂。大多數提供訂閱服"
"務的公司都傾向為客戶自動化續訂流程。不過，在某些情況下仍會採用手動訂閱續訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:15
msgid ""
"With the Odoo **Subscriptions** application, a company can manage all of its"
" subscriptions in one place. Renewals can be processed automatically or "
"manually, include additional products or upsells per renewal order, and be "
"filtered in batch views to locate customers who need to renew their "
"subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"透過 Odoo **訂閱** 應用程式，公司可在單一平台管理所有訂閱項目。系統支援自動或"
"手動處理續訂、在每張續訂訂單中加入額外產品或追加銷售項目，並可在批次檢視中篩"
"選，以找出需要續訂的顧客。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:21
msgid "Create a renewal manually"
msgstr "手動建立續訂"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:23
msgid ""
"In order to create a renewal quotation, there are certain prerequisites that"
" a subscription must meet."
msgstr "訂閱必須符合特定先決條件，方可建立續訂報價單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:26
msgid "A quotation with a subscription product must be confirmed."
msgstr "必須確認包含訂閱產品的報價單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:27
msgid "A configured *recurring plan* must be selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:28
msgid ""
"Payment from the customer for the initial subscription must be invoiced and "
"registered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:30
msgid ""
"To check if an existing subscription quotation meets the prerequisites, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Subscriptions --> "
"Quotations` and select the desired quotation from the list. Properly "
"configured subscriptions show as being in the :guilabel:`Sales Order` stage,"
" have an :guilabel:`In Progress` tag, and have the :guilabel:`Renew` button "
"in the row of buttons directly above the order form."
msgstr ""
"如要檢查現有訂閱報價單是否符合先決條件，請前往:menuselection:`訂閱應用程"
"式 --> 訂閱 --> 報價單`，並在清單中選取所需的報價單。正確配置的訂閱會顯示為處"
"於:guilabel:`銷售訂單`階段、帶有:guilabel:`進行中`標籤，並在訂單表單正上方的"
"按鈕列中顯示:guilabel:`續訂`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:36
msgid "Renew button on subscription sales order with Odoo Subscriptions."
msgstr "Odoo 訂閱應用程式中訂閱銷售訂單上的續訂按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:39
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Renew` button is clicked, Odoo instantly presents a new "
"renewal quotation, complete with a :guilabel:`Renewal Quotation` tag. "
"Important reference information like the start date and next invoice date "
"are automatically added to the renewal quotation's chatter."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`續期` 按鈕後，Odoo 會即時顯示新的續期報價單，並附帶 "
":guilabel:`續期報價單` 標籤。開始日期和下一次開立發票日期等重要參考資料，會自"
"動新增至續期報價單的通訊欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:43
msgid ""
"From here, follow the standard sales flow to :ref:`confirm the quotation "
"<sales/create_quotations/send-and-confirm>`, :doc:`invoice the order "
"<../../sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy>`, and :ref:`register payment "
"<finance/accounting/register-payment-invoice-bill>`."
msgstr ""
"之後，請按照標準銷售流程 :ref:`確認報價單 <sales/create_quotations/send-and-"
"confirm>`、:doc:`為訂單開立發票 <../../sales/sales/invoicing/"
"invoicing_policy>` 及 :ref:`登記付款 <finance/accounting/register-payment-"
"invoice-bill>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:48
msgid ""
"Once the renewal quotation is confirmed, it becomes a sales order and a "
":icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`Sales History` smart button appears at the top of "
"the page. When the :icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`Sales History` smart button is "
"clicked, Odoo loads a new page showcasing the different sales orders "
"attached to this subscription, along with their individual "
":guilabel:`Subscription Status`."
msgstr ""
"續訂報價單一經確認，便會成為銷售訂單，頁面頂部亦會顯示 :icon:`fa-usd` "
":guilabel:`銷售記錄` 智能按鈕。點擊 :icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`銷售記錄` 智能"
"按鈕後，Odoo 會載入新頁面，展示關聯至此訂閱的各張銷售訂單，以及它們各自的 "
":guilabel:`訂閱狀態`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:54
msgid "Sales history showing Subscription Status."
msgstr "顯示訂閱狀態的銷售記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:59
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:73
msgid ":doc:`../sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations`"
msgstr ":doc:`../sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/renewals.rst:60
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:74
msgid ":doc:`../sales/sales_quotations/get_paid_to_validate`"
msgstr ":doc:`../sales/sales_quotations/get_paid_to_validate`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:3
msgid "Subscription reports"
msgstr "訂閱報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:8
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Subscriptions** app provides a series of reporting pages to help "
"companies analyze how subscriptions are performing. There are four different"
" reports: *Subscriptions Analysis*, *Retention Analysis*, *MRR Breakdown*, "
"and *MRR Analysis*."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **訂閱**應用程式提供一系列報表頁面，協助企業分析訂閱業務的表現。系統共有"
"四種不同的報表：*訂閱分析*、*留存分析*、*MRR 明細*及 *MRR 分析*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:12
msgid ""
"Each report is viewed in its own dedicated reporting page, and shares common"
" elements with the others, as well as unique elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:16
msgid "Reporting page elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:18
msgid "The following sections describe elements found on each reporting page."
msgstr "以下章節介紹每個報告頁面上的元素。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:23
msgid ""
"*Filters* are used to narrow down metrics to show specific analytics. *Group"
" By* is used to gather the data from specific sections into groups for more "
"organized analysis. Visit the :doc:`Search, filter, and group records "
"<../../essentials/search>` documentation for more information about custom "
"filters and groups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`My Subscriptions`: Show subscriptions created by the current "
"database user."
msgstr ":guilabel:`我的訂閱`：顯示由目前資料庫用戶建立的訂閱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quotations`: Show subscriptions that are currently in the "
