msgstr ":guilabel:`推薦來源`：按訂閱的推薦來源將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: Groups the results by the customer to which a "
"subscription belongs."
msgstr ":guilabel:`客戶`：按訂閱所屬的客戶將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country`: Groups the results by the country from which a "
"subscription originated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`國家/地區`：按訂閱來源的國家/地區將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Template`: Groups the results by the quotation template used as "
"the basis for the subscription."
msgstr ":guilabel:`範本`：按作為訂閱基礎的報價單範本將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Plan`: Groups the results by the recurring plan type of the "
"subscription."
msgstr ":guilabel:`計劃`：按訂閱的定期計劃類型將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product`: Groups the results by the products included in the "
"subscription."
msgstr ":guilabel:`產品`：按訂閱中包含的產品將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`First Contract Date`: Groups the results by the date the "
"subscription was created."
msgstr ":guilabel:`首次合約日期`：按建立訂閱的日期將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Next Invoice Date`: Groups the results by the next invoice date "
"of the subscription."
msgstr ":guilabel:`下次發票日期`：按訂閱的下次發票日期將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`End Date`: Groups the results by end date of the subscription, "
"whether or not the subscription has ended."
msgstr ":guilabel:`結束日期`：不論訂閱是否已經結束，均按訂閱的結束日期將結果分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom Group`: Allows the database user to create a custom group "
"with numerous options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:73
msgid "Views"
msgstr "檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:75
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Subscription Analysis`, :guilabel:`MRR Breakdown`, and "
":guilabel:`MRR Analysis` reporting pages, three different view options are "
"located in the upper-right corner. There are no other view options available"
" on the :guilabel:`Retention Analysis` reporting page."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`訂閱分析`、:guilabel:`MRR 明細` 和 :guilabel:`MRR 分析` 報告頁"
"面中，右上角提供三個不同的檢視選項。:guilabel:`留存分析` 報告頁面則沒有其他檢"
"視選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:79
msgid "The available view options are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:81
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`Graph` view: Displays the total number of "
"subscriptions in a graph, allowing for quick visual comparisons of "
"subscriptions. This is the default view across the reporting pages."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`圖表` 檢視：以圖表顯示訂閱總數，方便快速進行"
"訂閱項目的視覺比較。此為各報告頁面的預設檢視模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:84
msgid ""
":icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`Pivot` view: Displays the detailed Monthly "
"Recurring Revenue by both stage and month in a customizable table. This can "
"be modified to display information into more detailed categories, such as "
"salesperson, referrer, and more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:87
msgid ""
":icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`List` view: Displays the subscriptions in a "
"detailed list, allowing for easy viewing of detailed individual records."
msgstr ""
":icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`列表` 檢視：以詳細列表形式顯示訂閱，方便查看"
"個別記錄的詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:93
msgid ""
"The pivot view has its own metric-specific :guilabel:`Measures` drop-down "
"menu of data-related options to choose from when creating a subscriptions "
"report."
msgstr ""
"建立訂閱報表時，樞紐分析檢視設有專屬的指標專用:guilabel:`度量`下拉式選單，提"
"供多項資料相關選項供選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:96
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Measures` button is clicked, a series of selectable "
"measures becomes available, via a drop-down menu. When any of the options "
"are selected from the :guilabel:`Measures` drop-down menu, the chosen "
"metrics related to that specific measure appear on the pivot table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:100
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Subscriptions Analysis` page, those measures are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Cost`: Measures the cost of the subscriptions for the "
"business as determined by the untaxed amount minus the margin."
msgstr ":guilabel:`預期成本`：衡量企業的訂閱成本，按未稅金額減去利潤計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:104
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Monthly Recurring`: Measures the gross monthly recurring revenue "
"for the subscriptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity`: Measures the number of products included in the "
"subscriptions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`數量`：計算訂閱中包含的產品數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recurring Revenue`: Measures the recurring revenue for the "
"subscriptions based on their next recurrence period (weekly, monthly, "
"annually, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`經常性收入`：根據訂閱的下一個週期（每週、每月、每年等）計算訂閱的"
"經常性收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unit Price`: Measures the price for the business of each product "
"in the subscription."
msgstr ":guilabel:`單價`：計算訂閱中各項產品對企業的價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Untaxed Amount Delivered`: Measures the cost of the physical "
"products in the subscription that aren't subject to a tax and have been "
"delivered to the customer."
msgstr ":guilabel:`未稅已交付金額`：量度訂閱中無須課稅並已交付予客戶的實體產品成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Untaxed Total`: Measures the total cost of the products in the "
"subscription that aren't subject to a tax."
msgstr ":guilabel:`未稅總額`：衡量訂閱中無須課稅的產品總成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Yearly Recurring`: Measures the projected yearly revenue for the "
"subscriptions, regardless of their recurrence period."
msgstr ":guilabel:`每年經常性`：量度訂閱項目的預計年度收入，不論其循環週期為何。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:116
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`MRR Breakdown` and :guilabel:`MRR Analysis` pages, those "
"measures are:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`MRR 明細` 及 :guilabel:`MRR 分析` 頁面中，該等計量指標為："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Active Subscriptions Change`: Measures the net change in active "
"subscriptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARR Change`: Measures the total change in annual recurring "
"revenue for all subscriptions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`ARR 變動`：計算所有訂閱的年度經常性收入總變動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:121
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MRR Change`: Measures the total change in monthly recurring "
"revenue for all subscriptions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`MRR 變動`：衡量所有訂閱的每月經常性收入總變動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:124
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Retention Analysis` page offers wholly unique measures, "
"including:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount To Pay In POS`: Measures the amount to be paid in still-"
"to-be-invoiced subscriptions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`POS 應付金額`：衡量尚未開立發票的訂閱項目中應支付的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`Margin`: Measures the total margin of the subscriptions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`毛利`：計算訂閱的總毛利。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prepayment percentage`: Measures the percentage of subscriptions "
"revenue that has been prepaid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Weight`: Measures the shipping weight of physical "
"products included in the subscriptions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`運送重量`：量度訂閱項目中所包含實物產品的運送重量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Count`: Measures the count of non-subscription products in the "
"subscriptions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`數量`：計算訂閱中非訂閱產品的數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:136
msgid "Reporting pages"
msgstr "報表頁面"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:138
msgid ""
"To access, analyze, and customize various reports related to subscriptions, "
"navigate to the :menuselection:`Subscriptions` app and click the "
":guilabel:`Reporting` drop-down menu in the header to reveal the following "
"reporting pages:"
msgstr ""
"要存取、分析及自訂與訂閱相關的各種報告，請前往:menuselection:`訂閱`應用程式，"
"並點擊頂部的:guilabel:`報告`下拉式選單，以顯示以下報告頁面："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:142
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Subscriptions Analysis`: Accessible by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Reporting --> Subscriptions`. Users "
"can view specific data related to recurring subscriptions, quantity of "
"subscriptions, in-progress or paused subscriptions, and more. By default, "
"the :guilabel:`Subscriptions Analysis` page uses the :guilabel:`Graph` view "
"with the :guilabel:`Bar Chart` option and :guilabel:`Stacked` options "
"enabled. The :guilabel:`In Progress or Paused` filters and "
":guilabel:`Recurring` grouping are also enabled by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`訂閱分析`：前往 :menuselection:`訂閱應用程式 --> 報告 --> 訂閱` 即"
"可開啟。用戶可檢視週期性訂閱、訂閱數量、進行中或已暫停的訂閱等特定資料。預設"
"情況下，:guilabel:`訂閱分析` 頁面會使用 :guilabel:`圖表` 檢視，並已啟用 "
":guilabel:`棒形圖` 及 :guilabel:`堆疊` 選項。系統亦預設啟用 :guilabel:`進行中"
"或已暫停` 篩選條件及 :guilabel:`週期性` 分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:148
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Retention Analysis`: Accessible by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Reporting --> Retention`. The "
":guilabel:`Retention Analysis` reporting page differs from the other "
"**Subscriptions** app reporting pages in that it does **not** provide any "
"additional view options. The data on this page is only presented in a "
"customizable data chart. The :guilabel:`Count` measure option is selected by"
" default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`留存分析`：可前往 :menuselection:`訂閱應用程式 --> 報告 --> 留存` "
"開啟。:guilabel:`留存分析` 報告頁面與 **訂閱** 應用程式的其他報告頁面不同，"
"它 **不** 提供任何額外檢視選項。此頁面的數據僅以可自訂的數據圖表呈現，並預設"
"選取 :guilabel:`計數` 計量選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MRR Breakdown`: Accessible by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Reporting --> MRR Breakdown`. This "
"page clearly divides |MRR| and |ARR| metrics for subscriptions into various "
"graphs, lists, and charts. By default, the data displayed on the "
":guilabel:`MRR Breakdown` reporting page is in graph view with the "
":guilabel:`Bar Chart` and :guilabel:`Stacked` options selected. The "
":guilabel:`MRR Change` measure option is selected by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MRR 明細`：可透過前往 :menuselection:`訂閱應用程式 --> 報告 --> "
"MRR 明細` 開啟。此頁面清楚將訂閱的 |MRR| 及 |ARR| 指標分門別類，以各種圖形、"
"列表及圖表顯示。預設情況下，系統會以圖表檢視模式顯示 :guilabel:`MRR 明細` 報"
"告頁面的資料，並已選取 :guilabel:`棒形圖` 及 :guilabel:`堆疊` 選項。預設亦已"
"選取 :guilabel:`MRR 變動` 測量選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/reports.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MRR Analysis`: Accessible by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Reporting --> MRR Analysis`. This page"
" offers a time-based collection of analytics showcasing how subscription "
"|MRR| and |ARR| have changed over the course of any given period of time. By"
" default, the data displayed on the :guilabel:`MRR Analysis` reporting page "
"is in graph view, with the :guilabel:`Line Chart`, :guilabel:`Stacked`, and "
":guilabel:`Cumulative` options enabled. The :guilabel:`MRR Change` measure "
"option is selected by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:3
msgid "Subscriptions with deliveries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:5
msgid ""
"Subscriptions and subscription products are compatible with deliveries. With"
" some minor configuration, it is possible to offer customers subscriptions "
"of regularly delivered physical goods such as a meal delivery box or "
"magazine."
msgstr ""
"訂閱及訂閱產品與送貨服務相容。只需進行少量設定，即可向客戶提供定期配送的實體"
"商品訂閱服務，例如餐盒或雜誌。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:10
msgid ""
"An independent coffee shop offers local customers a monthly coffee bean "
"subscription service. Each month, Odoo automatically generates a sales order"
" and invoice in the Sales app and a delivery order in the Inventory app to "
"ensure that the coffee beans get delivered to subscribed customers."
msgstr ""
"一間獨立咖啡店為本地顧客提供每月咖啡豆訂閱服務。每個月，Odoo 都會在「銷售」應"
"用程式中自動建立銷售訂單及發票，並在「庫存」應用程式中建立交貨單，以確保咖啡"
"豆能送到訂閱顧客手中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:18
msgid ""
"Selling deliverable subscription products requires that two different apps "
"be :ref:`installed <general/install>`: the **Subscriptions** app and the "
"**Inventory** app. The **Subscriptions** app allows for the creation and "
"management of subscription products while the **Inventory** app, in addition"
" to managing inventory, allows for adding shipping information to quotations"
" and automatically creating delivery orders when invoices are created."
msgstr ""
"銷售可交付的訂閱產品需要 :ref:`安裝 <general/install>` 兩個不同的應用程式"
"：**訂閱** 應用程式及 **庫存** 應用程式。**訂閱** 應用程式可用於建立及管理訂"
"閱產品；而 **庫存** 應用程式除了管理庫存外，亦可在報價單中加入送貨資訊，並在"
"建立發票時自動建立送貨單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:24
msgid ""
"After installing both **Subscriptions** and **Inventory**, enter the "
"**Settings** app, search for \"delivery\", and tick the :doc:`Delivery "
"Methods "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration>`"
" box in the :guilabel:`Inventory` section. This allows for adding the cost "
"of shipping to quotations and invoices."
msgstr ""
"同時安裝 **訂閱** 及 **庫存** 後，請進入 **設定** 應用程式，搜尋「delivery」"
"，並勾選 :doc:`送貨方式 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration>` 方格（位於 :guilabel:`庫存` 部分）。"
"這樣即可將運費加入至報價單及發票中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:31
msgid "Creating a subscription delivery product"
msgstr "建立訂閱配送產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:33
msgid ""
"To create a deliverable subscription product, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Products --> Products`. Click an "
"existing product or create a new one and set the :guilabel:`Product Type` to"
" `Goods`. Click the :guilabel:`Recurring prices` tab and :guilabel:`Add a "
"line`. Choose an existing :guilabel:`Recurring plan` or create a new one, "
"and add a :guilabel:`Pricelist`."
msgstr ""
"要建立可配送的訂閱產品，請前往:menuselection:`訂閱應用程式 --> 產品 --> 產"
"品`。點擊現有產品或建立新產品，並將:guilabel:`產品類型`設為 `貨品`。點"
"擊:guilabel:`循環價格`分頁，然後點擊:guilabel:`新增項目`。選擇現有"
"的:guilabel:`循環計劃`或建立新計劃，並新增:guilabel:`價格表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:39
msgid "Choosing a delivery method"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:41
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Delivery "
"Methods`. By default there is only one delivery method available: Standard "
"delivery. Businesses with more substantial delivery needs can :doc:`create "
"new delivery methods "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>`"
" or :doc:`add third-party shipping carrier integration "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper>`"
" to their Odoo databases."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`庫存應用程式 --> 配置 --> 送貨方式`。預設只提供一種送貨方"
"式：標準送貨。如企業有更豐富的送貨需求，可在 Odoo 資料庫中:doc:`建立新送貨方"
"式 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>`或:doc:`加入第三方貨運商整合 </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/third_party_shipper>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:50
msgid "Creating a subscription delivery quotation"
msgstr "建立訂閱送貨報價單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:52
msgid ""
"As with creating a subscription delivery product, creating a subscription "
"delivery quotation is similar to :ref:`the regular process "
"<subscriptions/quotations>`, but with an additional step. After entering all"
" other information for the quotation, click the :guilabel:`Add shipping` "
"button in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab. Choose a shipping method from the"
" dropdown and, if necessary, enter the item's weight and dimensions and "
"click the :guilabel:`Get rate` button. Then click :guilabel:`Add` to add the"
" delivery details as a line item to the quotation. From here, proceed with "
"confirming the quotation and generating a sales order as normal."
msgstr ""
"與建立訂閱送貨產品一樣，建立訂閱送貨報價單與:ref:`一般流程 <subscriptions/"
"quotations>`相似，但多了一個步驟。輸入報價單的所有其他資料後，按一"
"下:guilabel:`新增送貨`按鈕（位於:guilabel:`訂單明細`分頁中）。從下拉式選單選"
"取送貨方式；如有需要，輸入項目的重量及尺寸，然後按一下:guilabel:`取得運費`按"
"鈕。接著，按一下:guilabel:`新增`，將送貨詳情作為明細項目加入報價單。之後，按"
"照正常流程確認報價單並產生銷售訂單即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:61
msgid "Validating delivery orders"
msgstr "驗證送貨訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:63
msgid ""
"Once the sales order for a subscription delivery product has been finalized,"
" a :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button appears that opens the delivery order "
"for the sale. After clicking through, if there is enough stock to fulfill "
"the delivery order, it appears as being in the :guilabel:`Ready` stage. If "
"there is not enough stock to fulfill the order, it appears as being "
":guilabel:`In Progress` instead. Once the delivery order is in the Ready "
"stage, click :guilabel:`Validate` to advance the stage to :guilabel:`Done` "
"and automatically generate a delivery slip and send it to the customer."
msgstr ""
"訂閱送貨產品的銷售訂單完成後，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`送貨` 智能按鈕，用以開啟"
"該筆銷售的交貨單。點擊進入後，如果庫存充足以履行該交貨單，訂單會顯示處於 "
":guilabel:`就緒` 階段。如果庫存不足以履行訂單，則會顯示為 :guilabel:`進行"
"中`。當交貨單處於「就緒」階段時，點擊 :guilabel:`驗證`，即可將階段推進至 "
":guilabel:`完成`，並自動產生送貨單發送給客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:72
msgid ":doc:`../subscriptions/renewals`"
msgstr ":doc:`../subscriptions/renewals`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:75
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:74
msgid ":doc:`../sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`../sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_deliveries.rst:76
msgid ":doc:`../subscriptions/automatic_payments`"
msgstr ":doc:`../subscriptions/automatic_payments`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This page explains how loyalty and discount programs apply to subscription "
"products through the Recurring option for conditional rules and rewards, and"
" which program types support Recurring for rules, rewards, or both."
msgstr ""
"本頁說明忠誠及折扣計劃如何透過條件規則及獎賞的「定期」選項套用至訂閱產品，以"
"及哪些計劃類型在規則、獎賞或兩者中支援「定期」選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:8
msgid "Subscriptions and loyalty programs"
msgstr "訂閱及忠誠度計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:10
msgid ""
"In addition to standard pricelists and per-order discounts, the Odoo "
"**Subscriptions** app is compatible with dedicated loyalty and discount "
"programs. Once :ref:`loyalty and discount programs have been enabled "
"<sales/loyalty_discount/configure-settings>`, subscription-specific programs"
" may be created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:16
msgid "Configure loyalty programs for subscriptions"
msgstr "為訂閱設定忠誠度計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:18
msgid ""
"The process for creating a subscription-specific program is similar to "
":ref:`the normal process <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>`, but "
"there are a few considerations to keep in mind. With the **Subscriptions** "
"app installed, both :guilabel:`conditional rules` and :guilabel:`rewards` "
"may be marked as :guilabel:`Recurring`."
msgstr ""
"建立訂閱專用計劃的流程與:ref:`一般流程 <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-"
"programs>`相似，但有幾點需要注意。安裝 **訂閱** 應用程式後，:guilabel:`條件規"
"則`及:guilabel:`獎勵`皆可標記為:guilabel:`週期性`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:23
msgid ""
"However, not every program can be saved and utilized when both checkboxes "
"are checked. Attempting to enable the :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox for "
"*conditional rules* when the program doesn't support it results in a "
"*Validation Error* pop-up when saving the program."
msgstr ""
"不過，並非所有計劃都能在同時剔選兩個核取方塊時儲存及使用。如果計劃不支援，當"
"嘗試為*條件規則*啟用 :guilabel:`定期` 核取方塊時，儲存計劃便會彈出*驗證錯"
"誤*視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:28
msgid "Programs that support recurring rules and rewards"
msgstr "支援週期性規則及獎賞的計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:33
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for both rules and "
"rewards. Enabling the checkbox for rules ensures that customers may earn "
"loyalty points during each renewal period, so long as they meet the "
"requirements. Enabling the checkbox for rewards ensures that earned loyalty "
"points are automatically exchanged for applied rewards during each period."
msgstr ""
"規則及獎賞均可啟用 :guilabel:`重複` 複選框。為規則啟用此複選框後，只要客戶符"
"合條件，即可在每個續期週期內賺取忠誠度積分。為獎賞啟用此複選框後，系統會在每"
"個週期內自動將已賺取的忠誠度積分兌換為已套用的獎賞。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:39
msgid "Next order coupons"
msgstr "下次訂單優惠券"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:41
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for both rules and "
"rewards. Enabling the checkbox for rules ensures that customers may earn "
"coupons good for their next order during each renewal period, so long as "
"they meet the requirements. Enabling the checkbox for rewards ensures that "
"earned coupons are automatically exchanged for applied rewards during each "
"period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:47
msgid "Programs that only support recurring rules"
msgstr "僅支援週期性規則的計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:50
msgid "Coupons"
msgstr "優惠券"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:52
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for rewards only. Doing so"
" ensures that earned coupons are automatically applied during each renewal "
"period."
msgstr ""
"只可為獎勵啟用 :guilabel:`循環` 核取方塊。啟用後，系統會確保在每個續訂週期自"
"動套用已獲得的優惠券。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:58
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for rewards only. Doing so"
" ensures that earned promotional rewards are automatically applied during "
"each renewal period."
msgstr ""
"只有獎勵才可啟用 :guilabel:`定期` 核取方塊。這樣可確保所賺取的促銷獎勵於每個"
"續訂期間自動套用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:62
msgid "Discount code"
msgstr "折扣碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:64
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for rewards only. Doing so"
" ensures that earned discount codes are automatically applied during each "
"renewal period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:68
msgid "Buy X, Get Y"
msgstr "買 X 送 Y"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:70
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for rewards only. Doing so"
" ensures that earned rewards are automatically applied during each renewal "
"period."
msgstr ""
"只有獎勵才可啟用 :guilabel:`定期` 核取方塊。啟用後，系統會在每個續訂期間自動"
"套用已獲得的獎勵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:75
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:84
msgid ":doc:`../sales/products_prices/prices/discounts`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:76
msgid ":doc:`../sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount`"
msgstr ":doc:`../sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Learn how to upsell an existing subscription by adding new products or "
"applying discounts to increase order value."
msgstr "了解如何透過新增產品或套用折扣來對現有訂閱進行追加銷售，從而提高訂單金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:3
msgid "Upsell subscriptions"
msgstr "追加銷售訂閱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:9
msgid ""
"When a subscription sales order is opened, either in the **Sales** or "
"**Subscriptions** apps, that subscription may then be upsold via the "
":guilabel:`Upsell` button at the top of the sales order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:12
msgid ""
"Upsell button for subscription sales orders highlighted in Odoo "
"Subscriptions."
msgstr "在 Odoo 訂閱中突顯顯示的訂閱銷售訂單追加銷售按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:15
msgid ""
"Upselling involves changing a subscription to include a more expensive "
"product or service. Upselling may also involve adding discounts to encourage"
" conversion. Before sending an upsell quotation to a customer, the unit "
"price, taxes, and even discount may all be adjusted. Using the *Upsell* "
"feature allows for greater convenience and continuity when making changes to"
" an exisiting subscription."
msgstr ""
"追加銷售是指更改訂閱內容，以包含價格更高的產品或服務。追加銷售亦可能包括提供"
"折扣以促進轉換。在向客戶傳送追加銷售報價單之前，您可以調整單價、稅項甚至折扣"
"。使用 *追加銷售* 功能，讓您在變更現有訂閱時享有更高的便利性及延續性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:21
msgid "How to upsell a subscription"
msgstr "如何追加銷售訂閱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:24
msgid ""
"A subscription sales order **must** be invoiced before it can be upsold."
msgstr "訂閱銷售訂單 **必須** 先開立發票，才可進行追加銷售。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:26
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Upsell` button to bring up a new quotation form. This "
"quotation's status as an upsell is indicated by the :guilabel:`Upsell` icon "
"in the corner of the form. The chatter for the new form also includes "
"information linking the upsell order to the original order."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`追加銷售` 按鈕，開啟新的報價單表單。表單角落的 :guilabel:`追"
"加銷售` 圖示會顯示此報價單的追加銷售狀態。新表單的訊息欄亦會包含連結追加銷售"
"訂單與原訂單的資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:30
msgid ""
"Chatter for an upsell order showing information related to the original subscription sales\n"
"order."
msgstr ""
"顯示與原訂閱銷售訂單相關資料的\n"
"追加銷售訂單通訊欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:34
msgid ""
"Within the new form, the initial subscription product appears in the *Order "
"Lines* tab. The *Order Lines* tab also features a reminder that recurring "
"products are prorated based on the original subscription's starting date."
msgstr ""
"在新表單中，初始訂閱產品會顯示於 *訂單明細* 分頁。*訂單明細* 分頁亦會顯示提示"
"，說明週期性產品將根據原訂閱的開始日期按比例計算費用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:39
msgid ""
"The prorated amount is **only** applied to *Service* product types. It is "
"**not** applied to *Goods*, even if the message appears and suggests "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:42
msgid ""
"From this new upsell quotation form, new subscription products can be added "
"in the *Order Lines* tab, by clicking :guilabel:`Add a product` and "
"selecting the desired subscription products. Once the desired upsell "
"subscription products have been added, the quotation can be sent to the "
"customer for approval by clicking the :guilabel:`Send` button."
msgstr ""
"在此新的追加銷售報價單表單中，你可在 *訂單明細* 分頁點擊 :guilabel:`新增產"
"品` 並選擇所需的訂閱產品，以加入新的訂閱產品。加入所需的追加銷售訂閱產品後，"
"點擊 :guilabel:`傳送` 按鈕，即可將報價單傳送給客戶批核。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:47
msgid ""
"Once the quotation is confirmed by the customer, the upsold products are "
"added to the initial subscription. The quotation's prices are then prorated "
"based on the current invoicing period's remaining time."
msgstr ""
"客戶確認報價單後，追加銷售的產品便會加入原本的訂閱中。報價單的價格其後會根據"
"目前開票週期的剩餘時間按比例計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:51
msgid ""
"Once the customer approves, click the :guilabel:`Confirm` button on the "
"quotation, making it a sales order. When that's clicked, a :guilabel:`Sales "
"History` smart button appears, displaying how many sales orders are attached"
" to this initial subscription sales order."
msgstr ""
"客戶批准後，按一下報價單上的 :guilabel:`確認` 按鈕，將其轉為銷售訂單。按一下"
"後，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`銷售記錄` 智能按鈕，顯示此初始訂閱銷售訂單所附帶的"
"銷售訂單數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:55
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Sales History` smart button is clicked, Odoo reveals a "
"separate page containing a list of the related sales orders, clearly "
"showcasing their individual :guilabel:`Subscription Status`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`銷售記錄` 智能按鈕後，Odoo 會顯示一個獨立頁面，當中列出相關銷"
"售訂單的清單，並清晰展示每張訂單的 :guilabel:`訂閱狀態`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:59
msgid ""
"The related sales order accessed from the Sales History smart button in Odoo"
" Subscriptions."
msgstr "在 Odoo「訂閱」中，透過「銷售歷史」智能按鈕存取的相關銷售訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:63
msgid "Discount configuration"
msgstr "折扣設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:65
msgid ""
"Discounts can be easily applied to upsold subscriptions to incentivize "
"customers to purchase more expensive or additional subscriptions. To do "
"this, the *Discounts* feature must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"您可輕鬆為追加銷售的訂閱套用折扣，以鼓勵客戶購買價格更高或額外的訂閱計劃。如"
"要執行此操作，必須啟用 *折扣* 功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:68
msgid ""
"To activate the *Discounts* feature, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`. Scroll to the :guilabel:`Pricing` section "
"and tick the checkbox beside :guilabel:`Discounts`. Finally, click "
":guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"要啟用 *折扣* 功能，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`。"
"向下捲動至 :guilabel:`定價` 部分，然後勾選 :guilabel:`折扣` 旁邊的核取方塊。"
"最後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:73
msgid "Create alternative"
msgstr "建立替代方案"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:75
msgid ""
"Customers can also be presented with alternative subscription quotations. "
"Alternative quotations can be created even after sending an upsell quotation"
" to a customer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/upselling.rst:78
msgid ""
"To create an alternative upsell quotation, click the :guilabel:`Create "
"Alternative` button at the top of the upsell quotation form. This opens a "
"new upsell sales order that is linked to the previous upsell and "
"subscription sales orders."
msgstr ""
"要建立替代追加銷售報價單，請按一下追加銷售報價單頂部的 :guilabel:`建立替代方"
"案` 按鈕。系統會開啟一張新的追加銷售訂單，並關聯至先前的追加銷售及訂閱銷售訂"
"單。"
